('l6s8rnsujs','2026-08-21 10:25:51.616374','2026-08-21 10:25:51.616374','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,'Sarah Connor',0,0,'CRM Lead','CRM-LEAD-2026-00001',NULL,'<p>Initial discovery call was very productive. Alice\'s team of ~300 engineers is actively evaluating CRM solutions. She mentioned budget has already been approved — just need to get sign-off from the VP of Sales.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l6s9cmp56g','2026-10-05 10:25:51.616374','2026-10-05 10:25:51.616374','john.demo@example.com','john.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','john.demo@example.com',NULL,'John Parker',0,0,'CRM Lead','CRM-LEAD-2026-00003',NULL,'<p>Carol is temporarily unavailable — on leave until end of month. Her colleague Mark is the interim contact. Revisit in 3 weeks with updated pricing deck.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l6stt3lpca','2026-10-07 10:25:51.616374','2026-10-07 10:25:51.616374','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,'Sarah Connor',0,0,'CRM Lead','CRM-LEAD-2026-00002',NULL,'<p>Bob mentioned they had a poor experience with their last CRM. He emphasized that onboarding support and data migration are top priorities. Need to loop in the customer success team before the next call.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l6thirb4up','2026-09-05 10:25:51.616374','2026-09-05 10:25:51.616374','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,'Sarah Connor',0,0,'CRM Lead','CRM-LEAD-2026-00004',NULL,'<p>Technical demo completed successfully. David\'s engineering team was impressed with the API and custom field options. He\'s requesting pricing for 15 seats — send the proposal by Friday.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
