('l7j4146tho','2026-10-07 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-07 10:25:54.225827','john.demo@example.com','john.demo@example.com',0,0,'Shared','john.demo@example.com',NULL,NULL,0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00006',NULL,'Administrator shared this document with John Parker',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7j7d9656e','2026-10-07 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-07 10:25:54.225827','john.demo@example.com','john.demo@example.com',0,0,'Assigned','john.demo@example.com',NULL,NULL,0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00006',NULL,'Administrator assigned John Parker: Assignment for CRM Deal CRM-DEAL-2026-00006',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7l024p3df','2026-10-11 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-11 10:25:54.225827','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Assigned','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,NULL,0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00007',NULL,'Administrator assigned Sarah Connor: Assignment for CRM Deal CRM-DEAL-2026-00007',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7l8o76nqe','2026-10-11 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-11 10:25:54.225827','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Shared','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,NULL,0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00007',NULL,'Administrator shared this document with Sarah Connor',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7m49b05uq','2026-10-13 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-13 10:25:54.225827','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,'Sarah Connor',0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00001',NULL,'<p>Live demo went well — Alice\'s product team joined and had great questions about workflow automation and bulk import. They want a custom sandbox environment to evaluate with their own data before signing. Following up to arrange access.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7n0ctbim2','2026-10-06 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-06 10:25:54.225827','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,'Sarah Connor',0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00004',NULL,'<p>Qualification call completed with Iris and her co-founder. Small but fast-moving team of 8 engineers. Main concerns are API depth and self-serve onboarding. Sending over the developer docs and scheduling a technical deep-dive.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7ndhbnob1','2026-10-09 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-09 10:25:54.225827','john.demo@example.com','john.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','john.demo@example.com',NULL,'John Parker',0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00003',NULL,'<p>Negotiation call with Henry went long but productive. He’s pushing for a 15% discount on the annual plan citing budget constraints. Legal team is now reviewing the contract — decision expected by end of week.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7ni80ibse','2026-10-11 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-11 10:25:54.225827','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,'Sarah Connor',0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00002',NULL,'<p>David reviewed the proposal with his co-founder. They\'re happy with the pricing but want a 3-month pilot before committing to annual. Checking with management on whether we can offer a pilot discount.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7nr8k5m48','2026-10-14 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-14 10:25:54.225827','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,'Sarah Connor',0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00005',NULL,'<p>Deal closed — Jack signed the contract this morning. Final value $175k annual. Onboarding is scheduled for next Monday. Handoff notes sent to the customer success team. Great result for the quarter!</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7okopnai6','2026-10-04 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-04 10:25:54.225827','sarah.demo@example.com','sarah.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','sarah.demo@example.com',NULL,'Sarah Connor',0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00007',NULL,'<p>Budget was cut for the rest of the year — Leo was very apologetic and said the product was exactly what they needed. Re-added to nurture sequence for Q4. Good candidate for a comeback deal.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('l7oresl5ro','2026-10-08 10:25:54.225827','2026-10-08 10:25:54.225827','john.demo@example.com','john.demo@example.com',0,0,'Comment','john.demo@example.com',NULL,'John Parker',0,0,'CRM Deal','CRM-DEAL-2026-00006',NULL,'<p>Karen\'s team went with a competitor — they had deeper BI integrations that we currently don\'t support. Not a pricing issue. Flagged to product team for roadmap consideration. Karen asked us to follow up in 6 months.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
