\\\">If your AI agent just did something you never asked for, would you want to know where it went wrong?</h3></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"ee e \\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px 0px;\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-left:0px;\\\" class=\\\"edm_outlooklist\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"4\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"min-width:300px;\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"width:100%;border:1px solid rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.17);padding:6px 12px; border-radius:4px;\\\"><a style=\\\"font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:14px;color:inherit;\\\"> Obviously </p></a></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width:100%;border:1px solid rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.17);padding:6px 12px; border-radius:4px;\\\"><a style=\\\"font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:14px;color:inherit;\\\"> Nah, I&#39;ll just redo the prompt </p></a></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width:100%;border:1px solid rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.17);padding:6px 12px; border-radius:4px;\\\"><a style=\\\"font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:14px;color:inherit;\\\"> Not my headache, I&#39;ll switch apps </p></a></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width:100%;border:1px solid rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.17);padding:6px 12px; border-radius:4px;\\\"><a style=\\\"font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size:14px;color:inherit;\\\"> Wait, it can do that? </p></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;padding:0.0px 0px 0.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:12px 0px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table class=\\\"j\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> No more black boxes. Well, at least not if your agents run on Claude. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Quick recap: Back in July, Claude Haiku 4.5 was testing random websites and filled in a tip form on a Philadelphia police site saying it might have information about an unsolved murder. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>It didn&#39;t.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Claude had been told not to log in, buy anything or create accounts, but nobody told it not to submit forms. Anthropic <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>only found it in late September</span></a>. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> And obviously you know about OpenAI&#39;s models <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>getting out of their test setup and into Hugging Face</span></a> in July, and OpenAI has since <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>apologised to Australia</span></a> after its models got into government websites. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The list goes on\\u2026 </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:626px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/72370cc9-0dfd-4026-88c1-1507079cd469/Frame_2147225186.jpg?t=1792123834\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"626\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Every model call / tool it touched / second and token, in order. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Next time an agent does something nobody asked for, you can see the step where it went sideways. Okay, before we get into the agents, here&#39;s the rest of the week. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#687667;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 24.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><b>NEWS</b></h1></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Gemini 4 Argon is out, and it&#39;s cheap until December.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Google&#39;s most capable model is now live for AI Pro and Ultra subscribers in the Gemini app and AI Mode, plus the paid API.<a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>\\u00a0</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Pricing</span></a> is $2 per million input tokens and $10 output until Nov 30, then it doubles. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Still less than OpenAI&#39;s Astra. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:12px 0px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table class=\\\"j\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>OpenAI used its own models to catch a spy.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> An OpenAI engineer was <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>charged</span></a> after a recording device was found wrapped in toilet paper and plugged in behind a TV in an executive conference room. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> OpenAI says its models helped work out where the device came from, and its investigation found who planted it. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:12px 0px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table class=\\\"j\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Grok Voice 3.0 now answers most of Starlink&#39;s support calls on its own.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>xAI says</span></a> its new voice model takes about 20,000 Starlink calls a day and resolves around 70% without a person, still at 8 cents a minute. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> OpenAI&#39;s GPT-Live-1 still scores higher on \\u03c4-Voice, a customer-support benchmark, 74.5% to 71.6%. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:12px 0px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table class=\\\"j\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\