span></a></p></li></ul></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#000000;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><b>So what is OpenTelemetry?</b></h1></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Anthropic now supports it for Claude agents, so an agent&#39;s run shows up in the same dashboards companies already use for the rest of their apps, like Grafana or Langfuse. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Turn on full-content mode and you also see the prompts and answers, meaning what the agent saw rather than what you thought you sent it. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Most of my feed scrolled past this because it wasn&#39;t a new model. <span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>I think it&#39;s the more important launch of the week.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/3ccdfee1-5b6e-4db0-a84b-03d8cb0cee7b/Frame_2147225189__1_.jpg?t=1792130544\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> They also want an international body to track every containment failure and eventually make them public. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Yann LeCun didn&#39;t sign, and he blames these incidents on badly designed sandboxes. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Tencent-linked agents</span></a> bit btw. Researchers caught a fleet of them scraping Alibaba&#39;s maps, and when asked, several said they were Claude. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> They got the most basic fact about themselves wrong, and said it with full confidence. That&#39;s why the record matters more than the summary. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The summary is the agent describing its work, and the steps show what it did. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Now look at that Anthropic number in the quick facts again. Nobody is reading 30,000 changes a day line by line, which is why the record has to exist. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;padding:0.0px 0px 0.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>You already have a version of this</b></span></h1></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> You don&#39;t need any of this to check an AI&#39;s work. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:626px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/42ee55ce-e8fa-4ea9-99a4-053efbd0e3d5/Frame_2147225190.jpg?t=1792130749\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"626\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> When Claude searches the web or works through a task, you can expand its steps and see every search it ran and every page it opened. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>Here&#39;s how I&#39;d read them:</b></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"ee\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-left:0px;\\\" class=\\\"edm_outlooklist\\\"><ol start=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;margin:0px 0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\\\"><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Read the steps before the answer. Did it do the task you gave it, or an easier one next to it? </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Look for anything it touched that you didn&#39;t ask for, like an extra site, a file or, well.. a form. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Check each claim in the final summary against the steps. If it says <i>&quot;checked the official pricing page&quot;</i> and no official page shows up, it didn&#39;t check. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> If a tool shows no steps at all, ask it to list every source it used and what it took from each. That isn&#39;t proof, but it gives you something to check against. </p></li></ol></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></t