-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #131619;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\">Hi  Ayush Ayush,</td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:32px;font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #131619;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\">This is a reminder that your webinar will begin in 1 hour:</td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr><td style=\\\"height: 32px;\\\"></td></tr>\\n                                            <tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom: 8px;height:auto;font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #131619;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\"> We&#39;re just one hour away from kicking off the Generative AI Mastermind!<br><br>Get ready for a day packed with practical learning, insights, and hands-on sessions designed to help you make the most of Generative AI.<br><br>Here&#39;s what you&#39;ll explore:<br><br>Session : Build your Own AI Employee<br><br>Build and customize AI assistants for your role<br>Create AI agents for task automation<br>Markdown prompting<br>Building your own AI Employee &amp; personal agent<br>Future of AI Employees &amp; autonomous workflows<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a working professional, student, or business owner, the sessions are designed to be implementation-focused and beginner-friendly.<br><br>We&#39;re excited to have you with us and look forward to learning together.<br><br>See you soon!<br>Team Outskill </td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr><td style=\\\"height: 32px;\\\"></td></tr>\\n                                            <tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #000;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"> You can <a href=\\\"https://us06web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_KfycUZqmQraTeeUBKr_exw?tk=ryphh3AftQeQMyBoYRacBFecqPaltMe9zz7GOckauJA.DQkAAAATAl4gXhY0Tm1SeE5QQVMxLUtrZmVJdFBwNjhRAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA