r\\nBrowse phones\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nGet the Google One app\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nHave questions?\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nVisit the Help Center \\u203a\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nWas this email helpful?\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nHappy Neutral Sad\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n1 Promotional code offer expires 16 November 2026 at 11:59p.m. PT; while  \\r\\nsupplies last. Must be redeemed on Google Store only. User must be  \\r\\nsigned-in to their Google Account and checkout with Google Pay profile,  \\r\\nincluding a valid form of payment. Limit 1 per customer.\\r\\n\\r\\nAvailable only to IN residents, aged 18 years or older, with IN shipping  \\r\\naddresses. Google Pay profile must be registered in the IN and promotional  \\r\\ncode can only be used in the IN.\\r\\n\\r\\nPromotional code is for one-time use only with no residual balance; cannot  \\r\\nbe combined with other promotional codes; cannot be combined with other  \\r\\noffers unless otherwise stated; is not transferable; and is not valid for  \\r\\ncash or cash equivalent. Void where prohibited. Terms of sale and  \\r\\nadditional Promotional code terms apply:  \\r\\nhttps://store.google.com/terms/google_store_promo_codes.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n2 Gemini Intelligence is available for select countries and languages to  \\r\\nusers 18+. Feature availability will vary; some features may require  \\r\\nsubscription for higher usage. Check responses. Some features available  \\r\\nthrough Gemini app.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n3 Trade-in values vary based on condition, year, and configuration of your  \\r\\ntrade-in device, and are subject to change upon inspection. Credit card  \\r\\nrefund only available if a Pixel device is purchased on that card. Device  \\r\\ntrade-in value depends on the eligibility of the device traded in. Device  \\r\\ntrade-in credit will be issued as a refund back on the credit card (up to  \\r\\n60 days) used for the device purchase at Google Store or in the form of  \\r\\nStore Credit if the purchased device has already been returned. Refund is  \\r\\nbased on (and paid after) device received matching the description provided  \\r\\nat time of estimate and will be issued to form of payment used for order.  \\r\\nDevices sent for trade-in must be received within 30 days of receiving your  \\r\\nnew device, provided the purchased device has not been returned during that  \\r\\ntime.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n4 Available for select countries and languages to users 18+. Feature  \\r\\navailability will vary; some features may require subscription for higher  \\r\\nusage. Check responses. Some features available through Gemini app.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n5 Available on Gemini app. Check responses. Compatibility and availability  \\r\\nvaries. 18+.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nThis email was sent to raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com because you  \\r\\nindicated that you\'d like us to keep you updated on special discounts,  \\r\\noffers, and other benefits from Google One. If you do not wish to receive  \\r\\nthese emails, please unsubscribe here.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nGoogle Icon\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u00a9 2026 Google LLC, 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-17 08:11:23\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:08.647447\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Googleone Noreply\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:08.647447\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"ag6trsqlfq\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ag48qhsssv\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-17 08:11:23\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:08.647872\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 2,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Raiaayushhectocorn2029\",