</td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\\\"padding:16px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-align:left;height:1px;\\\"> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 1. Some features may not be available in all regions or languages. Some devices may not be available in all regions. Siri\\u00a0AI is available in beta in tvOS 27.2 on Apple\\u00a0TV\\u00a04K (2nd generation and later) and in HomeView software version 27.2; coming to HomePod\\u00a0mini\\u00a02 in a future software update. Siri\\u00a0AI requires the owner of the home in the Home app to have an Apple\\u00a0Intelligence\\u2013enabled iPhone or iPad running the latest software version and have Siri\\u00a0AI turned on and set to a supported language. Personal context requests require a paired Apple\\u00a0Intelligence\\u2013enabled iPhone or iPad running the latest software version with Siri\\u00a0AI turned on and set to a supported language. Siri\\u00a0AI will not be initially available in the EU on iOS or iPadOS. Certain Apple\\u00a0Intelligence features that rely on server-side models are subject to daily usage limits. Expanded access to such features will be available for a fee in the future. Use of these features is subject to the Apple\\u00a0Intelligence Terms and Conditions. Learn more at <a href=\\\"https://support.apple.com/en-in/148587\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">support.apple.com/en-in/148587</a>. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 2. FaceTime calling requires a FaceTime-enabled device for the caller and recipient and a <span style=\\\"white-space:nowrap;\\\">Wi-Fi</span>\\u00a0connection. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 3. Requires a compatible iPhone or iPad running the latest\\u00a0software. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 4. Requires multiple HomePod or HomePod\\u00a0mini speakers with the latest operating system, or AirPlay-compatible speakers with the latest version of AirPlay, and an iOS\\u00a0device with the latest operating system. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 5. Works with compatible content in supported apps on compatible devices. Not all content is available in 4K, HDR, HDR10, HDR10+ or Dolby Vision. Playback quality will depend on hardware and internet connection. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 6. Works with compatible content in supported apps on compatible devices. Not all content is available in 5.1 and 7.1 surround sound or Dolby Atmos audio. Playback quality will depend on hardware and internet connection. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 7. Home theater surround sound requires four HomePod (2nd\\u00a0generation) or HomePod\\u00a0mini\\u00a02 speakers in matching pairs (front and rear) paired with Apple\\u00a0TV\\u00a04K (4th\\u00a0generation) running the latest operating system\\u00a0software. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 8. Far-field microphone support for Siri varies by region and language. Supported when the primary tvOS language is set to Chinese (Mandarin - Taiwan), Dutch, English, Finnish, French, German, Hebrew, Norwegian or\\u00a0Swedish. </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\\\"padding:9px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-align:left;height:1px;\\\"> <p style=\\\"margin:0;line-height:16px;color:#6e6e73;\\\"> TM and \\u00a9 2026 Apple Inc. All\\u00a0rights\\u00a0reserved. <br><br> Apple India Private Limited <br> <span class=\\\"inline-address\\\">13th Floor, Prestige Minsk Square <br> Municipal No 6, Cubbon Road <br> Bengaluru, Karnataka - 560 001, India</span> <br><br> CIN: U30007KA1996PTC019630. <br><br> Telephone:\\u00a0<span class=\\\"inline-address\\\" style=\\\"white-space:nowrap;\\\">+91 80 4045 5181</span> <br><br> Email:\\u00a0<a href=\\\"mailto:india_support@apple.com\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;text-decoration:none;\\\" class=\\\"inline-cta\\\">india_support@apple.com</a> \\u00a0\\u00a0   <span style=\\\"white-space:nowrap;\\\">Website:\\u00a0<a href=\\\"https://www.apple.com/in/\\\" style=\\\"white-space:nowrap;color:#424245;text-decoration:none;\\\" class=\\\"inline-cta\\\" data-inline-custom-text=\\\"true\\\">https://www.apple.com/in</a></span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\\\"padding:0 0 9px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#424245;text-align:left;height:1px;\\\"> <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:#424245;line-height:16px;\\\" class=\\\"m97\\\"> <a href=\\\"https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&amp;a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoalnU9%2BTQzrnj1yTdoDsUsttKvV0dq3sO6iRh6N6kmoDKz3D6Q3VK5IYKgjHpbenIf5tu3AjJoLjibl4EW2qK7umzKq6G4qBClhOjHEmsoxvk944dQvGCz5%2FV8wKGISPpES6K%2FF88LAoFh0ekBQHQJuUDBVfkr7ZYyVl4lFOj9YNoXK5m2LdMlFi1qGie%2FfJSc%3D\\\" style=\\\"border:0;outline:0;text-decoration:none;color:#424245;\\\">Privacy\\u00a0Policy</a>\\u00a0\\u00a0<span style=\\\"color:#6e6e73;\\\">|</span>\\u00a0 <a href=\\\"https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&amp;a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoalnU9%2BTQzrnj1yTdoDsUsttKvV0dq3sO6iRh6N6kmoDKz3D6Q3VK5IYKgjHpbenIf5tu3AjJoLjibl4EW2qK7umzKq6G4qBClhOjHEmsoxvk944dQvGCz5%2FV8wKGISPpES6K%2FF88LAoFh0ekBQHQJuUDBVfkr7ZYyVl4lFOj9YNj0PoDGuo3sKLELqPzB3FY4%3D\\\" style=\\\"border:0;outline:0;text-decoration:none;color:#424245;\\\">My\\u00a0Apple\\u00a0Account</a>\\u00a0\\u00a0<span style=\\\"color:#6e6e73;\\\">|</span>\\u00a0 <a href=\\\"https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&amp;a=o2CKfLM8dAL7ly