f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\u034f\\u200c \\r\\nApple Home\\r\\n\\r\\nApple Home\\r\\n Introducing the new Apple Home line-up. \\r\\nApple TV and Home products: HomePod mini, compact spherical design in pink colour, Apple HomeView, display with cylindrical speaker base in silver colour. Apple TV 4K, square shape, black colour with Siri Remote, silver colour, raised buttons Apple TV and Home products: HomePod mini, compact spherical design in pink colour, Apple HomeView, display with cylindrical speaker base in silver colour. Apple TV 4K, square shape, black colour with Siri Remote, silver colour, raised buttons https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=1zIdgxRYc2DtYV9mVx1rKVlLY4S3XP4jfdSiAIA8JV%2Fx6Yckyxxl8Pg2dMxhXJi2ijHdPpV7WMwAn06EjhGpFP7ggomaO%2FdIaGiMhNiNfrBzgbZ%2BgQFXUCMccmHWRscZOtXB3tQ%2F4ZdB3k5mLC8Bys3Bm%2FVrtNpUwGQ4k8dOR%2B5nUttam0sSnnfiaHk3TVwtEx5swe%2BAHMVM%2FJajt3%2FUvymhEgFMeOU9rLnsEHNhEGjZlWmindbqJrZZxRjefjU1%2B7rEy22fNlxSNIsWnPSoU1Nl2rbaa3AXFLkRTZu559X%2FcXc5uJiJVqC8P9Jk23wInQB16PZ6i4fy7dSm0qug%2BVGa%2F3usEtdOBKuwQafKEJLiknnjxONmb7JIMik6Hcfb \\r\\nApple HomeView\\r\\n\\r\\nApple HomeView\\r\\n Designed for life at home. \\r\\n\\r\\nApple HomeView, display with base, colour-matching domed cylindrical speaker base with circular perforations. Three devices: pink colour, screen displays FaceTime call. Starlight colour, screen displays photo face, person holding flowers. Silver colour, screen displays Apple Music Now Playing, album artwork, playback controls\\r\\n\\r\\nApple HomeView, display with base, colour-matching domed cylindrical speaker base with circular perforations. Three devices: pink colour, screen displays FaceTime call. Starlight colour, screen displays photo face, person holding flowers. Silver colour, screen displays Apple Music Now Playing, album artwork, playback controls\\r\\n Apple HomeView keeps the whole home connected, entertained and in the know. Siri AI helps you find what you need and get more done.1 Enjoy FaceTime, incredible entertainment and seamless smart home controls.2 Recognises up to six people, delivering a personalised experience for each.3 \\r\\n\\r\\n Siri AI is available in English to start. \\r\\nUsage limits may apply. \\r\\n\\r\\n Available from 13 October \\r\\n\\r\\nPre-order https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=1zIdgxRYc2DtYV9mVx1rKVlLY4S3XP4jfdSiAIA8JV%2Fx6Yckyxxl8Pg2dMxhXJi2ijHdPpV7WMwAn06EjhGpFP7ggomaO%2FdIaGiMhNiNfrBzgbZ%2BgQFXUCMccmHWRscZOtXB3tQ%2F4ZdB3k5mLC8Bys3Bm%2FVrtNpUwGQ4k8dOR%2B5nUttam0sSnnfiaHk3TVwtEx5swe%2BAHMVM%2FJajt3%2FUvymhEgFMeOU9rLnsEHNhEGjZlWmindbqJrZZxRjefjU1%2B7rEy22fNlxSNIsWnPSoU1Nl2rbaa3AXFLkRTZu559X%2FcXc5uJiJVqC8P9Jk23wInQB16PZ6i4fy7dSm0qug%2BVGa%2F3usEtdOBKuwQafKEJI5VSHUKzr9TXC195QIC3Yf Learn more https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=1zIdgxRYc2DtYV9mVx1rKVlLY4S3XP4jfdSiAIA8JV%2Fx6Yckyxxl8Pg2dMxhXJi2ijHdPpV7WMwAn06EjhGpFP7ggomaO%2FdIaGiMhNiNfrBzgbZ%2BgQFXUCMccmHWRscZOtXB3tQ%2F4ZdB3k5mLC8Bys3Bm%2FVrtNpUwGQ4k8dOR%2B5nUttam0sSnnfiaHk3TVwtEx5swe%2BAHMVM%2FJajt3%2FUvymhEgFMeOU9rLnsEHNhEGjZlWmindbqJrZZxRjefjU1%2B7rEy22fNlxSNIsWnPSoU1Nl2rbaa3AXFLkRTZu559X%2FcXc5uJiJVqC8P9Jk23wInQB16PZ6i4fy7dSm0qug%2BVGa%2F3usEtdOBKuwQafKEJK7y%2BICOrC0Vwy0bhE4yuMx \\r\\nHomePod mini 2\\r\\n\\r\\nHomePod mini 2\\r\\n Sound in living colour. \\r\\n\\r\\nHomePod mini 2, all five colours: white, dark blue, dark green, light pink, midnight (black)\\r\\n\\r\\nHomePod mini 2, all five colours: white, dark blue, dark green, light pink, midnight (black)\\r\\n Comes in five stunning colours. Delivers rich, detailed, room-filling sound. Pair additional speakers for multi-room audio.4 And because Siri AI1 is more powerful than ever, it can understand your personal context, making it easy to discover new music based on your favourites or control your smart home using just your voice. \\r\\n\\r\\n Siri AI is coming in a future software update. \\r\\nUsage limits may apply. \\r\\n\\r\\n Available from 