tures may not be available in all regions or languages. Some devices may not be available in all regions. Siri AI is available in beta in tvOS 27.2 on Apple TV 4K (2nd generation and later) and in HomeView software version 27.2; coming to HomePod mini 2 in a future software update. Siri AI requires the owner of the home in the Home app to have an Apple Intelligence\\u2013enabled iPhone or iPad running the latest software version and have Siri AI turned on and set to a supported language. Personal context requests require a paired Apple Intelligence\\u2013enabled iPhone or iPad running the latest software version with Siri AI turned on and set to a supported language. Siri AI will not be initially available in the EU on iOS or iPadOS. Certain Apple Intelligence features that rely on server-side models are subject to daily usage limits. Expanded access to such features will be available for a fee in the future. Use of these features is subject to the Apple Intelligence Terms and Conditions. Learn more at support.apple.com/en-in/148587 support.apple.com/en-in/148587. \\r\\n\\r\\n 2. FaceTime calling requires a FaceTime-enabled device for the caller and recipient and a Wi-Ficonnection. \\r\\n\\r\\n 3. Requires a compatible iPhone or iPad running the latest software. \\r\\n\\r\\n 4. Requires multiple HomePod or HomePod mini speakers with the latest operating system, or AirPlay-compatible speakers with the latest version of AirPlay, and an iOS device with the latest operating system. \\r\\n\\r\\n 5. Works with compatible content in supported apps on compatible devices. Not all content is available in 4K, HDR, HDR10, HDR10+ or Dolby Vision. Playback quality will depend on hardware and internet connection. \\r\\n\\r\\n 6. Works with compatible content in supported apps on compatible devices. Not all content is available in 5.1 and 7.1 surround sound or Dolby Atmos audio. Playback quality will depend on hardware and internet connection. \\r\\n\\r\\n 7. Home theater surround sound requires four HomePod (2nd generation) or HomePod mini 2 speakers in matching pairs (front and rear) paired with Apple TV 4K (4th generation) running the latest operating system software. \\r\\n\\r\\n 8. Far-field microphone support for Siri varies by region and language. Supported when the primary tvOS language is set to Chinese (Mandarin - Taiwan), Dutch, English, Finnish, French, German, Hebrew, Norwegian or Swedish. \\r\\n\\r\\n TM and \\u00a9 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved. \\r\\n\\r\\nApple India Private Limited \\r\\n13th Floor, Prestige Minsk Square \\r\\nMunicipal No 6, Cubbon Road \\r\\nBengaluru, Karnataka - 560 001, India \\r\\n\\r\\nCIN: U30007KA1996PTC019630. \\r\\n\\r\\nTelephone:+91 80 4045 5181 \\r\\n\\r\\nEmail:india_support@apple.com india_support@apple.com Website:https://www.apple.com/in https://www.apple.com/in/\\r\\n\\r\\n Privacy Policy https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoYYhN7u0Dnce%2F4Q6bIm%2BBfSArhfehUoeQchQSBbkXORpI6%2F9TpNh601zmBjObYrahBygcmChDqEnwWFcOu4uE%2Fl0A7%2FWi6630%2FkJsI8Hgb5fFaN0lD6yBIju4LmG7recpE94mle1PzlBQaQGXu7WW8hlPqtl7RmFNPVWx2E302zXo%2FOmqgacDigZsg0oDFuMls%3D| My Apple Account https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoYYhN7u0Dnce%2F4Q6bIm%2BBfSArhfehUoeQchQSBbkXORpI6%2F9TpNh601zmBjObYrahBygcmChDqEnwWFcOu4uE%2Fl0A7%2FWi6630%2FkJsI8Hgb5fFaN0lD6yBIju4LmG7recpE94mle1PzlBQaQGXu7WW8hlPqtl7RmFNPVWx2E302zXubxz4NIr%2BpQdwTB%2BF68NRo%3D| Legal https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoYYhN7u0Dnce%2F4Q6bIm%2BBfSArhfehUoeQchQSBbkXORpI6%2F9TpNh601zmBjObYrahBygcmChDqEnwWFcOu4uE%2Fl0A7%2FWi6630%2FkJsI8Hgb5fFaN0lD6yBIju4LmG7recpE94mle1PzlBQaQGXu7WW8hlPqtl7RmFNPVWx2E302zXhbTgNXOoK5ZUAk%2FrH19AbI%3D \\r\\n\\r\\n If you don\\u2019t want