\\\"><!--[if mso | IE]&amp;gt; &amp;lt;table role=&amp;quot;presentation&amp;quot; border=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; cellpadding=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; cellspacing=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;&amp;gt; &amp;lt;tr&amp;gt; &amp;lt;td style=&amp;quot;vertical-align:middle;width:408.8px;&amp;quot; &amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--><div class=\\\"mj-column-per-70 mj-outlook-group-fix\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;width:100%;\\\"> <table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\\\"border-radius:0px;vertical-align:middle;padding:28px 28px 16px 28px;\\\" class=\\\"padding-20px-16px-20px-28px\\\"> <table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"> <tbody><tr> <td class=\\\"text-container\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;word-break:break-word;text-align:left;\\\"><div class=\\\"links-1A73E8-underline\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family:&#39;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:none;line-height:21.00px;text-align:left;color:#F8F9FC;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0;\\\">Create a cozy miniature world builder in Three.js titled \\u201cPocket World // Terrarium Planet.\\u201d Place a clear glass orb, approximately thirty centimeters across, on a turned walnut stand with a brass collar on a white windowsill. A folded linen cloth and small potted succulent should establish its domestic scale against a lavender evening sky. Begin slightly above and to the left, with the orb filling about sixty percent of the image height and a curved window reflection describing its round surface. <span style=\\\"white-space:nowrap;\\\">Suspend [...]</span></p></div></div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/td&amp;gt; &amp;lt;td style=&amp;quot;vertical-align:middle;width:175.2px;&amp;quot; &amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--><div class=\\\"mj-column-per-30 mj-outlook-group-fix\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;width:100%;\\\"> <table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-radius:16px;vertical-align:middle;padding:0px 30px 8px 30px;\\\" class=\\\"padding-0px-28px-0px-10px\\\"> <table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"> <tbody><tr> <td valign=\\\"middle\\\" class=\\\"text-align-right padding-0px-0px-0px-0px button-container\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;word-break:break-word;text-align:left;\\\"><div><!--[if mso]&amp;gt; &amp;lt;table width=&amp;quot;100%&amp;quot; align=&amp;quot;center&amp;quot; border=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; cellpadding=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; cellspacing=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; role=&amp;quot;presentation&amp;quot; style=&amp;quot;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;&amp;quot;&amp;gt; &amp;lt;tr&amp;gt; &amp;lt;td align=&amp;quot;right&amp;quot; class=&amp;quot;mso-button-dark-mode&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;a:roundrect xmlns:a=&amp;quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml&amp;quot; xmlns:w=&amp;quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word&amp;quot; href=&amp;quot;https://aistudio.google.com/apps?prompt=Create+a+cozy+miniature+world+builder+in+Three.js+titled+%E2%80%9CPocket+World+%2F%2F+Terrarium+Planet.%E2%80%9D+Place+a+clear+glass+orb%2C+approximately+thirty+centimeters+across%2C+on+a+turned+walnut+stand+with+a+brass+collar+on+a+white+windowsill.+A+folded+linen+cloth+and+small+potted+succulent+should+establish+its+domestic+scale+against+a+lavender+evening+sky.+Begin+slightly+above+and+to+the+left%2C+with+the+orb+filling+about+sixty+percent+of+the+image+height+and+a+curved+window+reflection+describing+its+round+surface.+Suspend+a+faceted+planet+centrally+inside%2C+leaving+breathing+room+for+its+tiny+atmosphere.+Make+the+planet+roughly+half+the+orb%27s+diameter%2C+with+three+shades+of+grassy+hills%2C+sandy+beaches%2C+two+shallow+turquoise+seas%2C+and+a+snowy+mountain+near+one+pole.+Start+with+four+pastel+houses%2C+a+white+windmill%2C+a+striped+cliff-top+lighthouse%2C+a+stone+well%2C+fences%2C+rounded+oaks%2C+narrow+pines%2C+and+palms+beside+the+coast.+Twelve+villagers+in+colorful+clothing+should+travel+between+homes+and+the+well%2C+while+eight+white+sheep+graze+nearby.+Three+puffy+clouds%2C+a+small+glowing+sun%2C+and+a+pale+moon+follow+curved+paths+around+the+world%2C+with+sun+and+moon+on+opposing+sides.+Use+clearly+defined%2C+gently+irregular+facets+for+the+terrain%2C+softened+by+the+visual+richness+of+individual+objects.+Roof+tiles%2C+tiny+chimney+rims%2C+wooden+fence+rails%2C+and+the+windmill%27s+canvas+sails+should+remain+distinct+at+village+level.+Seas+should+appear+shallow+near+the+sand+and+deepen+in+color+farther+from+shore%2C+with+modest+surface+movement.+The+orb+needs+visible+glass+thickness%2C+faint+green+edges%2C+and+reflections+that+leave+the+village+inspectable.+Contrast+its+hard+shine+with+the+stand%27s+warm+wood+grain%2C+the+cloth%27s+linen+weave%2C+chalky+windowsill+paint%2C+and+the+succulent%27s+fleshy+leaves.+Light+the+room+with+warm+evening+window+light+and+subdued+interior+fill%2C+while+the+little+sun+creates+moving+shadows+across+the+planet.+Let+day+pass+gradually+into+blue+twilight%3A+the+sun+sinks+behind+the+sphere%2C+windows+brighten%2C+and+the+lighthouse+sends+a+sweeping+beam+across+the+sea.+In+Night+mode%2C+darken+the+surrounding+room%2C+let+the+moon+illuminate+silver+edges+on+terrain%2C+and+add+a+few+drifting+fireflies+inside+the+glass.+Clouds+should+occasionally+pass+overhead+and+release+fine+rain+that+briefly+darkens+the+ground+and+visibly+advances+nearby+trees%27+growth.+Provide+a+cream-and-pastel+tool+dock+for+placing+trees%2C+houses%2C+windmills%2C+lighthouses%2C+mountains%2C+lakes%2C+flowers%2C+clouds%2C+villagers%2C+and+sheep%2C+plus+Raise+Land%2C+Lower+Land%2C+and+Remove.+Every+placed+object+should+stand+upright+relative+to+its+patch+of+spherical+ground%2C+settling+with+a+small+bounce+and+sparkles%3B+lowered+terrain+should+admit+water.+Drag+empty+space+to+spin+the+planet+with+gentle+inertia.+Show+its+editable+name%2C+initially+%E2%80%9CLittle+Meadow%2C%E2%80%9D+population%2C+happiness%2C+and+day+count.+Grow+advances+village+development+through+new+homes%2C+paths%2C+and+trees.+Include+Orb%2C+Surface%2C+Orbit%2C+and+Village+views+and+an+interruptible+25-second+tour+from+planting+and+rain+to+the+illuminated+nighttime+village&amp;quot; fillcolor=&amp;quot;#8AB4F8&amp;quot; arcsize=&amp;quot;27%&amp;quot; style=&amp;quot;v-text-anchor:middle;width:74.25pt;height:33.75pt;&amp;quot; strokecolor=&amp;quot;#8AB4F8&amp;quot; strokeweight=&amp;quot;0.75pt&amp;quot; &amp;gt;&amp;lt;w:anchorlock/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;a:textbox inset=&amp;quot;0,0,0,0&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;center style=&amp;quot;color:#ffffff; font-family:sans-serif, Arial; font-size:16px&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--> <a href=\\\"https://aistudio.google.com/apps?prompt=Create+a+cozy+miniature+world+builder+in+Three.js+titled+%E2%80%9CPocket+World+%2F%2F+Terrarium+Planet.%E2%80%9D+Place+a+clear+glass+orb%2C+approximately+thirty+centimeters+across%2C+on+a+turned+walnut+stand+with+a+brass+collar+on+a+white+windowsill.+A+folded+linen+cloth+and+small+potted+succulent+should+establish+its+domestic+scale+against+a+lavender+evening+sky.+Begin+slightly+above+and+to+the+left%2C+with+the+orb+filling+about+sixty+percent+of+the+image+height+and+a+curved+window+reflection+describing+its+round+surface.+Suspend+a+faceted+planet+centrally+inside%2C+leaving+breathing+room+for+its+tiny+atmosphere.+Make+the+planet+roughly+half+the+orb%27s+diameter%2C+with+three+shades+of+grassy+hills%2C+sandy+beaches%2C+two+shallow+turquoise+seas%2C+and+a+snowy+mountain+near+one+pole.+Start+with+four+pastel+houses%2C+a+white+windmill%2C+a+striped+cliff-top+lighthouse%2C+a+stone+well%2C+fences%2C+rounded+oaks%2C+narrow+pines%2C+and+palms+beside+the+coast.+Twelve+villagers+in+colorful+clothing+should+travel+between+homes+and+the+well%2C+while+eight+white+sheep+graze+nearby.+Three+puffy+clouds%2C+a+small+glowing+sun%2C+and+a+pale+moon+follow+curved+paths+around+the+world%2C+with+sun+and+moon+on+opposing+sides.+Use+clearly+defined%2C+gently+irregular+facets+for+the+terrain%2C+softened+by+the+visual+richness+of+individual+objects.+Roof+tiles%2C+tiny+chimney+rims%2C+wooden+fence+rails%2C+and+the+windmill%27s+canvas+sails+should+remain+distinct+at+village+level.+Seas+should+appear+shallow+near+the+sand+and+deepen+in+color+farther+from+shore%2C+with+modest+surface+movement.+The+orb+needs+visible+glass+thickness%2C+faint+green+edges%2C+and+reflections+that+leave+the+village+inspectable.+Contrast+its+hard+shine+with+the+stand%27s+warm+wood+grain%2C+the+cloth%27s+linen+weave%2C+chalky+windowsill+paint%2C+and+the+succulent%27s+fleshy+leaves.+Light+the+room+with+warm+evening+window+light+and+subdued+interior+fill%2C+while+the+little+sun+creates+moving+shadows+across+the+planet.+Let+day+pass+gradually+into+blue+twilight%3A+the+sun+sinks+behind+the+sphere%2C+windows+brighten%2C+and+the+lighthouse+sends+a+sweeping+beam+across+the+sea.+In+Night+mode%2C+darken+the+surrounding+room%2C+let+the+moon+illuminate+silver+edges+on+terrain%2C+and+add+a+few+drifting+fireflies+inside+the+glass.+Clouds+should+occasionally+pass+overhead+and+release+fine+rain+that+briefly+darkens+the+ground+and+visibly+advances+nearby+trees%27+growth.+Provide+a+cream-and-pastel+tool+dock+for+placing+trees%2C+houses%2C+windmills%2C+lighthouses%2C+mountains%2C+lakes%2C+flowers%2C+clouds%2C+villagers%2C+and+sheep%2C+plus+Raise+Land%2C+Lower+Land%2C+and+Remove.+Every+placed+object+should+stand+upright+relative+to+its+patch+of+spherical+ground%2C+settling+with+a+small+bounce+and+sparkles%3B+lowered+terrain+should+admit+water.+Drag+empty+space+to+spin+the+planet+with+gentle+inertia.+Show+its+editable+name%2C+initially+%E2%80%9CLittle+Meadow%2C%E2%80%9D+population%2C+happiness%2C+and+day+count.+Grow+advances+village+development+through+new+homes%2C+paths%2C+and+trees.+Include+Orb%2C+Surface%2C+Orbit%2C+and+Village+views+and+an+interruptible+25-second+tour+from+planting+and+rain+to+the+illuminated+nighttime+village\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-block; width: auto; background: #8AB4F8; color: #121317; font-family: &#39; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.50; margin: 0; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-transform: none; padding: 11px 28px 11px 28px; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 1px solid #8AB4F8; border-right: 1px solid #8AB4F8; border-top: 1px solid #8AB4F8; border-bottom: 1px solid #8AB4F8; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" width=\\\"100\\\">Run \\u2192</a><!--[if mso]&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/center&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/a:textbox&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/a:roundrect&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/td&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/table&amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--></div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/td&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/table&amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/td&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/table&amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--></div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> <table align=\\\"center\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;\\\" class=\\\"section\\\"> <tbody><tr> <td align=\\\"center\\\"><div role=\\\"presentation\\\"><!--[if mso | IE]&amp;gt; &amp;lt;table align=&amp;quot;center&amp;quot; border=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; cellpadding=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; cellspacing=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; class=&amp;quot;block-grid-outlook&amp;quot; role=&amp;quot;presentation&amp;quot; style=&amp;quot;width:640px;&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;640&amp;q