</td> </tr> </tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/td&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt; &amp;lt;/table&amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--></div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table></div> <!--[if mso ]&amp;gt; &amp;lt;table id=&amp;quot;email-container&amp;quot; style=&amp;quot;width:600px;line-height:0;font-size:0;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-collapse:collapse&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;600&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;img alt=&amp;quot;&amp;quot; height=&amp;quot;1&amp;quot; src=&amp;quot;https://notifications.google.com/g/img/AAuDWvnL-N9NQQOqIcTb7X-go0xUeXLFJ4TVvAsF4PtEmOx7sk7K7EqBcvm8A4T2xbpSQJov_k2J-J041mE9E7LlZnJTo5-ca0Hrck0m7br2ney4tbWPO0L50KyrVeKQWdo0Sx8tLA.gif&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/table&amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!--> <div style=\\\"width:auto;line-height:0;font-size:0;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"1\\\" src=\\\"https://notifications.google.com/g/img/AAuDWvnL-N9NQQOqIcTb7X-go0xUeXLFJ4TVvAsF4PtEmOx7sk7K7EqBcvm8A4T2xbpSQJov_k2J-J041mE9E7LlZnJTo5-ca0Hrck0m7br2ney4tbWPO0L50KyrVeKQWdo0Sx8tLA.gif\\\" width=\\\"3\\\"></div> <!--&amp;lt;![endif]-->  \",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:06.512364\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"a10c2b5e296fefecdb2e63a85251d58ffc633881-20416204-111918116@google.com\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:06.698259\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"afhp7r2jpm\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00118\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"googleaistudio-noreply@google.com\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"Google AI Studio\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"\\ud83d\\udd25 Introducing Gemini 4 Argon in Google AI Studio\",\n \"text_content\": \"Google AI  \\r\\nStudio<https://c.gle/AAuDWvn0jjEVeRIwUiXH-uMtxx1YZ6I-NY7FtlI6nvZHJBptbo8PkaZZKoFbSuF0hJcWFuRiPCZ3npBscJ_LLLtmvFUovhDT5BvYITh5qr5zfcXEYaeH257CKXWs7lSb3NuFJOhaMKo8g6_0bte_HQmKNqW3kBA>\\r\\n\\r\\nLeap forward with Gemini 4 Argon in Google AI Studio\\u00a0\\r\\n\\r\\nBuild bigger, more ambitious projects with frontier intelligence by simply  \\r\\ndescribing what you want.\\r\\n\\r\\nGet Google AI  \\r\\nUltra<https://c.gle/AAuDWvkjpbc9Oa8i9byY4yTsCCRPBEvMytQ5qBV-IheuCVQB3o5IIcKY2ojnlVj-jf7kOkaIa-ZOmQgfN742AFESmgPgFfAAHPLDhuClQoOOwCbeL8Ptj4PwJz1K_BKqvyqiHYBBMeJ_5SGkxleo6s9k5F71FsyZ20pi4_tdpwZvVKOkkBc7XpsyhOoh3A4gswH4Ipm5mG37XOOj91tHC2O9WsbyVdgCLaDUquE8OpAvXT4sxfjQLt3pdRVtCdJjPS2oIaQxAViba8DxddyM8z8LbYan7uc6fEiXnHSsOF1k3A>\\r\\n\\r\\nTry demo  \\r\\napps<https://c.gle/AAuDWvlQxrihYjhbcJficEZqgJY6hI2NaLDlB6zvhKT4KhBtwqVdSSXwl5NkTcS_NAGWOA93koibWgA5m7S-cHCy_T05QAtCVGC3codM-k7FDuerpSrN3rkKp31f_-oeiQFc8XncquFB5x7RQcg5XNony-JqXZDcngaVRLRtWut6bqDFZ_IxofmrptN8jDoTvsBiPvP7FsqUo1E>\\r\\n\\r\\nHi Aayush,\\r\\n\\r\\nWe are thrilled to bring our new frontier model, Gemini 4 Argon, to you in  \\r\\nGoogle AI Studio! Whether you\\u2019re vibe coding a full-stack web app, an  \\r\\ninteractive data tool, or a 3D game, Argon helps you bring your most  \\r\\nambitious ideas to life faster. You provide the creative direction, and  \\r\\nArgon handles the complex app architecture, UI polish, physics, and math  \\r\\nunder the hood.\\r\\n\\r\\n  Start building with Argon in Google AI Studio using your Google AI  \\r\\nUltra,<https://c.gle/AAuDWvlAxjTxfs5PwU3qmc7EeoAtEGa5G-5euTpjgUje5xSh4wnC7beHgSUHqRMsmoYDYEVr5cJJoAEAmIT-nSa_taU6RwGm4pZ1r5srcAwbJ-JNaMQP94lSd-KurrqOm1cwJH-2-dt3ecvgf47T3c7JdQltJ2CYYnwq7H7jplwU6Nin0CVoj0842Mc9lYF3NmWdTi0gEoSotx5aq0bTjxlvpFe9QvvupLkVsPGj8qHPEX2Xat5kHNh5mndMPy2t9cjpZIDlMhjfptV72_C5Zoc5HNMD4rvYQbgP>,  \\r\\na paid Gemini API key, or explore and remix featured\\u00a0demo  \\r\\napps<https://c.gle/AAuDWvnEwga48KyV2ZubDwE_ajaTp8wNgUOU1bZWlBg04yXkRTzyfP7FFUT063Oz84L3i9XKaTBsmCdCzq30j47YSW8vbEBcP9H020Su59NMqJFQjYMrQnH7v2dPBqo_YUP129aX3RXjx249Gy27c9iVJXnNv3CrWx9jZcr9fzO_i8sfIuV_yeNlGzakgCH_TNdH8g>.\\r\\n\\r\\nA kart races along a glowing elevated track toward sweeping curves, with  \\r\\nlap time and speed displays  \\r\\nvisible.<https://c.gle/AAuDWvmU6IFbgaZTiJnW_OriA9GqYmvZmu37tEqNUDP-Rjl8zqquDFGL1DCNUDf8YcTj2ThfkgUPi_Zsks9q58OG-Bn9dLi9rx-CVC3PpRVN36-tK96S3K4z2Y7ejGaFsyHHF8sqF1XJAPqUsosyenmppitBeb_wPXqobLQD2b8aUJk>\\r\\n\\r\\nArgon turned pictures of a real desk into a playable miniature racing game  \\r\\nusing a multi-agent loop. Try it  \\r\\nnow<https://c.gle/AAuDWvkv5NXXqiG_NjXFXThpz-f7HOwkZsB7zsQ5f_QgAjzsyolWBZrID-HwhEpwelWg-_NjeE6AVRJ5NG9V8Bh6OdXMGk-Iqum5pj4pW9Sf6M2FPmZWtyRLqyHttd8FZy0bCpYHVvk0b0hFEiLZawuLmmcnhV5FbqB2D7xCgAzqAug>  \\r\\nin Google AI Studio.\\r\\n\\r\\nAmbitious full-stack apps\\r\\n\\r\\nTackle ambitious, multi-step projects simply by describing what you want in  \\r\\nplain English. Argon holds the thread across complex goals: one-shot  \\r\\nbackend logic, wiring APIs, and resolving subtle UI and state bugs through  \\r\\nconversational iteration until your app is production-ready.\\r\\n\\r\\nImmersive 3D worlds and apps\\r\\n\\r\\nHarness Argon\'s spatial reasoning with Blender, Three.js, and WebGPU to  \\r\\neffortlessly build 3D scenes, physics simulations, and full-stack apps.  \\r\\nCheck out our 3D games and worlds builder  \\r\\nguide<https://c.gle/AAuDWvlIQsqylPSF67Y9cC4efZQ5gB4ZOKhNIPYJyTM9gg_Y0K2UUvwLA-2SwHhThMrKS0ncgsCla2toD1DoYZaLovI5RbpI29tNPJ5lZ6nJvsmDgKATYxlxlpxSr00OhCJJhK8Xg-6HLFSR3WmE1oh6uG4zXJH6Bribe1lgXwaOkspKOFBMKoLT4XdqPV0SG9zc5YIspX6FDeLRhTAdMDrMEWwCyw50ToXHDgt1M4jicngOGemu5oEHGsq2>  \\r\\nfor practical workflows.\\r\\n\\r\\nInteractive tools from messy files\\r\\n\\r\\nDrop in spreadsheets, receipt photos, or long PDFs and turn them into  \\r\\nvisual explorers, budget trackers, and interactive stories.\\r\\n\\r\\nExplore apps built with Argon\\r\\n\\r\\nExperience Gemini 4 Argon in the demo apps or remix them to make your own.\\r\\n\\r\\nTry the demo  \\r\\napps<https://c.gle/AAuDWvkT6fjsykYFFjDxqdG7O9yR2YmEJHVWNK6Z6Q6RmvL0YHN3oWUfB7NUzupkjvThn2zhXcV1qS3Lj2D4-oGXyM7Voa5GCugAnkxXes8WhEqNiaOhXQ4Xd6HIa-dMnimpd5gOUKm42oY9eYmHhraoTP1p-ubRYRR8rNpHIsWXNawZStQYU0bwywYIEoc1zNMRx745K8f2HJQURtSp>\\r\\n\\r\\nA bento style collage of demo apps built in Google AI  \\r\\nStudio.<https://c.gle/AAuDWvkkHlnwFVPCoRTiq0Isym6JmUiHhJ3qMXod-oE7k37FAERCRl7y2nu-R-fa4bGK_QLfAbAB5ITP97z31XLTcVbusbGcAUSDxXAdceCK4SoNiMZjtpDoDK2JDvRzwjPSAnlNkEUdKlHjzC9pCHoXsR0GSvYqdKNaK2fHw_ziv52nsJikLUFTzXxAjBwcXucHqBpo3A>\\r\\n\\r\\nEnjoy the best of Google AI with Google AI Ultra\\u00a0plan and unlock Gemini 4  \\r\\nArgon in AI Studio.\\r\\n\\r\\nGet Google AI  \\r\\nUltra<https://c.gle/AAuDWvkjpbc9Oa8i9byY4yTsCCRPBEvMytQ5qBV-IheuCVQB3o5IIcKY2ojnlVj-jf7kOkaIa-ZOmQgfN742AFESmgPgFfAAHPLDhuClQoOOwCbeL8Ptj4PwJz1K_BKqvyqiHYBBMeJ_5SGkxleo6s9k5F71FsyZ20pi4_tdpwZvVKOkkBc7XpsyhOoh3A4gswH4Ipm5mG37XOOj91tHC2O9WsbyVdgCLaDUquE8OpAvXT4sxfjQLt3pdRVtCdJjPS2oIaQxAViba8DxddyM8z8LbYan7uc6fEiXnHSsOF1k3A>\\r\\n\\r\\nBuild your one-shot apps with Argon\\r\\n\\r\\nUse your Google AI Ultra or paid API key to run these prompts and start  \\r\\nbuilding with Argon. For pro tips, check out our advanced Argon prompting  \\r\\nguide<https://c.gle/AAuDWvkjcBE_4jZOh27G_J-oq_kvble1nOM8WgQZSjIjTp8OEOdsu2udzTmd7zkvkiG_4xA_sATT5-TCiZBWI024tjrMNS-RRcdqwLSmlyIVd8mzjJSoqjRU_Vecc3WaZadpcFaAN4wmlijubeDUZMr4Vsifhwi9q49Con0pJ1INGtY3clBy02hHsTs0bjcMnUn8Az6YlQ-bbvKcQet351d7r6VoLUySg5LSgIUPWxEuieHGHya9c0i7>.\\r\\n\\r\\nBuild a HTML drum machine and synth using the Web Audio API with a 16-step  \\r\\nsequencer, tempo slider, a live waveform visualizer, and other very  \\r\\ninteresting and fun features. Include lots of different sounds. Make the UI  \\r\\n8-bit retro UI style with minimal clutter.\\r\\n\\r\\nRun  \\r\\n\\u2192<https://c.gle/AAuDWvme22x_CBZ7q2-uNAtE6zggrAsC6w5hn8QIqbf41KL-Oe5hf-tD-6W_ghkb7HvC-xYOMzxom2ufJHQZxp58PTClkcAM9FCOOZD2PdlVbxI7KTsOEM03UlSJIySeLzypgxtKmaotfRG-7oDDRVAoGQnnrc4168ii2j-PIWvgHtboIWLF1kBZQjonSrCHrCSsGGgSTICl4VyfuFLHha0oyQ3-5n5pT0etNQ3Q7e-GYJfCCOD-An0Pc-BSxgWH3Dldhk-kzj4lGYVlAWhCG3HnN8JL0S83J-RdN_a4e7S-CV48MgmvFCuXKhdqmd6_1t-DoGNGfZ5gC-oMuBD1dOudDJhg8Vzdd4ByQYT6agioXXOdwNyvFkqkm_NUL6FaHY2O5_TEZayVs6n5WeJaHdBIamsVl1tMp2Rn8tkMZiid2-B-v8dlcVStxOct8Sv61kR4qco_wPcnER31GBvYVSQvtRbBpE_O9J1DDpdpbH4uUZSAmOgxxVu6FooIcFzVhathQOeqpXgEzfEDTN43zriWaKuDtw>\\r\\n\\r\\nCreate a cozy miniature world builder in Three.js titled \\u201cPocket World //  \\r\\nTerrarium Planet.\\u201d Place a clear glass orb, approximately thirty  \\r\\ncentimeters across, on a turned walnut stand with a brass collar on a white  \\r\\nwindowsill. A folded linen cloth and small potted succulent should  \\r\\nestablish its domestic scale against a lavender evening sky. Begin slightly  \\r\\nabove and to the left, with the orb filling about sixty percent of the  \\r\\nimage height and a curved window reflection describing its round surface.  \\r\\nSuspend [...]\\r\\n\\r\\nRun  \\r\\n\\u2192<https://aistudio.google.com/apps?prompt=Create+a+cozy+miniature+world+builder+in+Three.js+titled+%E2%80%9CPocket+World+%2F%2F+Terrarium+Planet.%E2%80%9D+Place+a+clear+glass+orb%2C+approximately+thirty+centimeters+across%2C+on+a+turned+walnut+stand+with+a+brass+collar+on+a+white+windowsill.+A+folded+linen+cloth+and+small+potted+succulent+should+establish+its+domestic+scale+against+a+lavender+evening+sky.+Begin+slightly+above+and+to+the+left%2C+with+the+orb+filling+about+sixty+percent+of+the+image+height+and+a+curved+window+reflection+describing+its+round+surface.+Suspend+a+faceted+planet+centrally+inside%2C+leaving+breathing+room+for+its+tiny+atmosphere.+Make+the+planet+roughly+half+the+orb%27s+diameter%2C+with+three+shades+of+grassy+hills%2C+sandy+beaches%2C+two+shallow+turquoise+seas%2C+and+a+snowy+mountain+near+one+pole.+Start+with+four+pastel+houses%2C+a+white+windmill%2C+a+striped+cliff-top+lighthouse%2C+a+stone+well%2C+fences%2C+rounded+oaks%2C+narrow+pines%2C+and+palms+beside+the+coast.+Twelve+villagers+in+colorful+clothing+should+travel+between+homes+and+the+well%2C+while+eight+white+sheep+graze+nearby.+Three+puffy+clouds%2C+a+small+glowing+sun%2C+and+a+pale+moon+follow+curved+paths+around+the+world%2C+with+sun+and+moon+on+opposing+sides.+Use+clearly+defined%2C+gently+irregular+facets+for+the+terrain%2C+softened+by+the+visual+richness+of+individual+objects.+Roof+tiles%2C+tiny+chimney+rims%2C+wooden+fence+rails%2C+and+the+windmill%27s+canvas+sails+should+remain+distinct+at+village+level.+Seas+should+appear+shallow+near+the+sand+and+deepen+in+color+farther+from+shore%2C+with+modest+surface+movement.+The+orb+needs+visible+glass+thickness%2C+faint+green+edges%2C+and+reflections+that+leave+the+village+inspectable.+Contrast+its+hard+shine+with+the+stand%27s+warm+wood+grain%2C+the+cloth%27s+linen+weave%2C+chalky+windowsill+paint%2C+and+the+succulent%27s+fleshy+leaves.+Light+the+room+with+warm+evening+window+light+and+subdued+interior+fill%2C+while+the+little+sun+creates+moving+shadows+across+the+planet.+Let+day+pass+gradually+into+blue+twilight%3A+the+sun+sinks+behind+the+sphere%2C+windows+brighten%2C+and+the+lighthouse+sends+a+sweeping+beam+across+the+sea.+In+Night+mode%2C+darken+the+surrounding+room%2C+let+the+moon+illuminate+silver+edges+on+terrain%2C+and+add+a+few+drifting+fireflies+inside+the+glass.+Clouds+should+occasionally+pass+overhead+and+release+fine+rain+that+briefly+darkens+the+ground+and+visibly+advances+nearby+trees%27+growth.+Provide+a+cream-and-pastel+tool+dock+for+placing+trees%2C+houses%2C+windmills%2C+lighthouses%2C+mountains%2C+lakes%2C+flowers%2C+clouds%2C+villagers%2C+and+sheep%2C+plus+Raise+Land%2C+Lower+Land%2C+and+Remove.+Every+placed+object+should+stand+upright+relative+to+its+patch+of+spherical+ground%2C+settling+with+a+small+bounce+and+sparkles%3B+lowered+terrain+should+admit+water.+Drag+empty+space+to+spin+the+planet+with+gentle+inertia.+Show+its+editable+name%2C+initially+%E2%80%9CLittle+Meadow%2C%E2%80%9D+population%2C+happiness%2C+and+day+count.+Grow+advances+village+development+through+new+homes%2C+paths%2C+and+trees.+Include+Orb%2C+Surface%2C+Orbit%2C+and+Village+views+and+an+interruptible+25-second+tour+from+planting+and+rain+to+the+illuminated+nighttime+village>\\r\\n\\r\\nBuild an interactive 3D orbital gravity simulator in a single HTML file  \\r\\nusing Three.js. Let me click and drag to launch new planets with different  \\r\\nmasses and velocities, visualize their orbital trails, and adjust gravity  \\r\\nand time speed with sliders.\\r\\n\\r\\nRun  \\r\\n\\u2192<https://c.gle/AAuDWvnmneQBuAaV4DGy3iwVnwlP628J83CAG9wdKikaOJEDaq0piVSWpdcpfvbnrHyCzmHnuHkBnLIje0l3O47xQjD9wqpfZZcnBFrOWeebpPl8khHh8rxUyzuCB1_7lqHHe4tTrGAPyvFy5kRRgMKuG_qFDxHgfgTziIBb0tB9YZNtVQdN8UxghekXholIQvnX2A1pueIvh3HzrOxc2OA2-5jsn0uJcn1laOnA3lISF_mvZsxvImrTLZ276B7D8UUXY5KrqzdXGozZXSqGP-a0FAjkfAglUstYjUkysuXQDwcd6YBqVVcXist8fqxR4ak53vCVYS_HfWppijl_EkmqmQ6CqiTM9Vkt_B9KBCp8g6XabHJg0B26zTKfIIqrSAOnOieoAUn3FYYNNr_IwaTzPq0-Gbs8RFuiyXD1tspYM02GRxaH4qt7r8bquiECbEpXr6MHqv6u-Lg_P0T2-MHRjc1iX03biEbWglsgUhfxCGXty0LlfO__UuS2zqCVnIDRIlU>\\r\\n\\r\\nHappy building,\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Google AI Studio team\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u00a9 2026 Google LLC 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043, USA\\r\\n\\r\\nThis email was sent to raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com because you signed  \\r\\nup to receive emails about Google AI. If you do not wish to receive these  \\r\\nemails, please  \\r\\nunsubscribe<https://myaccount.google.com/communication-preferences/unsubscri