e></td></tr>                                                                                                               <!-- End of Skinny Banner -->                                  </tbody><tbody>                <tr style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse;\\\">                  <td class=\\\"content\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; padding: 10px 52px 0;\\\">                    <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; border-width: 0;\\\">                      <tbody>                        <tr style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse;\\\">                          <td style=\\\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\\\">                            <table bgcolor=\\\"#ffffff\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" class=\\\"body\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; border-width: 0;\\\">                              <tbody>                                                                                                            <tr style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse;\\\"><td style=\\\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 12px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; padding: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr>                                                                                                                                              <tr style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse;\\\"><td style=\\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 16px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; padding: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr>     <tr style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse;\\\">        <td class=\\\"detected-link component-margin degrees-hero\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; text-decoration: none;\\\">                          <h1 style=\'font-family: \\\"Helvetica\\\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.03em; line-height: 52px; margin: 0 0 30px;\'>There\'s more than one way to understand AI</h1>                                                                      <!-- START p.html -->                                                                     <p class=\\\"degrees-hero\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\'font-weight: \\\"normal\\\"; font-family: \\\"Helvetica\\\", Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 28px; margin: 0;\'>                                                                 AI is changing how we work with data, solve problems, and make decisions. But understanding AI goes beyond knowing how to use it. That\'s why Ball State University, in partnership with Coursera, has launched two new online graduate certificates, offering different ways to explore the technology shaping our world.<br><br>Explore the certificate that matches your interests and experience:                                                                    </p>                                        <!-- END p.html-->                                                    <!-- START p.html -->                                 <div style=\\\"height: 24px;\\\">&nbsp;</div>                                        <p class=\\\"degrees-hero\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\'font-weight: \\\"normal\\\"; font-family: \\\"Helvetica\\\", Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 28px; margin: 0;\'>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  <b>                                                                                <a href=\\\"https://link.coursera.org/f/a/sHOs_2PtdsJ9Ol1RKaDChg~~/AAQRxRA~/Z-YEOr8h5vbHWlruhjuiTrbfpxJMtqx2KwUyfP9PDSFNQSJijqCH0jOMKGfwTc71kIJEZvZK9gI304jLcUP3C5FM95li9ige6niaiqZpsGKdKRD8-2a9v4cKMtfVLzdLp4BrXQcsBotKPE-eIvmIS2rDkFvFmjhpZjw9rALo_36OrkrzpoLtYa5HClw8l5iBD_dFQM15c5qGYbhnz0RKN0OU7pj2DpjRwVc3jEYouxkZs2MZBdHdUCQkvI3UA5fTE_kZ9vtci-1DQ0QD84QAfV5abyT2CdwNZsZtZrJi_xGva2-fEpvjX5LXBo_mO_q0wuIsAQGZPRCtdQc86Gfd2yg1B_gB7OGfI9nhHmiZUsZoUehWQqGPoFzZfkRShkCvMA3a_jXKR3yyXi6MJl2RpV893tnGSH_LDNbZDtL8zqdQWxjG4yjlKoqfmqe4A5mrSamQw4id-X_yo4-bdtyZpRII7XDG8LIHQyImOZjWlgg~\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit;\\\">AI Foundations: Data Analytics and Machine Learning Graduate Certificate</a></b><br>Learn how to work with data using Python, uncover meaningful insights, and build and evaluate machine learning models to solve real-world problems. No prior computer science background is required.<br><br><b>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <a href=\\\"https://link.coursera.org/f/a/S1B_fXJKokw8L-4mE0cIAg~~/AAQRxRA~/dTJo5VjM0qPZSGr