('o9pt5innft','2026-10-17 16:35:41.785593','2026-10-17 16:35:41.785593','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'afe3rn3r5g','Communication',0,'','{\n \"_user_tags\": null,\n \"bcc\": null,\n \"cc\": null,\n \"comment_type\": \"\",\n \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-15 07:42:35\",\n \"communication_medium\": \"Email\",\n \"communication_type\": \"Communication\",\n \"content\": \"\\n\\n\\n    <meta content=\\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\\">\\n\\n\\n<table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#f1f1f4\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px;font-family: Arial;height:100%;\\\">\\n    <tbody><tr>\\n        <td>\\n            <table id=\\\"table-new-invitation\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding: 40px 0;max-width: 960px;min-width: 600px;width: 60%;\\\">\\n                    <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" height=\\\"50\\\" style=\\\"height: 50px;\\\"> <img src=\\\"http://us06web.zoom.us/w_p/gEmYNhIjSRuYgym3Hq18yA/a8167f6b-5e7f-4207-9db2-cf1b23d2b798.jpg\\\" height=\\\"50\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-height:50px;padding-top: 22px;padding-bottom: 16px;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"> </td> </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                    <td valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#ffffff\\\">\\n                        <table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;\\\">\\n                            <tbody><tr>\\n                                <td style=\\\"padding-left: 32px;padding-right: 32px;\\\">\\n                                    <table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px;color: #39394d;font-family: Arial;\\\">\\n                                        <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:32px;font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #131619;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\">Hi  Ayush Ayush,</td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:32px;font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #131619;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\">Thank you for registering for Generative AI Mastermind -IND. You can find information about this webinar below.</td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr><td style=\\\"height: 32px;\\\"></td></tr>\\n                                            <tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom: 8px;height:auto;font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #131619;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\"> We&#39;re excited to have you with us for the Gen AI Mastermind, a weekend experience designed to help you explore practical applications of Generative AI.<br><br>Over the sessions, you&#39;ll learn:<br><br>Session : Build your Own AI Employee<br><br>Build and customize AI assistants for your role<br>Create AI agents for task automation<br>Markdown prompting<br>Building your own AI Employee &amp; personal agent<br>Future of AI Employees &amp; autonomous workflows<br><br>The sessions are designed to be beginner-friendly, with a strong focus on implementation rather than theory.<br><br>Frequently asked questions:<br><br>The event is conducted live and completely online.<br>No prior AI experience is required.<br>Recordings are not shared, so attending the live sessions is recommended.<br>Participants will receive resources and guidance to continue learning beyond the event.<br>All you need is a laptop and an internet connection.<br><br>Looking forward to learning with you.<br>Team Outskill </td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr><td style=\\\"height: 32px;\\\"></td></tr>\\n                                            <tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #131619;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\"> Please submit any questions to: <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: #000000;text-decoration:none;\\\"> hi@outskill.com</a> </td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr><td style=\\\"height: 32px;\\\"></td></tr>\\n                                            <tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #000;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"> You can <a href=\\\"https://us06web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_KfycUZqmQraTeeUBKr_exw?tk=ryphh3AftQeQMyBoYRacBFecqPaltMe9zz7GOckauJA.DQkAAAATAl4gXhY0Tm1SeE5QQVMxLUtrZmVJdFBwNjhRAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA#detail\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">cancel</a> your registration at any time. </td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr><td style=\\\"height: 32px;\\\"></td></tr>\\n                                        <tr> <td colspan=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;color: #000;font-family: Arial;line-height: 24px;\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"> Thank you! </td> </tr>\\n                                        <tr>\\n                                            <td width=\\\"100%\\\">\\n                                                <table style=\\\"width:100%;border-radius: 8px;background-color: #F7F7FC;\\\">\\n                                                        <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"padding: 12px 16px 8px 16px;font-size: 14px;font-weight: 700;line-height: 24px;\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\">  <strong>Generative AI Mastermind -IND</strong> </td> </tr>\\n                                                            <tr>\\n                                                                <td valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding: 4px 16px 8px 16px;width: 112px;font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;line-height: 16px;color: rgba(4, 4, 19, 0.56);\\\">Date &amp; Time</td>\\n                                                                <td valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\