adding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;\\\">Here&#39;s a customer support router I&#39;ll use to show the pattern. It should:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"ee\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-left:0px;\\\" class=\\\"edm_outlooklist\\\"><ul style=\\\"font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:12px !important;margin-top:12px !important;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\\\"><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;\\\">answer order-status questions when it can</span></p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;\\\">sort other requests into a few buckets</span></p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;\\\">escalate anything unclear</span></p></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h4 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:700;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Step 1: let code do the obvious work</b></span></h4></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;\\\">Say a customer writes:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px 4px 12px 4px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspaci