0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Inside you&#39;ll discover: </p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"ee\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-left:0px;\\\" class=\\\"edm_outlooklist\\\"><ul style=\\\"font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:12px !important;margin-top:12px !important;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\\\"><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> A curated collection of 200+ profitable opportunities spanning content creation, e-commerce, gaming, and emerging digital markets\\u2014each vetted for real-world potential </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Step-by-step implementation guides designed for beginners, making AI accessible regardless of your technical background </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Cutting-edge strategies aligned with current market trends, ensuring your ventures stay ahead of the curve </p></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Download your guide today and unlock a future where artificial intelligence powers your success. Your next income stream is waiting. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Get Your Guide</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>#AD 2</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"take-the-prompts-our-creative-team-\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">Take the prompts our creative team actually uses</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:570px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/9411dc7c-3dd1-4e2b-be71-0d77cfd3959b/v3-1200x600-option1__1_.png?t=1790712058\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"570\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>key</span></a> to maintaining brand quality at scale? Mastering how to communicate with AI models and embedding them into your creative strategy. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Join our honest discussion with Ari Murray, Chief Digital Officer at Salt and Stone, and get 5 tips for expert LLM prompting with ready to run prompts. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Register and get the prompts</span></a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"b\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#030712\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color: #FFFFFF;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#B8EF43\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td><span style=\\\"padding-left:1px;\\\"></span></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"tw\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/x_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"ig\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/instagram_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"yt\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/youtube_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"in\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/linkedin_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td><span style=\\\"padding-left:1px;\\\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"10\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:10px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"w\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:15px 15px 15px 15px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> Update your email preferences or unsubscribe <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#FFFFFF!important;color:#FFFFFF!important;\\\"> here</a></p><p class=\\\"copyright\\\" style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> &copy; 2026 Staying Ahead with AI </p><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> 228 Park Ave S, #29976, New York, New York 10003, United States </p></td></tr><tr style=\\\"display: table-row !important;\\\"><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:20px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"display:table !important;\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"display:table-row !important;\\\"><td class=\\\"u\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" style=\\\"height:32px;display:table-cell !important; max-height: 32px !important;margin:0px !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;\\\"><a style=\\\"line-height:32px !important;text-decoration:none;display:block !important;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><img width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"beehiiv logo\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block !important;max-width:16px !important;vertical-align:-3px !important;width:16px !important;height:16px !important;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=pad,format=png,onerror=redirect,quality=100,width=16,height=16,gravity=center,background=transparent,dpr=2/output-onlinepngtools.png\\\"><span style=\\\"padding-left:11px !important;display: inline-block !important;\\\">Powered by beehiiv</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://email.beehiivstatus.com/ff95ec6265c2815bc869931c1d807a8ac5d2bb0e/hclick\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:03.764381\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"20261012.125644.ee6e0ccd@mta20\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:03.980880\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"ael5boecvc\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"\\\"raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com\\\" <raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com>\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00108\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"vaibhav@outskillwithai.com\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"Vaibhav Sisinty\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"cost per successfully completed task\",\n \"text_content\": \"----------\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/06e9e26b-31e3-41b9-8d33-1e4fc1dccda7/Frame_2147225035.png?t=1785742897)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\n\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nEvery agent demo looks cheap, then you put it in front of customers and the bill shows up.\\n\\nTake a simple support agent. It classifies emails, looks up order status, drafts replies and hands the weird cases to a human. In a demo, it runs smoothly and costs pennies.\\n\\nIn production, it sends the full conversation back to the model on every step, uses a top-tier model to decide whether an email is about shipping or a refund, and pays for reasoning on questions a few lines of code could have answered.\\n\\nI\'ve started calling the fix the **$0.01 architecture**. The number is a design target, so some requests will cost more and most should cost far less.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n## **Tools of the Week**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n* [LiteLLM](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm)**:** one OpenAI-style interface for 100+ LLM providers, as a Python SDK or a self-hosted gateway with spend tracking.\\n\\n* [Langfuse](https://langfuse.com/)**:** open-source tracing, evals and cost tracking for LLM apps, so you can see which route each request took and what it cost you.\\n\\n* [OpenAI Batch API](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/batch)**:** 50% off standard prices if you can wait up to 24 hours for results. Good for nightly evals or reclassifying an old backlog of tickets.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **The basic idea**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nMost agent workflows are a chain of small decisions:\\n\\n* Is this a shipping request or a refund request?\\n\\n* Does this message contain an order ID?\\n\\n* Should I ask a follow-up question?\\n\\n* Is this output valid?\\n\\n* Do I need a model here?\\n\\nYour smartest model doesn\'t need to touch most of these. The setup I\'d use runs in this order:\\n\\n1. Rules and cache first\\n\\n2. A cheap model second\\n\\n3. Validation in code\\n\\n4. A stronger model only when validation fails\\n\\n5. Human review at the edge\\n\\nHere\'s how a request moves through it:\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/14e527f8-fcd6-4fde-b557-2834c65f789e/Frame_2147225178__1_.png?t=1791794606)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nAny stage that produces a valid answer returns it right there, so a request only moves further down the chain when the stage before it couldn\'t handle it.\\n\\nExpensive reasoning becomes an escalation path you pay for only when you need it.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **Why this matters**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nThe price gap between model tiers is why.\\n\\nOn [OpenAI\'s current pricing](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing), [GPT-6 Astra ](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-astra)costs $10 per million input tokens and $50 per million output tokens.\\n\\n[GPT-6 Luna](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-luna), the most efficient model in the family, costs $0.10 and $0.50. That\'s a 100x difference for every token you send.\\n\\nSo I go through the workflow step by step and decide which part of it deserves intelligence.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **A simple support agent**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nHere\'s a customer support router I\'ll use to show the pattern. It should:\\n\\n* answer order-status questions when it can\\n\\n* sort other requests into a few buckets\\n\\n* escalate anything unclear\\n\\n#### **Step 1: let code do the obvious work**\\n\\nSay a customer writes:\\n\\n\\u201c\\\"Where is order #12345?\\\"\\u201c \\u2014 \\n\\nYou don\'t need an LLM for that. You can pull out the order number, check that the message is asking about tracking, and look the order up directly.\\n\\n\\n\\n```\\nimport re\\n\\nORDERS = {\\n    \\\"12345\\\": \\\"shipped\\\",\\n    \\\"67890\\\": \\\"processing\\\",\\n}\\n\\ndef check_order(message):\\n    match = re.search(r\\\"\\\\border\\\\s*#?\\\\s*(\\\\d{5})\\\\b\\\", message, re.I)\\n    if not match:\\n        return None\\n\\n    if not re.search(r\\\"\\\\b(status|track|where|shipped)\\\\b\\\", message, re.I):\\n        return None\\n\\n    order_id = match.group(1)\\n    status = ORDERS.get(order_id)\\n\\n    if status:\\n        return f\\\"Order {order_id} is currently {status}.\\\"\\n    return None\\n```\\n\\n\\nThat path costs nothing in model spend.\\n\\nIn a production system you\'d also verify the customer\'s identity and permissions before sharing order details, but the principle holds: if code can answer it reliably, let code answer it.\\n\\n#### **Step 2: use a cheap model for routing**\\n\\nNow take a message like:\\n\\n\\u201c\\\"I want to return my headphones.\\\"\\u201c \\u2014 \\n\\nThis one needs some interpretation, but it\'s still a narrow task. We only need a label, so there\'s no reason to pay for a long chain of reasoning.\\n\\nI hand it to GPT-6 Luna, which OpenAI built for [focused, high-volume tasks](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-luna) like this one.\\n\\n\\n\\n```\\nREPLIES = {\\n    \\\"shipping\\\": \\\"Please send your order ID.\\\",\\n    \\\"refund\\\": \\\"Your refund request needs review.\\\",\\n    \\\"other\\\": \\\"Please share a bit more detail.\\\",\\n}\\n\\ndef handle(message):\\n    # 1. Code first: zero model spend\\n    result = check_order(message)\\n    if result:\\n        return result\\n\\n    # 2. Cheap model, reasoning off\\n    label = classify(message)\\n\\n    # 3. Escalate only if the cheap model\'s answer failed validation\\n    if label is None:\\n        label = classify(\\n            message, model=\\\"gpt-6.1-sol\\\", effort=\\\"low\\\", max_tokens=2000\\n        )\\n\\n    # 4. Human at the edge\\n    return REPLIES.get(label, \\\"Human review required.\\\")\\n```\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **What I\'d add in production**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nBefore I put this in front of customers, I\'d add a few things:\\n\\n* spending limits per task\\n\\n* structured outputs, so the model returns a fixed schema you can check\\n\\n* logging for every route and every escalation\\n\\n* evaluation sets with labeled examples\\n\\n* prompt caching for policies and reusable context ([cached input on Luna](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-luna) is billed at 10% of the normal input price)\\n\\n* human review rules for sensitive actions like refunds\\n\\nAnd I\'d track one number above the rest: **cost per successfully completed task**.\\n\\nCost per call and cost per token can look great while the agent is cheap and wrong. Cost per correctly handled task shows you quality and spend in the same number.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **My take**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nFor the last couple of years, most of the conversation has been about what models can do. The question I find more interesting now is which parts of a workflow need a model at all.\\n\\nAnswering it changes how you build.\\n\\nSometimes the right answer is a strong reasoning model, sometimes it\'s a cheap classifier, and a surprising amount of the time it\'s a regex and a database call.\\n\\nI think the teams that figure out this split early will ship agents that can grow without the bill growing at the same pace.\\n\\n**Until then,**\\n**Vaibhav **\\ud83e\\udd1d\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n**If you read till here, you might find this interesting**\\n\\n**#AD 1**\\n\\n### How can AI power your income?\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/c9b92841-d124-4eb8-9e61-1c60fc4730d1/MakeMoneyAI_V2.png?t=1744398995)\\nFollow image link: (https://offers.hubspot.com/make-money-with-ai?utm_medium=email-media-newsletter&utm_source=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_campaign=creator&utm_content=beehiiv&utm_term=version-b&_bhiiv=opp_3a46d2ae-1f55-446e-87d6-dd354fd97f22_64797c8f&bhcl_id=32d1eabe-c39d-4295-8e11-d698b271e773_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nReady to transform artificial intelligence from a buzzword into your personal revenue generator\\n\\nHubSpot\\u2019s groundbreaking guide \\\"[200+ AI-Powered Income Ideas](https://offers.hubspot.com/make-money-with-ai?utm_medium=email-media-newsletter&utm_source=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_campaign=creator&utm_content=beehiiv&utm_term=version-b&_bhiiv=opp_3a46d2ae-1f55-446e-87d6-dd354fd97f22_64797c8f&bhcl_id=32d1eabe-c39d-4295-8e11-d698b271e773_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\\" is your gateway to financial innovation in the digital age.\\n\\nInside you\'ll discover:\\n\\n* A curated collection of 200+ profitable opportunities spanning content creation, e-commerce, gaming, and emerging digital markets\\u2014each vetted for real-world potential\\n\\n* Step-by-step implementation guides designed for beginners, making AI accessible regardless of your technical background\\n\\n* Cutting-edge strategies aligned with current market trends, ensuring your ventures stay ahead of the curve\\n\\nDownload your guide today and unlock a future where artificial intelligence powers your success. Your next income stream is waiting.\\n\\n[Get Your Guide](https://offers.hubspot.com/make-money-with-ai?utm_medium=email-media-newsletter&utm_source=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_campaign=creator&utm_content=beehiiv&utm_term=version-b&_bhiiv=opp_3a46d2ae-1f55-446e-87d6-dd354fd97f22_64797c8f&bhcl_id=32d1eabe-c39d-4295-8e11-d698b271e773_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n**#AD 2**\\n\\n### Take the prompts our creative team actually uses\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/9411dc7c-3dd1-4e2b-be71-0d77cfd3959b/v3-1200x600-option1__1_.png?t=1790712058)\\nFollow image link: (https://hightouch.com/amplify-your-creative-strategy-with-ai?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=webinar-oct-fy27&utm_content=secondary-v2&utm_term=8AWZ8QR5IO&_bhiiv=opp_deaa8a07-ff29-4c24-8547-3f40a09c1a51_395f767c&bhcl_id=62c1fc3a-b810-4a61-a7ab-a1a89b937a47_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nThe [key](https://hightouch.com/amplify-your-creative-strategy-with-ai?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=webinar-oct-fy27&utm_content=secondary-v2&utm_term=8AWZ8QR5IO&_bhiiv=opp_deaa8a07-ff29-4c24-8547-3f40a09c1a51_395f767c&bhcl_id=62c1fc3a-b810-4a61-a7ab-a1a89b937a47_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) to maintaining brand quality at scale? Mastering how to communicate with AI models and embedding them into your creative strategy. \\n\\nJoin our honest discussion with Ari Murray, Chief Digital Officer at Salt and Stone, and get 5 tips for expert LLM prompting with ready to run prompts. \\n\\n[Register and get the prompts](https://hightouch.com/amplify-your-creative-strategy-with-ai?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=webinar-oct-fy27&utm_content=secondary-v2&utm_term=8AWZ8QR5IO&_bhiiv=opp_deaa8a07-ff29-4c24-8547-3f40a09c1a51_395f767c&bhcl_id=62c1fc3a-b810-4a61-a7ab-a1a89b937a47_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n\\n----------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nYou are reading a plain text version of this post. For the best experience, copy and paste this link in your browser to view the post online:\\nhttps://newsletter.stayingahead.com/p/one-cent-architecture\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-12 18:26:44\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:04.134595\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Vaibhav\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:04.134595\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"aepiosl5ig\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ael5boecvc\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-12 18:26:44\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:04.135061\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 2,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Raiaayushhectocorn2029\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:04.135061\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"aep2q8ro0c\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ael5boecvc\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  }\n ],\n \"uid\": 2013,\n \"unread_notification_sent\": 0,\n \"user\": \"Administrator\"\n}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('o9qpjjhdev','2026-10-17 16:35:41.863690','2026-10-17 16:35:41.863690','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'aesl1k26a7','Communication',0,'','{\n \"_user_tags\": null,\n \"bcc\": null,\n \"cc\": null,\n \"comment_type\": \"\",\n \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-13 18:24:46\",\n \"communication_medium\": \"Email\",\n \"communication_type\": \"Communication\",\n \"content\": \"<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><!--[if !mso]&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!--><meta content=\\\"IE=edge\\\"><!--&amp;lt;![endif]--><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><meta name=\\\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\\\"><meta name=\\\"format-detection\\\" content=\\\"telephone=no,address=no,email=no,date=no,url=no\\\"><meta name=\\\"color-scheme\\\" content=\\\"light\\\"><meta name=\\\"supported-color-schemes\\\" content=\\\"light\\\"><title>Is software done?</title><!--[if mso]&amp;gt;&amp;lt;xml&amp;gt;&amp;lt;o:OfficeDocumentSettings&amp;gt;&amp;lt;o:AllowPNG/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;o:PixelsPerInch&amp;gt;96&amp;lt;/o:PixelsPerInch&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/o:OfficeDocumentSettings&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/xml&amp;gt;&amp;lt;![endif]--><style>\\n  :root { color-scheme: light; supported-color-schemes: light; }\\n  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; min-width: 100%!important; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100% !important; -webkit-transform: scale(1) !important; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100% !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important; }\\n  .body { word-wrap: normal; word-spacing:normal; }\\n  table.mso { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; padding: 0; table-layout: fixed; }\\n  img { border: 0; outline: none; }\\n  table {  mso-table-lspace: 0px; mso-table-rspace: 0px; }\\n  td, a, span {  mso-line-height-rule: exactly; }\\n  #root [x-apple-data-detectors=true],\\n  a[x-apple-data-detectors=true],\\n  #MessageViewBody a { color: inherit !important; text-decoration: inherit !important; font-size: inherit !important; font-family: inherit !important; font-weight: inherit !important; line-height: inherit !important; }\\n  span.MsoHyperlink { color: inherit !important; mso-style-priority: 99 !important; }\\n  span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed { color: inherit !important; mso-style-priority: 99 !important; }\\n  .a { background-color:#FFFFFF; }\\n  .b { background-color:#030712; }\\n  .c  { background-color:#FFFFFF; }\\n  .d { background-color:#000000; }\\n  .d2 { background-color:#FFFFFF; }\\n  .d3 { background-color:#FFFFFF; }\\n  h1 a { text-decoration:underline;color:#4882D4 !important; }\\n  h2 a { text-decoration:underline;color:#4882D4 !important; }\\n  h3 a { text-decoration:underline;color:#4882D4 !important; }\\n  h4 a { text-decoration:underline;color:#4882D4 !important; }\\n  h5 a { text-decoration:underline;color:#4882D4 !important; }\\n  h6 a { text-decoration:underline;color:#4882D4 !important; }\\n  h1, h1 a, h2, h2 a, h3, h3 a, h4, h4 a, h5, h5 a, h6, h6 a, ul, li, ol, p, p a { margin: 0;padding: 0; }\\n  h1 { font-family:\'Lora\',Palatino,\'Book Antiqua\',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:26px;color:#000000;line-height:1.75;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;mso-margin-top-alt:0px;mso-margin-bottom-alt:0px }\\n  h2 { font-family:\'Trebuchet MS\',\'Lucida Grande\',Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:24px;color:#000000;line-height:1.5;padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:16px;mso-margin-top-alt:16px;mso-margin-bottom-alt:4px }\\n  h3 { font-family:\'Lora\',Palatino,\'Book Antiqua\',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;color:#000000;line-height:1.25;padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:16px;mso-margin-top-alt:16px;mso-margin-bottom-alt:4px }\\n  h4 { font-family:\'Lora\',Palatino,\'Book Antiqua\',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#000000;line-height:1.125;padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:16px;mso-margin-top-alt:16px;mso-margin-bottom-alt:4px }\\n  h5 { font-family:\'Trebuchet MS\',\'Lucida Grande\',Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;color:#000000;line-height:1;padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:16px;mso-marg