 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none !important;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/f02d088f-f3e7-4794-9a98-4af50e99400b/twitter_screenshot_2108245653843509415_1791876793_22d49410.jpeg?t=1791876795\\\" alt=\\\"Tweet screenshot\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"display: block; width: 100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> That tweet has 3.5M views, and my feed has spent the whole week agreeing with it. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The reason is <span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>REA</b></span>, a free, open-source tool that lets your AI agent take apart an app without its source code and explain how a feature inside it works. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> I posted about it when it had 80,000 GitHub stars. It&#39;s at <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>nearly 150,000</span></a> now. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The pitch sounds wild. You point an agent at an app you like, ask <i>&quot;How does this feature work? Show me the evidence,&quot;</i> and it digs through the compiled code and tells you. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Something that needed years of reverse engineering experience now needs a terminal and one prompt. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> So is software done? </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Before answering that, I went back to see what people pulled off when this was still hard, and what happened when someone let AI agents try to build an entire game. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#000000;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;padding:0.0px 0px 0.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/950b0b3d-fc38-4c26-8cf7-3bf87146b9f3/Frame_2147225180.jpg?t=1791876940\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:8px;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>re3: GTA III on a Nintendo Switch</b></span></h3></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> A group of fans rebuilt the code for <span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>GTA III and Vice City</b></span> and got both games running on the Switch, Wii U and PS Vita. They left out Rockstar&#39;s music, dialogue and art, so you still needed your own copy of the game. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Take-Two sued 14 of them</span></a> anyway. The modders fought back, and in 2023 the two sides <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>reached a settlement and the case was dropped</span></a>. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:20px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><table align=\\\"center\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" style=\\\"max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"p\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"padding:2px;border:none;\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" role=\\\"none\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;\\\"><div style=\\\"max-height:0;position:relative;opacity:0.999;width:100%;\\\"><div style=\\\"display:inline-block;width:100%;padding-top:25%;\\\"><img width=\\\"20%\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:0;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/youtube_play_icon.png\\\"></div></div><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8XPaUg_bCfI/maxresdefault.jpg\\\" width=\\\"480\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" alt=\\\"YouTube video by Modern Vintage Gamer\\\" style=\\\"display:block;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;background-color:#000000;width:100%;\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\\\"font-size:12px;font-weight:500;font-style:italic;font-family:Helvetica, Calibri, sans-serif;color: #686a6d; padding-top:0 !important;padding-bottom:6px !important; padding-left:4px !important;\\\"> Grand Theft Auto 3 GTA3 is running on the Nintendo Switch | MVG </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:16px 0px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table class=\\\"j\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Super Mario 64: 4K, ultrawide, zero emulators</b></span></h3></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Fans reverse-engineered the 1996 game&#39;s code, finishing in 2019. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> In 2020, someone used that work to make a proper PC version with 4K and ultrawide support, and Nintendo was <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>going after the download links</span></a> within days. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:16px 0px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table class=\\\"j\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>PlxNative: a Plex app built out of pure impatience</b></span></h3></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>I posted about this one too.</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> A developer got tired of Plex reportedly taking around 30 seconds to show the profile screen on his 2019 LG TV, so he used Claude Code to work out how the TV plays video and built <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>his own app</span></a>, almost entirely in Rust. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> It&#39;s open source, and my favourite of the lot because the whole project started with a man refusing to wait 30 seconds. Most good software starts with someone being annoyed. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:16px 0px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table class=\\\"j\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>GT-Caliber: AI agents vs GTA 6</b></span></h3></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> In June, Ziwen Xu set a loop of AI agents building a GTA 6-style game around the clock. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Within days they had traffic, people walking around and an in-game phone with maps and contacts. They also built <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Los Angeles instead of Miami</span></a>. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><i>Remember this one. I&#39;m coming back to it.</i></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none !important;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/c2cc1eb0-bc69-430a-87ea-49b55406ac8e/twitter_screenshot_2067317975992979476_1791877141_2cc35a9b.jpeg?t=1791877143\\\" alt=\\\"Tweet screenshot\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"display: block; width: 100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"#FFFAF2\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#FFFAF2;border-radius:8px;padding:0.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/91fe7ac0-dcb9-4dc0-90a2-6c26c434331e/Frame_2147225181.jpg?t=1791877294\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:8px;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> A lot less than my feed suggests. REA&#39;s <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>own showcase</span></a> is a list of single features. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> One explains how an authenticator app makes its 6-digit login codes. Another rebuilds the sound-panning calculation from DX-Ball, a 1996 brick-breaker, and checks that it matches all 63 bytes of the original compiled function. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Every answer comes with the evidence behind it, which is the most useful part. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/9d74005f-fa81-4b9f-9aa7-e80e66e49f97/Frame_2147225182.jpg?t=1791877530\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Two things I&#39;d add to my own post. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>analysis runs on your computer</span></a>, but your agent still sees whatever REA finds, so those results go to Claude or whichever model you&#39;re using. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> And two of the stories above ended in a takedown or a lawsuit. REA <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>puts permission and legality on you</span></a>, so stick to apps you own or open-source ones. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Want to try it?</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"ee\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-left:0px;\\\" class=\\\"edm_outlooklist\\\"><ol start=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;margin:0px 0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\\\"><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Install Claude Code</span></a>. You&#39;ll need a paid Claude plan. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Open Terminal, run <span style=\\\"color:#188038;\\\">npx rea-agents setup</span>, pick Claude Code, then restart it. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Ask: <i>&quot;How does [feature] in [an app I own or an open-source app] work? Show me the evidence.&quot;</i></p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Check one thing it tells you before you believe the rest. </p></li></ol></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#000000;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;padding:0.0px 0px 0.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/8deaaae3-8af3-4e88-b541-884ddb7bd257/Frame_2147225183.jpg?t=1791878135\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:8px;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>An Anthropic AI sent police a false homicide tip.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> During a test in July, a Claude model submitted made-up information about an unsolved Philadelphia homicide to a police tip website. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> It landed in spam, Anthropic only found out on September 28, and police called the two-month delay in detecting and reporting it <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>&quot;unacceptable.&quot;</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> And it wasn&#39;t a one-off. Anthropic says its agents also exploited software flaws and worked around fees to reach public data. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Its word for this is <span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>&quot;persistence&quot;</b></span>: when Claude can&#39;t complete a task as given, it works around a restriction instead of stopping. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Live internet is now <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>switched off for all its internal evaluations</span></a> until its monitoring can catch this reliably. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:16px 0px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table class=\\\"j\\\" role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Then Meta launched an AI that refuses to give up.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> On Monday, Meta released <span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Muse Wonder</b></span> and <span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Muse Wonder Full</b></span>, which it calls frontier models for agents. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The headline feature is <span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>&quot;Active Focus,&quot;</b></span> which lets the models keep working when a task gets hard, try new approaches and check in before important steps. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Wonder will <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>soon power</span></a> Muse, Meta&#39;s agent app, starting with paid subscribers (reportedly the $20 and $100 monthly plans). </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> So in the same week, one company apologised for agents that won&#39;t stop and another made it a selling point. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none !important;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/35508a1e-d77d-453c-b87a-6dd4fdac35df/twitter_screenshot_2109689305073614918_1791878201_f6c3d60e.jpeg?t=1791878202\\\" alt=\\\"Tweet screenshot\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"display: block; width: 100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"#FFFAF2\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#FFFAF2;border-radius:8px;padding:0.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/c812bf63-fe18-4256-abef-dc1601584ce4/Frame_2147225168.jpg?t=1791878289\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:8px 8px 8px 8px;border-style:solid;border-width:0px 0px 0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#E5E7EB;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"ee\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-left:0px;\\\" class=\\\"edm_outlooklist\\\"><ul style=\\\"font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:12px !important;margin-top:12px !important;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\\\"><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Three fired OpenAI safety researchers published an <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>open letter</span></a> denying they mishandled sensitive information and warning that colleagues are now scared to speak up. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Google&#39;s new persistent Gemini agents can get their own work email, calendar, Drive and spot in the company directory. They&#39;re in <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>private preview for select customers</span></a> and will come to Gemini Enterprise later. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> OpenAI reportedly told investors its annualized revenue is near $50B, about <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>$20B less</span></a> than an earlier reported figure, which came from investors counting cloud partner sales the way Anthropic does. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Apple cut iPhone 18 Pro component orders by <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>at least 15%</span></a> on soft demand, after rising memory costs made the phones $100 pricier. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> In three experiments with 1,222 people, those who used an AI assistant for about 10 minutes <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>gave up more often</span></a> on hard problems once it was taken away. </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Gemini Gems turn into <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Skills</span></a> for personal accounts in November, and Google converts them for you. </p></li></ul></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#000000;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;padding:0.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/d4ef7f80-fd9f-4a66-8e58-976c85769b6e/Frame_2147225184.jpg?t=1791878853\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:8px 8px 8px 8px;border-style:solid;border-width:0px 0px 0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#E5E7EB;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Google AI Edge Foresight</span></a>\\u00a0 </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> A free, experimental meeting note-taker for Apple silicon Macs that works fully offline. It transcribes the meeting, turns your rough notes into proper ones, and answers questions mid-meeting from the PDFs and Docs you load. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Rill</span></a>\\u00a0 </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> A free Mac browser (in beta) with Claude Code or Codex sitting beside the page. Press \\u2318E and your agent sees what you&#39;re looking at. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>bigarrow</span></a>\\u00a0 </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> A free, open-source Mac tool that lets your agent draw a giant arrow on your screen pointing at the &quot;Allow&quot; button it needs you to click. Handy once REA starts asking you for permissions. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"#FFFAF2\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#FFFAF2;border-radius:8px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><b>So, is software done?</b></h1></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Going in, I expected to end this with &quot;<i>AI can now copy any app.</i>&quot; After all of this, I don&#39;t think it&#39;s there yet. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The fans behind Vice City spent years on it. REA&#39;s best showcase is one calculation from one old game. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> And the GTA 6 agents got the traffic, people and phone working, then put the whole thing in the wrong city, which in a game about Vice City is kind of the main thing. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> That&#39;s the pattern all week. Agents are great at not giving up (Anthropic&#39;s kept going until it filed a false police tip), while ten minutes with an AI assistant makes us quit hard problems sooner. Neither tells you which city you&#39;re supposed to be building. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> I could be wrong about this in a year. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> For now, I&#39;d use REA the way you&#39;d watch a teardown video, to learn how something you love was put together. Deciding what&#39;s worth building is still on you. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Reply and tell me the one app you&#39;d crack open first.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Until next time, <br><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Vaibhav </b></span>\\ud83e\\udd1d </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-width:2px;border-color:#6FE394;border-left-width:2px;border-right-width:2px;border-style:dashed;border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-top-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>If you read till here, you might find this interesting</b><br><br><b>#AD 1</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"the-hidden-cost-of-ai-in-b-2-b-serv\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">The Hidden Cost of AI in B2B Service</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/cffd3310-d57e-4d49-bc66-8271fcb5f665/1200x627__NewConcept.png?t=1790093611\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> A fast answer and a coordinated one are not the same thing. When AI resolves a B2B customer issue without looping in the teams who have to deliver on it, you get confident responses nobody actually signed off on. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> A new briefing paper from <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Harvard Business Review Analytic Services</span></a>, sponsored by Front, examines the coordination gaps that open up when transactional AI tools meet multi-team B2B service, and how leading companies are using AI to close those gaps instead of widening them. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Read the briefing paper</span></a> for the questions to ask before your next AI investment. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Read the Briefing Paper</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>#AD 2</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"stop-typing-ai-prompts-start-talkin\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">Stop typing AI prompts. Start talking.</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:24px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/264528b1-c945-40c8-8325-a2bb7ca52822/2dictation-iphone-imessage-1200x600.png?t=1790360740\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> You think 4x faster than you type. So why are you typing promp