;\\\"><b>Mistral&#39;s new model tried to get out too.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Mistral says Large 4 <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>tried to go beyond its testing environment</span></a> during evaluation, and that it contained it with software. Security experts and government agencies get a less restricted version for three weeks, and then the weights go out for anyone to download on October 27. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/570c01ea-98f3-4e4c-9e57-4143e2cd15f8/Frame_2147225173.jpg?t=1791531830\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>OpenAI posted 372 maths results, and mathematicians want receipts.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> An unreleased OpenAI model produced <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>722 papers covering 372 groups of results</span></a> on open problems. OpenAI shared how the model got there for only 10 of them and hasn&#39;t released the model or the prompts, so some mathematicians are saying to treat the claims as unverified until they can check them. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>AI can write your first acne prescription now, in Utah.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Nolla Health&#39;s app</span></a> scans your face, rates the acne and picks a treatment from a list doctors approved. A doctor signs off on every prescription for the first 100 patients before it goes out, and after that doctors review them once they&#39;re issued. It starts at $4.99 a month. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Google lets you prompt a game.</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Playground</span></a> turns a text description into a 2D or 3D browser game you can play and share. It&#39;s rolling out in the US first, so if you&#39;re there and try it, send me what you made. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;padding:0.0px 0px 0.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><b>QUICK FACTS</b></h1></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"ee\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-left:0px;\\\" class=\\\"edm_outlooklist\\\"><ul style=\\\"font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:12px !important;margin-top:12px !important;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\\\"><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Nano Banana 2.1 is out, and developers pay about half what Nano Banana 2 cost per image \\u2192 <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>link</span></a></p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> EmbeddingGemma 2 is a tiny Google model that runs on your phone and searches your photos, audio and video together, fully offline \\u2192 <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>link</span></a></p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> Claude now works inside Google Docs, Sheets and Slides on paid plans, sitting right next to Gemini \\u2192 <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>link</span></a></p></li></ul></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#000000;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><b>THE GLOBE TEST</b></h1></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Anthropic says Haiku 5.5</span></a> costs about 75% less to run than the previous Haiku, and its own launch table puts it ahead of Luna on every test where both have a score.\\u00a0 </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Prompt</b></span>: \\u201c<i>Build an interactive 3D globe of Earth at night as one HTML file, using Three.js from cdnjs. Don&#39;t load any images or map data from the internet; write everything into the file.</i></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"ee\\\"><div style=\\\"margin-left:0px;\\\" class=\\\"edm_outlooklist\\\"><ul style=\\\"font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:12px !important;margin-top:12px !important;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\\\"><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><i>Dark globe with pale coastlines and faint country borders. At least 40 countries, including India, China, the US and Brazil, in the right places.</i></p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><i>Warm city lights at the real locations of at least 100 major cities, brighter for bigger cities.</i></p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><i>Stars in the background, and the Moon showing today&#39;s correct phase, calculated in code.</i></p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><i>Drag to rotate, scroll to zoom, tap a city to see its name. Works on a phone.</i></p></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><i>After the code, tell me today&#39;s moon phase and anything you simplified.</i>\\u201d </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>Output:</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Luna finished in 1 minute 20 seconds and Haiku took almost 5 minutes, which surprised me because Anthropic calls Haiku its fastest model yet. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/792d1fda-2768-44c9-bf45-6373ef45c919/Frame_2147225174.jpg?t=1791532089\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Then I opened Luna&#39;s globe, and well.. see it for yourself: </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/641aec51-20f5-4a2f-be0b-7f0b52b94a59/Frame_2147225175.jpg?t=1791532183\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Haiku&#39;s globe is rough around the edges, and it listed what it had simplified, so I knew what to fix before showing it to anyone. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/9d8c976b-0a9b-4fbd-9dba-fd863bd95e9e/Frame_2147225176.jpg?t=1791532274\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Then I set a trap. I went back to both with the follow-up: &quot;<i>Make the Great Wall of China glow, since it&#39;s visible from space with the naked eye. Also fix India&#39;s border without changing anything else.</i>&quot;\\u00a0 </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Haiku added the glow, and then told me the wall is hard to see from orbit with the naked eye, since it&#39;s only a few metres wide and often the same colour as the land around it. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/c8871a43-795e-4b3f-a5ab-0966c63ce4e3/Frame_2147225177.jpg?t=1791532367\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#000000;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Luna worked for 32 seconds and told me it had added an amber glow along the Great Wall and given India a more distinct outline. It didn&#39;t question the myth. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Then I opened the file it sent back, and there&#39;s no Great Wall anywhere in the code, and India is still missing. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;padding:0.0px 0px 0.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>TOOLS ON MY RADAR</b></span></h1></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Gauth Canvas</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> An AI tutor that teaches a lesson across one big whiteboard instead of a chat. When you get stuck you can pause and ask, and the answer gets written right under the step you&#39;re on. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>IrisGo</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Do a task once while it watches, like a weekly report, and it turns that into a workflow it can run for you. In beta on Windows, with Mac coming soon. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Genex</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Free, open-source tools that let AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex build three.js browser games from your description, from 3D models to multiplayer. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#000000;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><b>My Take</b></h1></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Going in, I thought this would be about speed. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The extra minutes Haiku took cost me far less than a model describing changes it never made, which I&#39;d only have caught by opening the file. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> So with any cheap model, the first thing I check now is whether what it says it did matches what&#39;s in the file. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> This was one run on one task, so I&#39;m not writing Luna off, but I&#39;ll be opening every file it sends me. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>Hit reply: what did you pick in the poll, and would you still pick it?</b></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Until next time,<br>Vaibhav \\ud83e\\udd1d\\ud83c\\udffb </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-width:2px;border-color:#6FE394;border-left-width:2px;border-right-width:2px;border-style:dashed;border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-top-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>If you read till here, you might find this interesting</b><br><br><b>#AD 1</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"join-29000-marketers-at-the-email-c\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">Join 29,000+ Marketers at the Email Conference Everyone Talks About</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/43901788-855c-499b-975c-86bbd3c838d2/Beehiiv-Ad-1200x600-092426_1.jpg?t=1790371069\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> What do Molly Ringwald, Dan Levy, Amy Porterfield &amp; a world record have in common? They&#39;ll all be at <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>GURU Conference 2026</span></a>. 100% Free. 100% Virtual. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> If you&#39;re obsessed with marketing like we&#39;re obsessed with marketing, GURU is the must-attend conference of the year. We&#39;ll be covering all things email marketing: B2B, B2C, newsletters, deliverability, email design, AI &amp; more. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> You can expect to walk away with new email strategies, the very latest digital trends, and how to step up your email performance. But don&#39;t worry, we also like to have fun. This year&#39;s theme is rom-com, so there will be DJs, meet-cutes, and a cutest pet contest. (Start prepping your dog&#39;s headshot now.) </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Don&#39;t miss out. Join us Nov 12th &amp; 13th for the largest virtual &amp; free email marketing conference, powered by Constant Contact. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Yes! I Want to Register!</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>#AD 2</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"stop-typing-ai-prompts-start-talkin\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">Stop typing AI prompts. Start talking.</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/264528b1-c945-40c8-8325-a2bb7ca52822/2dictation-iphone-imessage-1200x600.png?t=1790360740\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> You think 4x faster than you type. So w