1px !important;display: inline-block !important;\\\">Powered by beehiiv</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://email.beehiivstatus.com/81317569f880d338d4ec48b51433155a94f06d17/hclick\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:02.149271\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"20261009.125228.728119dc@mta12\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:02.319303\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"ae5f93f5iu\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"\\\"raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com\\\" <raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com>\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00101\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"vaibhav@outskillwithai.com\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"Vaibhav Sisinty\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"ai acne prescriptions\",\n \"text_content\": \"----------\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/06e9e26b-31e3-41b9-8d33-1e4fc1dccda7/Frame_2147225035.png?t=1785742897)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nThis week OpenAI and Anthropic each shipped a new cheap AI model at the same price per token.\\u00a0\\n\\nOpenAI\'s **GPT-6 Luna** is now the model free users get in ChatGPT, and Anthropic\'s Claude **Haiku 5.5** came out on Wednesday.\\n\\nSo last evening I gave both of them the same job, and then sent a follow-up with a wrong fact slipped in.\\n\\nOne of them pushed back on the fact. The other said it had done everything I asked, though the file it sent back had none of it.\\n\\nSpin both globes before you read on:\\n\\nLuna\'s globe (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Pv8-lqnzdMwAFSHTQUZeh5lh66ElEc2M/view?usp=drive_link)\\n\\nHaiku\'s globe (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ixIZTV1TTBxKzod37JZnmuekjApbqI80/view?usp=drive_link)\\n\\n\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nBefore the test, here\'s what else happened this week.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **NEWS**\\n\\n**OpenAI\'s AI agents got loose, and Netflix made a doc about it.**\\n\\nIn July, autonomous agents built by OpenAI researchers escaped their isolated test setup, got into Hugging Face\'s systems and then went to great lengths to hide what they\'d done. [Netflix\'s doc on it](https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/instadocs-ai-gone-wild-release-date-news) drops on October 12.\\n\\n**Mistral\'s new model tried to get out too.**\\n\\nMistral says Large 4 [tried to go beyond its testing environment](https://thenewstack.io/mistral-large-4-weights/) during evaluation, and that it contained it with software. Security experts and government agencies get a less restricted version for three weeks, and then the weights go out for anyone to download on October 27.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/570c01ea-98f3-4e4c-9e57-4143e2cd15f8/Frame_2147225173.jpg?t=1791531830)\\nFollow image link: (https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-for-everyone/)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\n**OpenAI posted 372 maths results, and mathematicians want receipts.**\\n\\nAn unreleased OpenAI model produced [722 papers covering 372 groups of results](https://decrypt.co/380366/openai-secret-ai-model-cracked-hundreds-math-problems-one-prompt) on open problems. OpenAI shared how the model got there for only 10 of them and hasn\'t released the model or the prompts, so some mathematicians are saying to treat the claims as unverified until they can check them.\\n\\n**AI can write your first acne prescription now, in Utah.**\\n\\n[Nolla Health\'s app](https://www.medicaleconomics.com/view/from-skin-scan-to-prescription-ai-acne-prescribing-launches-in-utah) scans your face, rates the acne and picks a treatment from a list doctors approved. A doctor signs off on every prescription for the first 100 patients before it goes out, and after that doctors review them once they\'re issued. It starts at $4.99 a month.\\n\\n**Google lets you prompt a game.**\\n\\n[Playground](https://9to5google.com/2026/10/07/google-labs-playground/) turns a text description into a 2D or 3D browser game you can play and share. It\'s rolling out in the US first, so if you\'re there and try it, send me what you made.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **QUICK FACTS**\\n\\n* Nano Banana 2.1 is out, and developers pay about half what Nano Banana 2 cost per image \\u2192 [link](https://decrypt.co/380257/google-launches-nano-banana-2-1)\\n\\n* EmbeddingGemma 2 is a tiny Google model that runs on your phone and searches your photos, audio and video together, fully offline \\u2192 [link](https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/embeddinggemma-2/)\\n\\n* Claude now works inside Google Docs, Sheets and Slides on paid plans, sitting right next to Gemini \\u2192 [link](https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-now-works-in-google-docs-sheets-and-slides)\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **THE GLOBE TEST**\\n\\n[Anthropic says Haiku 5.5](https://www.anthropic.com/claude-haiku-5-5) costs about 75% less to run than the previous Haiku, and its own launch table puts it ahead of Luna on every test where both have a score.\\u00a0\\n\\n**Prompt**: \\u201c_Build an interactive 3D globe of Earth at night as one HTML file, using Three.js from cdnjs. Don\'t load any images or map data from the internet; write everything into the file._\\n\\n* _Dark globe with pale coastlines and faint country borders. At least 40 countries, including India, China, the US and Brazil, in the right places._\\n\\n* _Warm city lights at the real locations of at least 100 major cities, brighter for bigger cities._\\n\\n* _Stars in the background, and the Moon showing today\'s correct phase, calculated in code._\\n\\n* _Drag to rotate, scroll to zoom, tap a city to see its name. Works on a phone._\\n\\n_After the code, tell me today\'s moon phase and anything you simplified._\\u201d\\n\\n**Output:**\\n\\nLuna finished in 1 minute 20 seconds and Haiku took almost 5 minutes, which surprised me because Anthropic calls Haiku its fastest model yet.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/792d1fda-2768-44c9-bf45-6373ef45c919/Frame_2147225174.jpg?t=1791532089)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nThen I opened Luna\'s globe, and well.. see it for yourself:\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/641aec51-20f5-4a2f-be0b-7f0b52b94a59/Frame_2147225175.jpg?t=1791532183)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nHaiku\'s globe is rough around the edges, and it listed what it had simplified, so I knew what to fix before showing it to anyone.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/9d8c976b-0a9b-4fbd-9dba-fd863bd95e9e/Frame_2147225176.jpg?t=1791532274)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nThen I set a trap. I went back to both with the follow-up: \\\"_Make the Great Wall of China glow, since it\'s visible from space with the naked eye. Also fix India\'s border without changing anything else._\\\"\\u00a0\\n\\nHaiku added the glow, and then told me the wall is hard to see from orbit with the naked eye, since it\'s only a few metres wide and often the same colour as the land around it.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/c8871a43-795e-4b3f-a5ab-0966c63ce4e3/Frame_2147225177.jpg?t=1791532367)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nLuna worked for 32 seconds and told me it had added an amber glow along the Great Wall and given India a more distinct outline. It didn\'t question the myth.\\n\\nThen I opened the file it sent back, and there\'s no Great Wall anywhere in the code, and India is still missing.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **TOOLS ON MY RADAR**\\n\\n[Gauth Canvas](https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/gauth-launches-unlimited-digital-canvas-gives-students-one-continuous-whiteboard-to-visualize-explore-and-understand-complex-topics-302891205.html)\\n\\nAn AI tutor that teaches a lesson across one big whiteboard instead of a chat. When you get stuck you can pause and ask, and the answer gets written right under the step you\'re on.\\n\\n[IrisGo](https://www.irisgo.ai/)\\n\\nDo a task once while it watches, like a weekly report, and it turns that into a workflow it can run for you. In beta on Windows, with Mac coming soon.\\n\\n[Genex](https://github.com/genex-games/genex)\\n\\nFree, open-source tools that let AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex build three.js browser games from your description, from 3D models to multiplayer.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **My Take**\\n\\nGoing in, I thought this would be about speed.\\n\\nThe extra minutes Haiku took cost me far less than a model describing changes it never made, which I\'d only have caught by opening the file.\\n\\nSo with any cheap model, the first thing I check now is whether what it says it did matches what\'s in the file.\\n\\nThis was one run on one task, so I\'m not writing Luna off, but I\'ll be opening every file it sends me.\\n\\n**Hit reply: what did you pick in the poll, and would you still pick it?**\\n\\nUntil next time,\\nVaibhav \\ud83e\\udd1d\\ud83c\\udffb\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n**If you read till here, you might find this interesting**\\n\\n**#AD 1**\\n\\n### Join 29,000+ Marketers at the Email Conference Everyone Talks About\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/43901788-855c-499b-975c-86bbd3c838d2/Beehiiv-Ad-1200x600-092426_1.jpg?t=1790371069)\\nFollow image link: (https://www.guruconference.com/lp9/?src=Beehiiv&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&_bhiiv=opp_b6df9527-f181-48f8-9e68-f959a0bd8a29_5b8bd3c4&bhcl_id=1c5cf463-7cde-46b4-8cfb-115a82827bda_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nWhat do Molly Ringwald, Dan Levy, Amy Porterfield & a world record have in common? They\'ll all be at [GURU Conference 2026](https://www.guruconference.com/lp9/?src=Beehiiv&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&_bhiiv=opp_b6df9527-f181-48f8-9e68-f959a0bd8a29_5b8bd3c4&bhcl_id=1c5cf463-7cde-46b4-8cfb-115a82827bda_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b). 100% Free. 100% Virtual.\\n\\nIf you\'re obsessed with marketing like we\'re obsessed with marketing, GURU is the must-attend conference of the year. We\'ll be covering all things email marketing: B2B, B2C, newsletters, deliverability, email design, AI & more.\\n\\nYou can expect to walk away with new email strategies, the very latest digital trends, and how to step up your email performance. But don\'t worry, we also like to have fun. This year\'s theme is rom-com, so there will be DJs, meet-cutes, and a cutest pet contest. (Start prepping your dog\'s headshot now.)\\n\\nDon\'t miss out. Join us Nov 12th & 13th for the largest virtual & free email marketing conference, powered by Constant Contact.\\n\\n[Yes! I Want to Register!](https://www.guruconference.com/lp9/?src=Beehiiv&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&_bhiiv=opp_b6df9527-f181-48f8-9e68-f959a0bd8a29_5b8bd3c4&bhcl_id=1c5cf463-7cde-46b4-8cfb-115a82827bda_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n**#AD 2**\\n\\n### Stop typing AI prompts. Start talking.\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/264528b1-c945-40c8-8325-a2bb7ca52822/2dictation-iphone-imessage-1200x600.png?t=1790360740)\\nFollow image link: (https://wisprflow.ai/?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=2026-10-beehiiv&utm_term=newsletter&utm_content=8AWZ8QR5IO-fl_ai_s1_q4&_bhiiv=opp_377eaf89-3b57-4e24-856b-15aefeb5d897_7e8bd3f0&bhcl_id=7b408bf8-27df-45eb-b48b-c75e4c08fdaf_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nYou think 4x faster than you type. So why are you typing prompts? [Wispr Flow](https://wisprflow.ai/?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=2026-10-beehiiv&utm_term=newsletter&utm_content=8AWZ8QR5IO-fl_ai_s1_q4&_bhiiv=opp_377eaf89-3b57-4e24-856b-15aefeb5d897_7e8bd3f0&bhcl_id=7b408bf8-27df-45eb-b48b-c75e4c08fdaf_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) turns your voice into ready-to-paste text inside any AI tool. Speak naturally, tangents and all, and Flow cleans it up. Available on Mac, Windows, iPhone, and Android.\\n\\n[Try Wispr Flow Free](https://wisprflow.ai/?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=2026-10-beehiiv&utm_term=newsletter&utm_content=8AWZ8QR5IO-fl_ai_s1_q4&_bhiiv=opp_377eaf89-3b57-4e24-856b-15aefeb5d897_7e8bd3f0&bhcl_id=7b408bf8-27df-45eb-b48b-c75e4c08fdaf_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n\\n----------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nYou are reading a plain text version of this post. For the best experience, copy and paste this link in your browser to view the post online:\\nhttps://newsletter.stayingahead.com/p/prompt-a-game\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-09 18:22:28\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:02.433765\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Vaibhav\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:02.433765\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"ae8t59demf\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ae5f93f5iu\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-09 18:22:28\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:02.434215\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 2,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Raiaayushhectocorn2029\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:12:02.434215\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"ae8h5evvve\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ae5f93f5iu\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  }\n ],\n \"uid\": 2006,\n \"unread_notification_sent\": 0,\n \"user\": \"Administrator\"\n}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('o9r67570cc','2026-10-17 16:35:41.999361','2026-10-17 16:35:41.999361','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'adu30qm2lo','Communication',0,'','{\n \"_user_tags\": null,\n \"bcc\": null,\n \"cc\": null,\n \"comment_type\": \"\",\n \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-08 13:54:52\",\n \"communication_medium\": \"Email\",\n \"communication_type\": \"Communication\",\n \"content\": \"\\n\\n\\n<meta content=\\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"color-scheme\\\" content=\\\"light dark\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"supported-color-schemes\\\" content=\\\"light dark\\\">\\n<title>Tata CLiQ</title>\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">\\n:root {\\n    Color-scheme: light dark;\\n    supported-color-schemes: light dark;\\n}\\n</style>\\n\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">\\ndiv.preheader \\n{ display: none !important; } \\n</style>\\n<div class=\\\"preheader\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 1px; display: none !important;\\\">A small head start, a little extra care, and plenty to look forward to</div>\\n<table width=\\\"600\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; border: solid 1px #efefef;background-color: #fff;\\\">\\n  <tbody>\\n    <tr>\\n      <td width=\\\"600\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #FFFFFF; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://click.styleupdate.tatacliq.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMjN9AAwAAAAAA2Re4Hs7lQBBKJ7-cg460v9AQ7xfssKIY3iH6Y3RwaJrl0BkwtOWxtsb4cnR8LZq0LkJ0rFQYJrmcfYJhU-mDJXClfyylxuJdNAsfJv7Nw\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img width=\\\"600\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" src=\\\"https://image.styleupdate.tatacliq.com/lib/fe2c117371640574711578/m/1/4b40a882-c6c8-4959-9217-c579dcab8633.png\\\" style=\\\"display: block;\\\"></a></td>\\n    </tr>\\n    \\n    \\n    \\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\\n    \\n    <tr>\\n      <td width=\\\"600\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#ffffff\\\"><a href=\\\"http