9t miss your chance to weigh in!</p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">Thanks for being part of the Postman community. Your perspective helps us understand how the API landscape is evolving.</p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">\\u00a0</p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">Cheers,</p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">The Postman Team</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"button_block block-4\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" style=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" class=\\\"pad\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;padding-right:10px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://tracking.inflection.io/42a0e188f5033bc65bf8d78622277c4e/gAAAAABqyK_BST446GIFXT_K-xMKd1zbl7n2R5gn4vRuCPMRwp-8Gc7Yt5ZWR2Wqo5vaIlXULwwaKDlzaxLkVaw3Rg07vvQCINbZR9uk-xSY3lPycvZPS5Nwxa0bMuYP9AZtXZV-zZX_4tPCURmUt5bzGNiR0gJuGVu5d3Qfx9f3I6THcxfmvE6dFhVnm2r64otVwIWQCO1FkLQzvraCSxTtKyACp_iAyoQe4BLdmUNK_3rapYiGemls37hi7uDutby6vDhdVVLNnfB9Z2Xn9j2Fsr0Pk2hPeynH2UVzC8JnEd2-VHGAzjpBkbk2AKqDInmKfbLgU2dFqfltQcXTLn_LI4IrknE-jRdNpSgAxe99xc_oNccnrYSv4iOAy_-HO6zvZ94Q9iKXSuljps5PK_Q0rwutDa7lev0JC_1nD26EAzs-msGkcDnyMGKWuZkn7ZMLW3dBft6klntkyfPtG8HKHUQeQi1mbCPSUduUqnXs0m6S5YAirG13ZFMXgxQzxzR7CSIiTHpB6lBg6Y5dtrB9QPsRDm7MHPia8_3LqHzkpXNL0XuQe2kPtzcFn22r53cxIURp5X5NRq-ci_fRXrd3PhkLbya-2rWBMzvIFauDFCVo2WGi35QaIWZBMrmnR2JpxPCRCRSkzqTllXWYrZgrEvm2C204kTQrS3oMX0FSsbDIOiXa5xuXXb1NawRgq8x-OwkeF9wIJxsDPddKjHM7SD4tNM0a5cr5KrlVfIAAXq0buYwKwIoiBjvrH2WmemqIQ3MukGtZciCmn9dkI-AfyPi16FrbSWSBlEyZTJnXRoyfqVpNSyF7vhSrgzKouk8Y8UtilKU13RSHXV1jbF2T4enwRrm1Yh-3p9ieKlpJVEx62UDs3jKI_5Wi5tpvXFzAupCSFSkfTk2yKNeWfvNNGHJQgM5YnsOdDup5lAmjIErmd2GbN_gTPkLpJX0rsYh_eozP3IEQC5RJZEMhhWomep6WaiUKp06EdCJwIvhxJy2cOc896FPO4EFV8n0fjaIdRiYkQXE42Umyccn2aAf5sx2kw5f2L41sAXc_HcK4WiP4FKGsMBqnHWvoow639nW5V8RK4o55wUOYsHMaFqbw7O3dMdSDt4lb2rNmIenawYWxxx8_jJOc_LEPW33EW2FG-u7avrll9ghsA9c3bh3a-mVUU98rB2hdaCTI0dRugrtszneDcu8=/redirect?redirect=http://postman.com/state-of-api/2026/survey/?u