a8tdX4fyJjLo%3D\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">eligible product</a> made using qualifying cards on 3-, 6-, 9- and <span style=\\\"white-space:nowrap;\\\">12-month</span> tenures from most leading card issuers. Eligible iPhone Duo, Apple Watch, AirPods and Beats products are available with No Cost EMI on 3- and 6-month tenures only. Monthly pricing is rounded to the nearest rupee. Exact pricing will be provided by your card issuer, subject to your card issuer\\u2019s terms and conditions. Minimum order spend applies as per your card issuer\\u2019s threshold. No\\u00a0Cost\\u00a0EMI is not available to Business customers and cannot be combined with Apple\\u00a0Store for Education or Corporate Employee Purchase Plan pricing. Card eligibility is subject to terms and conditions between you and your card issuer. Offer may be revised or withdrawn at any time without any prior notice. <a href=\\\"https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&amp;a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoalnU9%2BTQzrnj1yTdoDsUsttKvV0dq3sO6iRh6N6kmoDE0jyvAuJ0Dj2TgR%2FKJawsIzLPqHoX6sRaZrvmq4mWzS8egqOFGMzYbRMCHCNK45VAdczYj3Ru8HPPHGminiaDZ6dhdcpSJu%2BkQZHw%2B5HEAmU0kRHIPwoH7AK1Uep9MlEVPD3jPV4MY9mOFUEsmkGFQ%3D\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">Terms\\u00a0apply</a>.</p><p style=\\\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;\\\">\\u25caSpecial Edition AirPods\\u00a05 with Wireless Charging Case are available from 11 October 2026 through 11\\u00a0November\\u00a02026 in India at Apple\\u00a0Store locations, the Apple\\u00a0Store Online and at 000800\\u00a0040\\u00a01966, while supplies last. Not valid with any other AirPods offer. Cannot be combined with Business, Education or Corporate Employee Purchase Plans. Quantity limit of two\\u00a0units per customer apply. If you need to replace or repair Special\\u00a0Edition AirPods\\u00a05 with Wireless Charging Case, subject to supply, Apple may provide you with standard edition AirP