 offers a chance to step away from our everyday food routines and embrace simpler, <i>sattvik</i> foods to adapt to the changing weather and prepare for the months ahead. This Navaratri, we\'re giving a delicious new twist to traditional <i>vrat</i> foods\\u2014from <i>sabudana</i> and <i>makhana</i> to <i>kuttu</i> and <i>paneer</i>! </p></div></section><!-- Blog-1 --><section class=\\\"blog1\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:70px;\\\"><div style=\\\"clear:both;\\\"><div style=\\\"padding:0px 20px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://blog.bigbasket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blog01_07Oct_2026.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:100%; display:block; border-radius: 15px;\\\"></div><div style=\\\"clear: both; padding: 0px 0px 0px 140px; height: 100px; width: 549px;\\\"><div style=\\\"float:left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 70px; color:#b5d168; font-family: Arial Black,Arial Bold,Gadget,sans-serif;\\\"><b>#</b></span><span style=\\\"font-size: 115px; color:#b5d168; font-family: Arial Black,Arial Bold,Gadget,sans-serif; margin-right:15px;\\\"><b>1</b></span></div><div style=\\\"float:left; padding-top:40px; text-align:left;padding-top: 58px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px; text-align:left;\\\">Rethink<br><i>Sabudana</i></span></div></div><div style=\\\"clear:both;\\\"></div><p style=\\\"text-align:center; margin:0px 0px 20px 0px; padding:0px 40px; font-size: 18px; line-height:32px;\\\"><i>Sabudana</i> has long been a Navaratri favourite. Its simple carbs give quick energy for day-long fasts, while its mild taste pairs well with both sweet and savoury dishes. Yet, relying on the same old <i>kheer</i> and <i>khichdi</i> for nine whole days can quickly get boring. That is why today we are sharing four delicious, <i>vrat-friendly</i> recipes\\u2014from crisp, low-oil <i>appe</i> to trendy <i>kesari sabudana</i> boba milk; these are packed with flavour and variety.</p><a href=\\\"https://delivery.info.bigbasket.com/NQFKMIDW?id=33104=ehgCUwYAUwUCHgwOBARSXQkHBgxXUAoDBVcHVgVRVQJfAVcCAgYBB1JVAQVUUwFXA1dKSlULUwdIRkJaDgAFQVYHXRFbAVIHDyJSW1AMXUpSCltEBVULVwIKCQVRXVAND1MLWgBPCkFCEkYMHkpVAV0MQF1GGxwPX1VeHAQMAVdYF1kGQR0BWltNe2d3LnwtdTIJUVAeRFU=&amp;fl=URBGE0YJTRpbDVBpXAsJHR8AW1ldDh9XAR1cXQMLAVReARwAWl5NQwdNUFtQDF0HXQxVUw==&amp;\\\"> <!--The blog 1 link should be here--><img src=\\\"https://www.bigbasket.com/media/uploads/flatpages/mailer-images-aug/cookbook-mailer-readmore-button.gif\\\" style=\\\"width:25%; display:block;\\\"></a></div></section><!-- Blog-2 --><section class=\\\"blog2\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:70px;\\\"><div style=\\\"clear:both;\\\"><div style=\\\"padding:0px 20px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://blog.bigbasket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blog02-1_07Oct_2026.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:100%; display:block; border-radius: 15px;\\\"></div><div style=\\\"clear: both; padding: 0px 0px 0px 140px; height: 100px; width: 549px;\\\"><div style=\\\"float:left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 70px; color:#b5d168; font-family: Arial Black,Arial Bold,Gadget,sans-serif;\\\"><b>#</b></span><span style=\\\"font-size: 115px; color:#b5d168; font-family: Arial Black,Arial Bold,Gadget,sans-serif; margin-right:15px;\\\"><b>2</b></span></div><div style=\\\"float:left; padding-top:40px; text-align:left;padding-top: 58px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px; text-align:left;\\\">Protein on the<br><i>Vrat</i> Menu</span></div></div><div style=\\\"clear:both;\\\"></div><p style=\\\"text-align:center; margin:0px 0px 20px 0px; padding:0px 40px; font-size: 18px; line-height:32px;\\\"> Who said <i>vrat</i> food can\'t be protein-packed? This Navaratri, no need to choose between fasting and your fitness goals. Give your plate a power upgrade with a creamy <i>makhana-paneer</i> curry, crisp <i>kuttu</i> cutlets, and a refreshing hung-curd dip. Loaded with seeds, nuts, and big flavours, these recipes are as wholesome as they are satisfying. They\'ll keep you full, fueled, and powering through your fast. </p><a href=\\\"https://delivery.info.bigba