1;\\nfont-weight: 400;\\ntext-decoration: underline;\\\">Changelog</a>]</li>\\n    </ul>\\n  \\n  \\n  \\n    \\n          </div>\\n          <!--[if !true]&amp;gt;&amp;lt;! -->\\n      </div>\\n        <!-- &amp;lt;![endif]--><!--[if true]&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/td&amp;gt;\\n      &amp;lt;td&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/td&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt;\\n  &amp;lt;/table&amp;gt;\\n  &amp;lt;![endif]-->\\n  </div>\\n  \\n\\n  \\n  <div>\\n    \\n  <!--[if true]&amp;gt;&amp;lt;table\\n    role=&amp;quot;none&amp;quot;\\n    class=&amp;quot;mso&amp;quot;\\n    align=&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;\\n    style=&amp;quot;width: 100%;&amp;quot;\\n  &amp;gt;\\n    &amp;lt;tr&amp;gt;\\n      &amp;lt;td&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/td&amp;gt;&amp;lt;td style=&amp;quot;width: 480px; padding: 10px 10px;&amp;quot;&amp;gt;\\n        &amp;lt;![endif]--><!--[if !true]&amp;gt;&amp;lt;! --><div style=\\\"max-width: 480px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\">\\n        \\n          <!-- &amp;lt;![endif]--><div style=\\\"padding: 10px 10px; overflow: auto;\\\">\\n            \\n      \\n    \\n  \\n  <h2 style=\'color: #000000; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; font-family: \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 16px;\' class=\\\"ca49raw\\\">Made with Supabase</h2>\\n  \\n    \\n  \\n    <ul class=\\\"c19sznxk\\\" style=\'list-style: disc; color: #3c3c3c; font-family: \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.2;\'>\\n      <li>Ekwo OS - open-source double-entry accounting for 90+ countries that installs onto your own Supabase project as Postgres migrations. [<a class=\\\"inline-link-links-newsletter-hpkqy7\\\" href=\\\"https://email.supabase.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU0Z1QXNEQUxXaW5RRzBvcDBCQWFFVC0ySFVuUHVGTTh2ZTJYaDJ0Zz09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZ2l0aHViLmNvbS9Fa3dvLWFpL2Vrd28tb3MiLCJpbnRlcm5hbCI6Ijg1YjgwYjU1YzRkMDAxYjVhMjlkMDEiLCJsaW5rX2lkIjoxMDM0OX0/86da45806cb4ddb65ba94af84b3399616a800d76d94e2dc9d89472551801