yle=\\\"min-width: 100%;border-collapse: collapse;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\\\">\\n    <tbody class=\\\"mcnTextBlockOuter\\\">\\n        <tr>\\n            <td valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"mcnTextBlockInner\\\" style=\\\"padding-top: 9px;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\\\">\\n              \\t<!--[if mso]&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;table align=&amp;quot;left&amp;quot; border=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; cellspacing=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; cellpadding=&amp;quot;0&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;100%&amp;quot; style=&amp;quot;width:100%;&amp;quot;&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;tr&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;![endif]-->\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--[if mso]&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;td valign=&amp;quot;top&amp;quot; width=&amp;quot;600&amp;quot; style=&amp;quot;width:600px;&amp;quot;&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;![endif]-->\\n                <table align=\\\"left\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%;min-width: 100%;border-collapse: collapse;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;float: left;\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" class=\\\"mcnTextContentContainer\\\">\\n                    <tbody><tr>\\n\\n                        <td valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"mcnTextContent\\\" style=\\\"padding-top: 0;padding-right: 18px;padding-bottom: 9px;padding-left: 18px;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;word-break: break-word;color: #FFFFFF;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 12px;line-height: 150%;text-align: center;\\\">\\n\\n                            <em>Copyright \\u00a9 2026 Y Combinator, All rights reserved.</em>\\n<br>\\n    You are receiving this email because you signed up to receive emails from Y Combinator.\\n    <br>\\n    <br>\\n    <strong>Our mailing address is:</strong>\\n    <br>\\n    <div class=\\\"vcard\\\"><span class=\\\"org fn\\\">Y Combinator</span><div class=\\\"adr\\\"><div class=\\\"street-address\\\">320 Pioneer Way</div><span class=\\\"locality\\\">Mountain View</span>, <span class=\\\"region\\\">CA</span> <span class=\\\"postal-code\\\">94041</span></div><br><a href=\\\"https://ycombinator.us7.list-manage.com/vcard?u=6507bf4e4c2df3fdbae6ef738&amp;id=547725049b\\\" class=\\\"hcard-download\\\">Add us to your address book</a></div>\\n    <br>\\n    <br>\\n\\tWant to change how you receive these emails?<br>\\n    You can <a href=\\\"https://ycombinator.us7.list-manage.com/profile?u=6507bf4e4c2df3fdbae6ef738&amp;id=547725049b&amp;e=ae0cd89a3d&amp;c=bc5a032ec5\\\" style=\\\"-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #FFFFFF;font-weight: normal;text-decoration: underline;\\\">update your preferences</a> or <a href=\\\"https://ycombinator.us7.list-manage.com/unsubscribe?u=6507bf4e4c2df3fdbae6ef738&amp;id=547725049b&amp;t=b&amp;e=ae0cd89a3d&amp;c=bc5a032ec5\\\" style=\\\"-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #FFFFFF;font-weight: normal;text-decoration: underline;\\\">unsubscribe from this list</a>.\\n    <br>\\n    <br>\\n                        </td>\\n                    </tr>\\n                </tbody></table>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--[if mso]&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;/td&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;![endif]-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--[if mso]&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;/table&amp;gt;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t&amp;lt;![endif]-->\\n            </td>\\n        </tr>\\n    </tbody>\\n</table></td>\\n                                        </tr>\\n                                    </tbody></table>\\n                                    <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]&amp;gt;\\n                                    &amp;lt;/td&amp;gt;\\n                                    &amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt;\\n                                    &amp;lt;/table&amp;gt;\\n                                    &amp;lt;![endif]-->\\n                                </td>\\n                            </tr>\\n                        </tbody></table>\\n                        <!-- // END TEMPLATE -->\\n                    </td>\\n                </tr>\\n            </tbody></table>\\n        </center>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:none;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://us.list-manage.com/A6kumgRUZ3WisiMvCc_nNZ?e=ae0cd89a3d&amp;c2id=eb435efcb5e0d5286270ca69eb9d5f8c\\\" height=\\\"1\\\" width=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"display:none;\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></div>\\n\",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:57.663098\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"6507bf4e4c2df3fdbae6ef738.ae0cd89a3d.20261004200341.bc5a032ec5.f77e8048@mail46.atl91.mcsv.net\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:57.917708\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"aco3elth18\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"<raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com>\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00081\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"info@ycombinator.com\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"This Week at YC\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"Vivian Midha Shen and Raphael Schaad Are YC\'s Newest General Partners\",\n \"text_content\": \"https://www.ycombinator.com/\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** This Week at YC\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nOctober 4th, 2026\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** \\u2728 The Latest\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/blog/welcome-vivian-and-raphael\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** Vivian Midha Shen and Raphael Schaad Join YC as General Partners (https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/welcome-vivian-and-raphael)\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nWe\\u2019re thrilled to announce that Vivian Midha Shen and Raphael Schaad are joining Y Combinator as our newest General Partners. They\'ve built products used by millions of people, then returned to YC as Visiting Partners to help other founders. Now they\'re doing it full-time.\\r\\nhttps://youtu.be/xc2FTBGRSJo\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** What If We Stopped Using GPUs? (https://youtu.be/xc2FTBGRSJo)\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nThis week\\u2019s Paper Club is all about alternative compute. Modern AI has been shaped by a tight coupling between transformers, backpropagation, and GPUs. But as compute efficiency starts to plateau, there may be very different ways to build the machines that come next.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe explore what AI compute could look like beyond conventional digital hardware through optical systems that use light to perform computation, neuromorphic architectures inspired by the brain, and experiments teaching living brain cells to play Doom.\\r\\nhttps://youtu.be/Jv5B5CEaPJI\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** Robot-Use Agents: Why General-Purpose Models May Win in Robotics (https://youtu.be/Jv5B5CEaPJI)\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nOne of the biggest surprises in AI over the last few years has been how well coding agents generalize beyond software. In a recent essay, MIT professor Philip Isola argued that we may be entering the era of robot-use agents: general-purpose models that can control different robots, write policies, and learn new physical tasks with little or no robot-specific training.\\r\\nhttps://events.ycombinator.com/startup-school-taipei\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** Startup School is Coming to Taipei! (https://events.ycombinator.com/startup-school-taipei)\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nWe\'re bringing together the region\'s most ambitious founders, engineers, and builders for a day of talks from people who have built real companies. Speakers are YC alumni founders from across greater Asia, along with YC partners. This is a 100% free event, but space is limited and every attendee is hand-picked.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** \\ud83c\\udf0e YC Community\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\nHighlights/news from YC and YC companies\\r\\nhttps://hubble.com/news/hubble-network-opens-satellite-coverage-to-all-bluetooth-devices-raises-200-million-series-c-at-1.6-billion-valuation\\r\\n\\r\\nHubble Network Opens Satellite Coverage to All Bluetooth Devices, Raises $200M at $1.6B Valuation (https://hubble.com/news/hubble-network-opens-satellite-coverage-to-all-bluetooth-devices-raises-200-million-series-c-at-1.6-billion-valuation)\\r\\nHubble\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://siliconangle.com/2026/10/02/database-startup-supabase-raises-150m-acquires-turso/\\r\\n\\r\\nDatabase startup Supabase raises $150M, acquires Turso (https://siliconangle.com/2026/10/02/database-startup-supabase-raises-150m-acquires-turso/)\\r\\nsiliconAngle\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://youtu.be/2otGNwNOEUM\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Voice AI Platform Powering a Billion Calls a Year (https://youtu.be/2otGNwNOEUM)\\r\\nRoot Access\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://thenextweb.com/news/numeral-100m-series-c-insight-partners-ai-sales-tax\\r\\n\\r\\nNumeral raises $100m Series C for AI sales tax compliance (https://thenextweb.com/news/numeral-100m-series-c-insight-partners-ai-sales-tax)\\r\\nTNW\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://www.firecrawl.dev/blog/introducing-alexandria-series-b\\r\\n\\r\\nIntroducing Alexandria and our $75M Series B (https://www.firecrawl.dev/blog/introducing-alexandria-series-b)\\r\\nFirecrawl\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://youtu.be/0-g2-PRrOdw\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Training Ground for AI Knowledge Workers (https://youtu.be/0-g2-PRrOdw)\\r\\nRoot Access\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** \\ud83d\\ude80 The Launchpad (http://ycombinator.com/launches)\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\nSome of the most recent launches from YC companies (http://ycombinator.com/launches)\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/precip\\r\\nPrecip - Know exactly when it\'ll rain, down to the minute (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/UYB-precip-know-exactly-when-it-ll-rain-down-to-the-minute)\\r\\nThe most accurate rain forecast in the US. 85% better than Apple Weather.\\r\\nW2024\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/habu\\r\\nHABU - The AI-Native Real Estate Developer (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/UUm-habu-the-ai-native-real-estate-developer)\\r\\nWe build apartment buildings 20% faster and 15% cheaper by running the entire development process on AI\\r\\nF2026\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/agent-37\\r\\nAgent37: Host any agent harness (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/UTg-agent37-host-any-agent-harness)\\r\\nAgent sandboxes that are 94% lower compute cost\\r\\nF2026\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/ageospatial\\r\\nAgeospatial - pricing the risk of every property, infrastructure and land on Earth from satellites (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/UKJ-ageospatial-pricing-the-risk-of-every-property-infrastructure-and-land-on-earth-from-satellites)\\r\\nknow the assets that you insure in the physical world\\r\\nF2026\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/spine\\r\\nSpine: We run HR backoffice & benefits for startups, for free (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/URD-spine-we-run-hr-backoffice-benefits-for-startups-for-free)\\r\\nBenefits, people ops, and compliance. Off your plate.\\r\\nF2026\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/volaren-inc\\r\\nVolaren: bringing the hedge fund to retail investors (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/UDJ-volaren-bringing-the-hedge-fund-to-retail-investors)\\r\\nDescribe an investment thesis or strategy in plain English and Volaren\'s AI analysts research, build, and backtest it for you.\\r\\nF2026\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/musicarena\\r\\n\\ud83c\\udfb5 MusicArena - the arena for AI music-making \\ud83c\\udfb5 (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/USm-musicarena-the-arena-for-ai-music-making)\\r\\nThe crowdsourced benchmark for AI systems that make music\\r\\nS2026\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/invertix\\r\\nInvertix: Energy Superintelligence (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/UC8-invertix-energy-superintelligence)\\r\\nBuilding AI agents to operate the world\'s energy infrastructure and data centers\\r\\nF2026\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/oasive\\r\\nOasive: Find better bonds to buy (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/UEq-oasive-find-better-bonds-to-buy)\\r\\nSee which bonds are rich or cheap and decide what to buy\\r\\nF2026\\r\\nhttps://www.ycombinator.com/companies/deepmark\\r\\nDeepMark - Reinventing Trust in Voice (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/UEj-deepmark-reinventing-trust-in-voice)\\r\\nA live watermark inside AI voice that survives phone calls\\r\\nF2026\\r\\nFind more YC companies and discover new products (https://www.ycombinator.com/launches)\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n** \\ud83d\\udd25 Hacker News (https://news.ycombinator.com)\\r\\n------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\nTop posts from this week (https://news.ycombinator.com)\\r\\n1. When did Google get so weird? (https://sancho.bearblog.dev/google-weird/)  (sancho.bearblog.dev) (https://news.ycombinator.com/from?site=sancho.bearblog.dev)\\r\\n2010 points by sancho-panza (https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=sancho-panza) | 1120 comments (https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49870367)\\r\\n2. Gemini 4 Argon (https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-4-argon/)  (blog.google) (https://news.ycombinator.com/from?site=blog.google)\\r\\n1696 points by bradleyg223 (https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=bradleyg223) | 1183 comments (https://news.ycombinator.com/item?i