order=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;border-bottom-right-radius:8px;border-bottom-width:2px;border-color:#222222;border-left-width:2px;border-right-width:2px;border-style:solid;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-top-width:0px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> For the last few years, the LLM call has been the smallest building block in AI software. Every tiny judgment went through it. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Production apps make hundreds of these judgments. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;\\\">yes / no</span><br><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;\\\">A / B / C</span><br><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;\\\">tool / answer</span><br><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;\\\">continue / stop</span><br><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;\\\">cheap model / expensive model</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Most of them don&#39;t need a model to write anything. </p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px 4px 12px 4px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" class=\\\"d2\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-color:#B8EF43;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width:0px 0px 0px 2px;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:7px 12px 7px 12px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"i2\\\"><p style=\\\"color:#2D2D2D;font-weight:500;margin:0px;text-align:left;\\\">My bet: within a year, the well-built AI apps will have a decision layer sitting in front of their big model, and their API bills will show it.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Use language models when the answer needs to be figured out or written. When you already know every valid answer, hand over the list and let the model pick. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> That\\u2019s all for today.\\u00a0 </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>Until tomorrow,</b><br><b>Vaibhav \\ud83e\\udd1d\\ud83c\\udffb</b></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-width:2px;border-color:#6FE394;border-left-width:2px;border-right-width:2px;border-style:dashed;border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-top-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>If you read till here, you might find this interesting</b><br><br><b>#AD 1</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"the-ai-notetaker-that-gets-the-hard\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">The AI notetaker that gets the hard words right</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:570px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/9f4da75a-e66e-4299-818e-5dfe98e8c76e/notetaker-mac-transcript-1200x600.png?t=1790352013\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"570\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Your AI is only as good as what you feed it. Feed it a transcript with your product names, acronyms, and numbers spelled wrong, and you spend the afternoon hand-fixing the output. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Wispr Flow Notetaker</span></a> uses your dictionary and calendar, so product names, acronyms, numbers, and uncommon names come out spelled right. It pops up when your meeting starts and captures Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, and Slack huddles with one click, no bot joining the call. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Then your meetings show up inside Claude or ChatGPT through the built-in connector. No copy paste. <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Try Notetaker free on Mac and Windows.</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"try-notetaker-free\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Try Notetaker Free</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>#AD 2</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"stop-rewriting-prompts-start-engine\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">Stop rewriting prompts. Start engineering loops.</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:570px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/2f87b4cc-4adc-44b7-88d6-35bef88aa839/Start_engineering_loops_beehiiv_Ad_2_V2__3_.jpg?t=1787938030\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"570\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Most developers babysit AI one prompt at a time. Top engineers don&#39;t, they build loops that plan, execute, and self-correct. <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>The Code built The Ultimate Guide to Loop Engineering</span></a>, giving you the exact system Silicon Valley engineers use. Sign up and get the guide free, plus a 5-minute daily newsletter. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Claim your Loop Engineering guide</span></a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"b\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#030712\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color: #FFFFFF;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#B8EF43\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td><span style=\\\"padding-left:1px;\\\"></span></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"tw\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/x_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"ig\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/instagram_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"yt\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/youtube_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"in\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/linkedin_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td><span style=\\\"padding-left:1px;\\\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"10\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:10px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"w\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:15px 15px 15px 15px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> Update your email preferences or unsubscribe <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#FFFFFF!important;color:#FFFFFF!important;\\\"> here</a></p><p class=\\\"copyright\\\" style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> &copy; 2026 Staying Ahead with AI </p><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> 228 Park Ave S, #29976, New York, New York 10003, United States </p></td></tr><tr style=\\\"display: table-row !important;\\\"><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:20px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"display:table !important;\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"display:table-row !important;\\\"><td class=\\\"u\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" style=\\\"height:32px;display:table-cell !important; max-height: 32px !important;margin:0px !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;\\\"><a style=\\\"line-height:32px !important;text-decoration:none;display:block !important;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><img width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"beehiiv logo\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block !important;max-width:16px !important;vertical-align:-3px !important;width:16px !important;height:16px !important;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=pad,format=png,onerror=redirect,quality=100,width=16,height=16,gravity=center,background=transparent,dpr=2/output-onlinepngtools.png\\\"><span style=\\\"padding-left:11px !important;display: inline-block !important;\\\">Powered by beehiiv</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://email.beehiivstatus.com/3a8f571d865059199ad6020b3eb0d1f17da7b309/hclick\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:58.424586\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"20261005.125327.cbb68a3b@mta19\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:58.656575\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"ad0j00j2fc\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"\\\"raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com\\\" <raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com>\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00083\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"vaibhav@outskillwithai.com\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"Vaibhav Sisinty\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"ai ai ai\",\n \"text_content\": \"----------\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/06e9e26b-31e3-41b9-8d33-1e4fc1dccda7/Frame_2147225035.png?t=1785742897)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nOpen up almost any AI product and look at what it\'s asking the model to do.\\n\\nA lot of it is tiny calls.\\n\\n\\u201cWhich team gets this support ticket? / Should the agent call a tool right now? / Which model should handle this request? / Is this transaction suspicious?\\u201c \\u2014 \\n\\nEvery one of those has a handful of possible answers, and the usual way to get one is still heavy: send input to a general model, ask for JSON, parse, validate, then pull out one word.\\n\\nAll of that to get back billing.\\n\\nAt DevDay, OpenAI announced something built for this. It\'s called the **Decisions API**, and it\'s in [limited preview](https://community.openai.com/t/devday-2026-announcements-and-developer-resources/1402006) right now, with a [broader release promised soon](https://openai.com/index/devday-2026-recap/).\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n## **The idea**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nYou give it the input, a question and a list of allowed answers. It picks one.\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/5238fd9c-546c-42f9-945a-9d375b179895/Frame_2147225159__1_.png?t=1791145138)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **What this replaces**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nSay this ticket comes in:\\n\\n\\u201cI upgraded yesterday but my card was charged twice. Can someone refund the second payment?\\u201c \\u2014 \\n\\nMost teams would write something like this today:\\n\\n```\\nconst response = await openai.responses.create({\\n  model: \\\"gpt-6-luna\\\",\\n  input: `Classify as billing, technical,\\n  account, or sales. Return JSON only.\\n  ${ticket}`\\n});\\n\\n```\\nIt works.\\n\\nBut you knew all four possible answers before the model ran, and you still made it generate text and hoped the JSON came back fine.\\n\\nWith a decision layer, you just hand over the choices:\\n\\n```\\nconst route = await decide({\\n  input: ticket,\\n  choices: [\\\"billing\\\", \\\"technical\\\",\\n            \\\"account\\\", \\\"sales\\\"]\\n});\\n// \\\"billing\\\"\\n```\\n_Heads up: __decide()__ is my own shorthand._\\n\\n_OpenAI hasn\'t published the endpoint or request format yet, so be careful with any tutorial showing __openai.decisions.create()__ as working code._\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **Picking the model (most interesting bit)**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nOpenAI now has 3 tiers: Luna for [focused, high-volume tasks](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-luna), Sol for [complex work at a lower cost](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.1-sol), and Astra for [the most demanding work](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-astra).\\n\\nMost apps I see send everything to the strongest model they can afford.\\n\\nThat gets expensive fast, because Astra costs [$10 per million input tokens and Luna costs $0.10](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models). That\'s a 100x gap, and it\'s the same on output ($50 vs $0.50).\\n\\nPut a decision in front instead. It only has to answer one question: is this request simple, complex, or high stakes? Then your app sends it to the right model.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6eee2bf9-7533-43f5-96b5-50ef29b3bfee/css.png?t=1791146422)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nThe router\'s only job is choosing who solves the problem. Your expensive model shows up only when it\'s needed.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **Inside agents**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nSay an agent can answer, search docs, call an API, or escalate. The typical loop asks the big reasoning model what to do after every single step.\\n\\nPicking one of four known moves is a much smaller job than planning the whole task. So split them, let the planner plan, and let a decision layer handle the \\\"_what next_\\\" after each step.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/7273543d-36d0-4371-bcef-bc238220c731/Frame_2147225161.png?t=1791146872)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nNow your reasoning model spends its time on what needs reasoning. Choosing an action from predefined answers is one of the use cases [OpenAI calls out directly](https://community.openai.com/t/devday-2026-announcements-and-developer-resources/1402006).\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **Once you notice it, it\'s everywhere**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/71b3805c-b810-459c-9a70-d9734937f2ab/Frame_2147225162.png?t=1791147344)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nNone of these are necessarily easy. You just already know every possible output.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **\\\"Can\'t I just use Structured Outputs?\\\"**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nYou can. GPT-6 Luna [already supports them](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/compare).\\n\\nStructured Outputs keep a general model\'s answer in a fixed shape. Decisions starts from a fixed list and asks the model to choose from it.\\n\\nWhether that ends up cheaper or faster, nobody knows yet because pricing and latency aren\'t out. Once it\'s broadly available, benchmark both.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **When to skip it**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nFinding a bug in a repo / figuring out why conversions dropped / researching companies and proposing a strategy - these need exploring and writing, so they stay with an LLM.\\n\\nThe rule I\'d use:\\n\\n\\u201cUnknown output space \\u2192 LLM.\\n\\nKnown output space \\u2192 consider a decision.\\u201c \\u2014 \\n\\nOne caveat: four possible answers doesn\'t make a problem easy. Some bounded calls still need serious reasoning.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **What I\'d build today**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\nYou can\'t build on Decisions yet but you can build the boundary it will plug into:\\n\\n```\\ntype Route = \\\"billing\\\" | \\\"technical\\\" | \\\"account\\\" | \\\"sales\\\";\\n\\nasync function decideRoute(\\n  ticket: string\\n): Promise {\\n  // today: Structured Outputs on Luna\\n  // later: swap in Decisions\\n}\\n\\n```\\nThe rest of your app just calls decideRoute() and doesn\'t care how the answer gets made. When access opens up, you change one function.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **My take**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nFor the last few years, the LLM call has been the smallest building block in AI software. Every tiny judgment went through it.\\n\\nProduction apps make hundreds of these judgments.\\n\\nyes / no\\nA / B / C\\ntool / answer\\ncontinue / stop\\ncheap model / expensive model\\n\\nMost of them don\'t need a model to write anything.\\n\\n\\u201cMy bet: within a year, the well-built AI apps will have a decision layer sitting in front of their big model, and their API bills will show it.\\u201c \\u2014 \\n\\nUse language models when the answer needs to be figured out or written. When you already know every valid answer, hand over the list and let the model pick.\\n\\nThat\\u2019s all for today.\\u00a0\\n\\n**Until tomorrow,**\\n**Vaibhav \\ud83e\\udd1d\\ud83c\\udffb**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n**If you read till here, you might find this interesting**\\n\\n**#AD 1**\\n\\n### The AI notetaker that gets the hard words right\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/9f4da75a-e66e-4299-818e-5dfe98e8c76e/notetaker-mac-transcript-1200x600.png?t=1790352013)\\nFollow image link: (https://wisprflow.ai/notetaker?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=2026-10-beehiiv&utm_term=newsletter&utm_content=8AWZ8QR5IO-nt_ai_p1_q4&_bhiiv=opp_14fdc9fc-241b-4b66-a989-c84e62ca8b0a_e9604cee&bhcl_id=053a2931-1de0-4285-abfb-7ed6b5adefa6_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nYour AI is only as good as what you feed it. Feed it a transcript with your product names, acronyms, and numbers spelled wrong, and you spend the afternoon hand-fixing the output.\\n\\n[Wispr Flow Notetaker](https://wisprflow.ai/notetaker?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=2026-10-beehiiv&utm_term=newsletter&utm_content=8AWZ8QR5IO-nt_ai_p1_q4&_bhiiv=opp_14fdc9fc-241b-4b66-a989-c84e62ca8b0a_e9604cee&bhcl_id=053a2931-1de0-4285-abfb-7ed6b5adefa6_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) uses your dictionary and calendar, so product names, acronyms, numbers, and uncommon names come out spelled right. It pops up when your meeting starts and captures Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, and Slack huddles with one click, no bot joining the call.\\n\\nThen your meetings show up inside Claude or ChatGPT through the built-in connector. No copy paste. [Try Notetaker free on Mac and Windows.](https://wisprflow.ai/notetaker?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=2026-10-beehiiv&utm_term=newsletter&utm_content=8AWZ8QR5IO-nt_ai_p1_q4&_bhiiv=opp_14fdc9fc-241b-4b66-a989-c84e62ca8b0a_e9604cee&bhcl_id=053a2931-1de0-4285-abfb-7ed6b5adefa6_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n[Try Notetaker Free](https://wisprflow.ai/notetaker?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=2026-10-beehiiv&utm_term=newsletter&utm_content=8AWZ8QR5IO-nt_ai_p1_q4&_bhiiv=opp_14fdc9fc-241b-4b66-a989-c84e62ca8b0a_e9604cee&bhcl_id=053a2931-1de0-4285-abfb-7ed6b5adefa6_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n**#AD 2**\\n\\n### Stop rewriting prompts. Start engineering loops.\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2f87b4cc-4adc-44b7-88d6-35bef88aa839/Start_engineering_loops_beehiiv_Ad_2_V2__3_.jpg?t=1787938030)\\nFollow image link: (https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_f849ede5-e131-44f9-922a-b055c2211eed_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=f6d232b3-8387-46a8-bf9d-96583de58063_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nMost developers babysit AI one prompt at a time. Top engineers don\'t, they build loops that plan, execute, and self-correct. [The Code built The Ultimate Guide to Loop Engineering](https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_f849ede5-e131-44f9-922a-b055c2211eed_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=f6d232b3-8387-46a8-bf9d-96583de58063_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b), giving you the exact system Silicon Valley engineers use. Sign up and get the guide free, plus a 5-minute daily newsletter.\\n\\n[Claim your Loop Engineering guide](https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_f849ede5-e131-44f9-922a-b055c2211eed_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=f6d232b3-8387-46a8-bf9d-96583de58063_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n\\n----------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nYou are reading a plain text version of this post. For the best experience, copy and paste this link in your browser to view the post online:\\nhttps://newsletter.stayingahead.com/p/ai-this-ai-that\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-05 18:23:27\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:58.805912\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Vaibhav\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:58.805912\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"ad43pj17cp\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ad0j00j2fc\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-05 18:23:27\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:58.806379\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 2,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Raiaayushhectocorn2029\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:58.806379\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"ad4qo1g8hg\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ad0j00j2fc\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  }\n ],\n \"uid\": 1988,\n \"unread_notification_sent\": 0,\n \"user\": \"Administrator\"\n}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('o9tuf75urj','2026-10-17 16:35:42.175024','2026-10-17 16:35:42.175024','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'aclincvafr','Communication',0,'','{\n \"_user_tags\": null,\n \"bcc\": null,\n \"cc\": null,\n \"comment_type\": \"\",\n \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-04 19:04:39\",\n \"communication_medium\": \"Email\",\n \"communication_type\": \"Communication\",\n \"content\": \"<title>Facebook</title><meta content=\\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\\"><style>@media all and (max-width: 480px){*[class].ib_t{min-width:100%!important}*[class].ib_row{display:block!important}*[class].ib_ext{display:block!important;padding:10px 0 5px;vertical-align:top!important;width:100%!important}*[class].ib_img,*[class].ib_mid{vertical-align:top!important}*[class].mb_blk{display:block!important;padding-bottom:10px;width:100%!important}*[class].mb_hide{display:none!important}*[class].mb_inl{display:inline!important}*[class].d_mb_flex{display:block!important}}.d_mb_show{display:none}.d_mb_flex{display:flex}@media only screen and (max-device-width: 480px){.d_mb_hide{display:none!important}.d_mb_show,.d_mb_flex{display:block!important}}.mb_text h1,.mb_text h2,.mb_text h3,.mb_text h4,.mb_text h5,.mb_text h6{line-height:normal}.mb_work_text h1{font-size:18px;line-height:normal;margin-top:4px}.mb_work_text h2,.mb_work_text h3{font-size:16px;line-height:normal;margin-top:4px}.mb_work_text h4,.mb_work_text h5,.mb_work_text h6{font-size:14px;line-height:normal}.mb_work_text a{color:#1270e9}.mb_work_text p{margin-top:4px}\\n</style><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" id=\\\"email_table\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tbody><tr><td id=\\\"email_content\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Lucida Grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;background:#ffffff;\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"\\\"><td height=\\\"20\\\" style=\\\"line-height:20px;\\\" colspan=\\\"3\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"1\\\" colspan=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;\\\"></td></tr><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:16px;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td style=\\\"\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"font-family:Instagram Sans, SFUIText-Regular, Roboto, Segoe, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica,\\n    Arial, sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:42px;width:302px;align-items:left;\\\">Catch up on <span style=\\\"font-family:Instagram Sans, SFUIText-Regular, Roboto, Segoe, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica,\\n    Arial, sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:44px;\\\"> Instagram </span></td><td valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"float:right;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/_n/user?utm_campaign=digest_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;target_user_id=23596201187&amp;utm_source=instagram&amp;show_target=2&amp;username=raiaayushhectocorn2029&amp;click_source=header_profile_pic&amp;token=p19KY3eCkQ&amp;uid=au8khcz&amp;bypass=1&amp;ndid=65d038a28c3f2H57e7174e3H65d03d3bec6c4H53\\\" style=\\\"color:#1b74e4;text-decoration:none;\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tbody><tr><td></td><td rowspan=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><div style=\\\"height:44px;width:44px;border-radius:50%;margin:3px 3px auto auto;background-image:url(https://facebook.com/images/instagram-business/import/igui/IGUIAvatar-anonymousUser.jpg); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\\\"></div></td></tr><tr><td width=\\\"44px\\\" height=\\\"44px\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" colspan=\\\"2\\\" style=\\