\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"Make your weekly reset easier\",\n \"text_content\": \"Turn everything on your mind into priorities and next steps.\\r\\n\\r\\nMake your weekly reset easier\\r\\n\\r\\nImage ( https://notion.so/ai?utm_campaign=%5Bgtm+2.0%5D+scheduled_run+campaign&utm_campaignid=1024&utm_campaigntype=transactional&utm_content=Email&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\\r\\n\\r\\nWhen plans, reminders, and unfinished tasks start piling up, ask Notion Agent to help you sort through them. Share what you need to accomplish, then turn it into a focused plan for the week.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou can adjust the plan as priorities change, break larger goals into manageable steps, and come back whenever you need to reset.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlan my week ( https://notion.so/ai?utm_campaign=%5Bgtm+2.0%5D+scheduled_run+campaign&utm_campaignid=1024&utm_campaigntype=transactional&utm_content=Email&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\\r\\n\\r\\nThanks,\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Notion Team\\r\\n\\r\\nWrite, plan, organize.\\r\\nIn one AI-powered workspace.\\r\\n\\r\\nNotion ( https://www.notion.so/?utm_campaign=%5Bgtm+2.0%5D+scheduled_run+campaign&utm_campaignid=1024&utm_campaigntype=transactional&utm_content=Email&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\\r\\nNotion Calendar ( https://www.notion.com/product/calendar?utm_campaign=%5Bgtm+2.0%5D+scheduled_run+campaign&utm_campaignid=1024&utm_campaigntype=transactional&utm_content=Email&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\\r\\n\\r\\n685 Market Street, San Francisco, CA 94105\\r\\n\\r\\nDon\'t want this kind of email? Unsubscribe from Product Education and How-To\'s ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgTv2AUBAL_yiIUBvvKIhQEBoQ9szzzRJ8kvmL5jg-Yw ).\\r\\nManage preferences ( https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgTv2AUBAL_yiIUBvvKIhQEBoQ9szzzRJ8kvmL5jg-Yw )\\u2003Privacy Policy ( https://www.notion.so/notion/Privacy-Policy-3468