ee </p></li><li class=\\\"listItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> The Code newsletter \\u2014 learn the latest AI tools, tips, and skills to code faster with AI in 5 minutes a day </p></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Claim your free playbook</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>#AD 2</b></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">Stop Drowning In AI Information Overload</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:594px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/068fe401-b3f1-4eb8-8fd2-04597b84cd96/Non-Ad_5.png?t=1757641995\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"594\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Your inbox is flooded with newsletters. Your feed is chaos. Somewhere in that noise are the insights that could transform your work\\u2014but who has time to find them? </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The Deep View solves this. We read everything, analyze what matters, and deliver only the intelligence you need. No duplicate stories, no filler content, no wasted time. Just the essential AI developments that impact your industry, explained clearly and concisely. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Replace hours of scattered reading</span></a> with five focused minutes. While others scramble to keep up, you&#39;ll stay ahead of developments that matter. 600,000+ professionals at top companies have already made this switch. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Join them today, for free.</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"b\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#030712\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color: #FFFFFF;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#B8EF43\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td><span style=\\\"padding-left:1px;\\\"></span></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"tw\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/x_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"ig\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/instagram_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"yt\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/youtube_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"in\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/linkedin_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td><span style=\\\"padding-left:1px;\\\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"10\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:10px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"w\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:15px 15px 15px 15px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> Update your email preferences or unsubscribe <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#FFFFFF!important;color:#FFFFFF!important;\\\"> here</a></p><p class=\\\"copyright\\\" style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> &copy; 2026 Staying Ahead with AI </p><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> 228 Park Ave S, #29976, New York, New York 10003, United States </p></td></tr><tr style=\\\"display: table-row !important;\\\"><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:20px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"display:table !important;\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"display:table-row !important;\\\"><td class=\\\"u\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" style=\\\"height:32px;display:table-cell !important; max-height: 32px !important;margin:0px !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;\\\"><a style=\\\"line-height:32px !important;text-decoration:none;display:block !important;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><img width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"beehiiv logo\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block !important;max-width:16px !important;vertical-align:-3px !important;width:16px !important;height:16px !important;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=pad,format=png,onerror=redirect,quality=100,width=16,height=16,gravity=center,background=transparent,dpr=2/output-onlinepngtools.png\\\"><span style=\\\"padding-left:11px !important;display: inline-block !important;\\\">Powered by beehiiv</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://email.beehiivstatus.com/f6522cc3a250f359cf35817e83609d2d684ebdf1/hclick\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:56.160186\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"20261002.130509.8394879b@mta20\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:56.325341\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"ac9tqb8oh4\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"\\\"raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com\\\" <raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com>\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00074\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"vaibhav@outskillwithai.com\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"Vaibhav Sisinty\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"devday decoded\",\n \"text_content\": \"----------\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/06e9e26b-31e3-41b9-8d33-1e4fc1dccda7/Frame_2147225035.png?t=1785742897)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nSeptember\'s officially over, and honestly, what a month.\\n\\nGPT-6 Astra, Muse, Opus 5.5, Grok 4.7, Sonnet 5.5, Fable 5.1, AI agents breaking out of their test boxes. And then OpenAI closed it out with [DevDay](https://openai.com/index/devday-2026-recap/).\\n\\nSo, this is gonna be a sequel to Tuesday\'s \\\"_all over the place\\u201d _edition.\\n\\nMore than 20 announcements, a voice demo that broke live on stage, and [GPT-6.1 Astra shelved on the eve of DevDay](https://www.theregister.com/ai-and-ml/2026/09/29/openai-benches-gpt-61-astra-for-overstepping-the-mark/5299743) for overstepping its scope and misreporting what it had done.\\n\\nSo you\'re getting all of it.\\n\\nBefore that, **quick catch up.**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **NEWS**\\n\\n**Muse said one thing, did another**\\n\\n[Meta\'s Muse read 187,000+ of a columnist\'s private messages](https://decrypt.co/379122/metas-muse-ai-agent-user-private-imessages-lied-how), even though he\'d declined Messages access. And when asked how it knew, Muse said it only saw notification previews.\\n\\nMeta later admitted that was wrong.\\n\\n**Reddit\'s closing the tap**\\n\\n[Reddit\'s killing RSS on November 13 and its public API by March 2027](https://thenextweb.com/news/reddit-rss-feeds-shut-down-old-reddit-ai-scraping), citing large-scale scraping. If your AI answers ever come from Reddit, that\'s about to get a lot more paid.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/82e5564d-ee4e-41d7-9e58-6e5ecff44f42/Frame_2147225155.jpg?t=1790908489)\\nFollow image link: (https://thenextweb.com/news/openai-moonshot-distillation-campaign-hidden-reasoning)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\n**AI companies sign a new safety pact**\\n\\nTrump and leaders from Google, Anthropic, Meta, OpenAI, Nvidia and xAI [signed a voluntary AI safety pact](https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/9/30/how-does-trumps-white-house-ai-accord-work).\\n\\nTrump also [ordered federal agencies to use the term \\\"](https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/09/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-inaugurates-the-era-of-super-intelligence/)_[Super Intelligence](https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/09/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-inaugurates-the-era-of-super-intelligence/)_[\\\" for AI](https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/09/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-inaugurates-the-era-of-super-intelligence/).\\n\\n**The FTC comes knocking**\\n\\nThe same week, the [FTC confirmed it\'s investigating OpenAI and Anthropic](https://www.cbsnews.com/news/ftc-investigation-openai-anthropic-ai-safety/).\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **QUICK-FIRE**\\n\\n* Finally, [Codex keeps working after you shut your laptop](https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/cloud).\\n\\n* TechCrunch literally called the new Decisions API [OpenAI\'s \\\"](https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/30/openais-jev-clone-could-help-the-frontier-lab-stop-its-swarming-agents/)_[Jev clone.](https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/30/openais-jev-clone-could-help-the-frontier-lab-stop-its-swarming-agents/)_[\\\"](https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/30/openais-jev-clone-could-help-the-frontier-lab-stop-its-swarming-agents/) Remember Jev from last week? Yeah.\\n\\n* ChatGPT now suggests mid-chat plugins. [One plugin\'s usage jumped 2,000%+](https://www.theneuron.ai/digest/everything-that-happened-in-ai-today-wednesday-september-30-2026/), and Greg Isenberg\'s already telling builders to grab the empty plugin slots before everyone else does. He\'s not wrong.\\n\\n* [China-linked hackers posed as a former White House AI official and a senior Anthropic employee](https://www.nextgov.com/cybersecurity/2026/10/china-linked-hackers-posed-former-us-officials-anthropic-employee-target-ai-experts/416356/) to phish AI policy experts. Proofpoint found it.\\n\\n* [Still no AI czar](https://www.axios.com/2026/09/29/ai-czar-white-house-trump-jay-clayton). Trump said \\\"_3-4 days_\\u201d on Tuesday. DNI Jay Clayton is the latest name floated.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **Back to DevDay**\\n\\n**Dots never clock off**\\n\\nBy Tuesday evening, people on X were [sharing a Dot.com link that redirects to Grok Bot](https://www.aol.com/articles/openai-named-agent-system-dots-044653000.html) and the next morning, someone had built an open-source dot overnight.\\n\\nThat\'s basically the reception.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/d60d0740-5c46-4379-95ab-5287b85b597f/Frame_2147225156.jpg?t=1790909026)\\nFollow image link: (https://openai.com/index/introducing-dots/)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nThen there\'s the \\\"_who is this even for\\u201d_ crowd. [One recap](https://saanyaojha.substack.com/p/openai-dev-day-dots-decisions-distribution) said the demos mixed booking dinner with fixing GitHub issues in a way that felt very Bay Area. Fair.\\n\\nThe voice demo dying on stage didn\'t help either.\\n\\nThe best bit got buried. OpenAI\'s own example was a dot that spotted a forgotten invoice and waited for a yes before sending it.\\n\\nThat waiting is the whole product. Meanwhile Muse is still explaining how it read someone\'s texts. Lol.\\n\\n**Nobody\'s arguing about Sol.**\\n\\n[A model near Astra at a fifth of the price](https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-1-sol/) is just good news, and on Hacker News people were more excited about the cached-token price than the benchmarks.\\n\\n**The plans are where it got better.**\\n\\nThe $200 tier \\\"_reopened_\\\" at [10x usage instead of 20x for new subscribers](https://thenextweb.com/news/openai-devday-pro-200-usage-cut-pro-500-plan).\\n\\nA 50% cut with a new sticker on it. Then they hit a [worldwide reset button](https://dev.to/axrisi/openai-devday-2026-every-announcement-with-prices-and-availability-1mbh) at the very end of the keynote, which most people read as a usage reset and, sure, felt like a peace offering.\\n\\nAllie K. Miller had the most interesting take on the new Ultrafast tier.\\n\\nHer point: [when a prototype or analysis can happen inside the meeting itself](https://www.theneuron.ai/digest/everything-that-happened-in-ai-today-wednesday-september-30-2026/), the \\\"_let\'s pick this up after someone builds it_\\\" pause just disappears.\\n\\nI think she\'s right, and it\'s the bigger shift. Faster models change how you work. Cheaper ones just change your bill.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f33d15e5-12cc-4340-b9eb-28907c3dba2c/Frame_2147225157.jpg?t=1790909466)\\nFollow image link: (https://chatgpt.com/features/chatgpt-in-slack-and-teams/)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **TOOLS ON MY RADAR**\\n\\n[Echo](https://echo.fulcrum.inc/)\\n\\nWrites in a specific author\'s voice, and its maker Fulcrum says the Pangram detector judges it human more often than GPT-6 Astra or Opus 5.5. Teachers, good luck.\\n\\n[1,337 Chart Prompts](https://www.emergentmind.com/chart-prompts)\\n\\nFree chart styles for Claude Code or Codex. Your bar chart, but it looks like someone actually put in the effort.\\n\\n[Space Bunny Alpha](https://openrouter.ai/stealth/space-bunny-alpha)\\n\\nA mystery model on OpenRouter, 1M-token context, nobody knows who made it.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **My Take**\\n\\nA whole month of launches, and almost every story ends the same way: an AI did something, and a human had to find out what.\\n\\n**So, our job now has come down to invigilation.**\\n\\nDid that invoice go to the right person, at the right rate?\\n\\nLast month, I told you to hand off any task you repeat so often it stops feeling like a job.\\n\\nStill stand by that.\\n\\nBut what I didn\'t think about is where you learn to check the work in the first place.\\n\\nMy first job was launching new cities at Uber. So much of it was boring. Spreadsheets, calls, checking numbers, fixing whatever broke.\\n\\nI hated half of it.\\n\\nIt\'s also how I learned what a bad launch plan looks like.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/4a42db04-0ba2-47f6-8649-7241db46af62/Frame_2147225158.jpg?t=1790909845)\\nFollow image link: (https://voltagecontrol.com/blog/experience-starvation/)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nAsk around what people do when they hit their AI spending cap, and you\'ll hear a lot of _\\\"I just stop working.\\\"_ That pipeline\'s already thinning.\\n\\nYes, AI can check AI. Fine. But someone still has to know what _\\\"right\\\"_ looks like.\\n\\nHand off the repetitive stuff. Keep a few reps for yourself.\\n\\n**Reply and tell me one thing you\'ve handed to AI and what you caught.**\\n\\nUntil then,\\nVaibhav \\ud83e\\udd1d\\ud83c\\udffb\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n**If you read till here, you might find this interesting**\\n\\n**#AD 1**\\n\\n### 100+ Claude Code hacks to ship code 10X faster\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/10ca4da5-f215-41e6-bbfa-f6276a153949/100%2B_Claude_Code_hacks_to_ship_10x_faster__in_2026_-_1200_X_600_V4__1_.jpg?t=1777043239)\\nFollow image link: (https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_de83a3d0-eeac-4752-bb6a-e9611bafde2d_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=7b80658e-e886-4e90-95a4-045151b69e0e_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nTop engineers at Anthropic and OpenAI say AI now writes 100% of their code.\\n\\nIf you\'re not using AI, you\'re spending 40 hours doing what they do in 4.\\n\\nThese [100+ Claude Code hacks](https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_de83a3d0-eeac-4752-bb6a-e9611bafde2d_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=7b80658e-e886-4e90-95a4-045151b69e0e_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) fix that and help you ship 10x faster.\\n\\nSign up for The Code and get:\\n\\n* 100+ Claude Code hacks used by top engineers \\u2014 free\\n\\n* The Code newsletter \\u2014 learn the latest AI tools, tips, and skills to code faster with AI in 5 minutes a day\\n\\n[Claim your free playbook](https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_de83a3d0-eeac-4752-bb6a-e9611bafde2d_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=7b80658e-e886-4e90-95a4-045151b69e0e_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n**#AD 2**\\n\\n### Stop Drowning In AI Information Overload\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/068fe401-b3f1-4eb8-8fd2-04597b84cd96/Non-Ad_5.png?t=1757641995)\\nFollow image link: (https://subscribe.thedeepview.com/?utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&_bhiiv=opp_678c991e-7e57-4cc5-b0dd-99436ca285ae_12ba3285&bhcl_id=9d33d1d6-adf9-4139-bb82-c3526d2acbb9_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nYour inbox is flooded with newsletters. Your feed is chaos. Somewhere in that noise are the insights that could transform your work\\u2014but who has time to find them?\\n\\nThe Deep View solves this. We read everything, analyze what matters, and deliver only the intelligence you need. No duplicate stories, no filler content, no wasted time. Just the essential AI developments that impact your industry, explained clearly and concisely.\\n\\n[Replace hours of scattered reading](https://subscribe.thedeepview.com/?utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&_bhiiv=opp_678c991e-7e57-4cc5-b0dd-99436ca285ae_12ba3285&bhcl_id=9d33d1d6-adf9-4139-bb82-c3526d2acbb9_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) with five focused minutes. While others scramble to keep up, you\'ll stay ahead of developments that matter. 600,000+ professionals at top companies have already made this switch.\\n\\n[Join them today, for free.](https://subscribe.thedeepview.com/?utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=newsletter&_bhiiv=opp_678c991e-7e57-4cc5-b0dd-99436ca285ae_12ba3285&bhcl_id=9d33d1d6-adf9-4139-bb82-c3526d2acbb9_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n----------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nYou are reading a plain text version of this post. For the best experience, copy and paste this link in your browser to view the post online:\\nhttps://newsletter.stayingahead.com/p/devday-decoded\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-02 18:35:09\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:56.462759\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Vaibhav\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:56.462759\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"accb6nbvia\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ac9tqb8oh4\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-10-02 18:35:09\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:56.463248\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 2,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Raiaayushhectocorn2029\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:56.463248\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"acc87bqqs9\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"ac9tqb8oh4\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  }\n ],\n \"uid\": 1979,\n \"unread_notification_sent\": 0,\n \"user\": \"Administrator\"\n}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
