inese\\u201d after all! Each one was remixed by a cook bold enough to try something new. This week, we\'re following their lead. Join us as we discover what happens when Chinese sauces go wildly off-script. </p></div></section><!-- Blog-1 --><section class=\\\"blog1\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:70px;\\\"><div style=\\\"clear:both;\\\"><div style=\\\"padding:0px 20px;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://blog.bigbasket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blog01_30Sep_2026.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:100%; display:block; border-radius: 15px;\\\"></div><div style=\\\"clear: both; padding: 0px 0px 0px 140px; height: 100px; width: 549px;\\\"><div style=\\\"float:left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 70px; color:#b5d168; font-family: Arial Black,Arial Bold,Gadget,sans-serif;\\\"><strong>#</strong></span><span style=\\\"font-size: 115px; color:#b5d168; font-family: Arial Black,Arial Bold,Gadget,sans-serif; margin-right:15px;\\\"><strong>1</strong></span></div><div style=\\\"float:left; padding-top:40px; text-align:left;padding-top: 58px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px; text-align:left;\\\">The Chinese <br>Crossover</span></div></div><div style=\\\"clear:both;\\\"></div><p style=\\\"text-align:center; margin:0px 0px 20px 0px; padding:0px 40px; font-size: 18px; line-height:32px;\\\"> Every culinary breakthrough begins the moment a cook refuses to stay in their lane. That\'s how Chinese fusion was born. Today, we\'re playing rebels and throwing the rulebook out the window. We are turning fiery Sichuan spices into Italian pasta and stuffing Chinese BBQ chicken into Mexican tortillas. Read on for four rule-breaking savoury mains crafted to hit every bold note.</p><a href=\\\"https://delivery.info.bigbasket.com/NQFKMIDW?id=33104=ehgCUwYAUwUCHlMAVQFSXAVcVFwFAVZSBgdVVgBdVFFYAAtXAwcADQBWBwUDXVBVCQZKSlULUwdIRkJaDgAFQVYHXRFbAVIHDyJSW1AMXUpSCltEBVULVgYKAgtRU1QDDVUHVgxPCkFCEkYMHkpVAV0MQF1GGxwPX1VeHAQMAVdYF1kGQR0BWltNe2d3LnwtdTIJUVAeRFU=&amp;fl=URBGE0YJTRpbDVBpXAsJHR8AW1ldDh9XAR1cXQMLA