</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Most of these launches give an agent more freedom. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Cue has its own email and browser, Supertake will manage your money once you give it a thesis and Meta is putting Muse inside companies. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> The only news about restraint is OpenAI pausing training because agents did things nobody expected, and Nvidia building a hardware watchdog that can quarantine an agent in milliseconds. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>The gas pedal ships every day, and the brakes ship as press releases.</b></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> I felt this while testing Cue. It hit a security check and asked me to clear it on its behalf, and I did it without a second thought. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Sonnet 5.5 shows the same gap from the other side. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> It polishes a page with craft and still hands you the palette everyone has seen a hundred times. Models are getting better at doing, and deciding what&#39;s good is still our job. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> So the people who win the next year will be the ones who decide what the agent is allowed to touch. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:618px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/b3b4d75d-bb12-4f79-8d25-2166d4e462d9/Frame_2147225154.png?t=1790663114\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"618\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Until then,<br>Vaibhav <span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;font-size:1em;\\\">\\ud83e\\udd1d\\ud83c\\udffb</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td height=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-width:2px;border-color:#6FE394;border-left-width:2px;border-right-width:2px;border-style:dashed;border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-top-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>If you read till here, you might find this interesting</b><br><br><b>#AD 1</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"the-ultimate-claude-code-guide-to-s\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">The Ultimate Claude Code Guide to ship like Anthropic engineers </h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" 