istItem ultext\\\"><p style=\\\"padding:0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"> The Code newsletter \\u2014 learn the latest AI tools, tips, and skills to code faster with AI in 5 minutes a day </p></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Join 250K+ engineers</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>#AD 2</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"stop-rewriting-prompts-start-engine\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">Stop rewriting prompts. Start engineering loops.</h3></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" class=\\\"bb\\\" style=\\\"width:586px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80,width=1920,height=3840/uploads/asset/file/2f87b4cc-4adc-44b7-88d6-35bef88aa839/Start_engineering_loops_beehiiv_Ad_2_V2__3_.jpg?t=1787938030\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Most developers babysit AI one prompt at a time. Top engineers don&#39;t, they build loops that plan, execute, and self-correct. <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>The Code built The Ultimate Guide to Loop Engineering</span></a>, giving you the exact system Silicon Valley engineers use. Sign up and get the guide free, plus a 5-minute daily newsletter. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Claim your Loop Engineering guide</span></a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"b\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#030712\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color: #FFFFFF;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#B8EF43\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px;\\\"><table role=\\\"n