r></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"10\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:10px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"w\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:15px 15px 15px 15px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> Update your email preferences or unsubscribe <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#FFFFFF!important;color:#FFFFFF!important;\\\"> here</a></p><p class=\\\"copyright\\\" style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> &copy; 2026 Staying Ahead with AI </p><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> 228 Park Ave S, #29976, New York, New York 10003, United States </p></td></tr><tr style=\\\"display: table-row !important;\\\"><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:20px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"display:table !important;\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"display:table-row !important;\\\"><td class=\\\"u\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" style=\\\"height:32px;display:table-cell !important; max-height: 32px !important;margin:0px !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;\\\"><a style=\\\"line-height:32px !important;text-decoration:none;display:block !important;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><img width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"beehiiv logo\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block !important;max-width:16px !important;vertical-align:-3px !important;width:16px !important;height:16px !important;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=pad,format=png,onerror=redirect,quality=100,width=16,height=16,gravity=center,background=transparent,dpr=2/output-onlinepngtools.png\\\"><span style=\\\"padding-left:11px !important;display: inline-block !important;\\\">Powered by beehiiv</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://hp.beehiiv.com/1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://email.beehiivstatus.com/c926fd3952bb9747b962ccf2a0729bd134116871/hclick\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:53.544649\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"20260929.125956.fdcab99e@mta10\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:53.720401\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"abfgauo7ml\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"\\\"raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com\\\" <raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com>\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00062\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"vaibhav@outskillwithai.com\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"Vaibhav Sisinty\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"meet cue\",\n \"text_content\": \"----------\\n\\n\\n\\n----------View image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/06e9e26b-31e3-41b9-8d33-1e4fc1dccda7/Frame_2147225035.png?t=1785742897)\\nCaption: \\n\\n----------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nThere\\u2019s only one right answer to the poll \\ud83d\\ude42\\n\\n3 hours before I started writing this, [Cue](https://x.com/CueAgents/status/2104589146153181192?s=20) showed up, cutest since Grok bot, I sign up instantly. \\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/8af0fc8b-63fc-4e5d-946a-13d355ec9d90/Group_1160445417.png?t=1790658937)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nAnd guess what?\\n\\nIt\\u2019s **OpenAI DevDay tomorrow**. Rumors are already flying, but I\\u2019m gonna keep mum, catch you up over all that\\u2019s happening, and walk you through what you can do with it too! \\n\\n**Let\\u2019s dive in:**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **NEWS NEWS NEWS**\\n\\n1. [Manus rebuilds from scratch](https://manus.im/blog/introducing-manus-2-0)\\n\\nManus launched 2.0 and says it\'s not a version update - new architecture, products, capabilities, built around what the next generation should look like.\\n\\n2. [Your hot take, now a portfolio](https://www.usv.com/writing/introducing-supertake)\\n\\nUSV-incubated Supertake is in private beta: tell its agent an investing thesis and it builds a portfolio through a connected brokerage. It can manage and rebalance that \\\"take,\\\" or let you try it in Practice Mode before using money.\\n\\n3. [AI labs hit pause](https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/sep/27/openai-halts-training-of-latest-models-as-reports-mount-of-ai-agents-going-rogue)\\n\\nOpenAI paused training its latest models while it reviews unexpected agent actions; OpenAI, Anthropic and researchers are reportedly investigating tens of thousands of incidents.\\n\\n4. [ElevenLabs finds its voice again](https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/28/elevenlabs-new-v4-speech-model-supports-more-expression-control-and-90-languages/)\\n\\nElevenLabs launched Eleven v4 and v4 Turbo, promising more expressive speech, lower-latency voice agents and support for over 90 languages. It says a voice can now be cloned from 10 seconds of audio.\\n\\n5. [Nvidia builds an agent watchdog](https://investor.nvidia.com/news/press-release-details/2026/NVIDIA-Launches-Open-Agent-Safety-Platform-to-Secure-Agents-From-Testing-to-Deployment/default.aspx)\\n\\nNvidia\'s new Open Agent Safety Platform pairs a runtime that traces and restricts agent actions with a separate hardware watchdog. Nvidia says the watchdog can quarantine an agent that crosses its boundaries in milliseconds.\\n\\n6. [Meta takes Muse to work](https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/launching-meta-enterprise-platform/)\\n\\nMeta launched an enterprise platform to bring Muse and its AI tools to businesses, and hired former MongoDB CEO CJ Desai to lead it. The personal-agent push now has an enterprise arm.\\n\\n7. [Instinct lands a $1B round](https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/28/viral-ai-agent-instinct-raises-1b-series-c-at-a-10b-valuation/)\\n\\nPersonal AI agent Instinct raised a $1 billion Series C at a $10 billion valuation, a month after a round valued it at $2.5 billion. Investors include Sequoia, Benchmark and Coatue.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **While we\\u2019re on Instinct**\\n\\nIf there\\u2019s one podcast you should tune into this week:\\n\\nYoutube: Inside the Personal AI Assistant Growing 10% a Day | Instinct Founder (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Am7IWP8IpEc&t=1s)\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **The headlines**\\n\\n### **1. Sonnet 5.5**\\n\\nI\\u2019ll leave the benchmark bore to [Claude\\u2019s official twitter](https://x.com/claudeai/status/2104633119412523294?s=20), it\\u2019s the usual cheaper and faster stuff but the claim that I wanna test: [\\u201cknack for design\\u201d](https://x.com/claudeai/status/2104633131760333046?s=20) - is it? Really? Let\\u2019s see:\\n\\n**Input:**\\n\\n\\u201cHere\'s a working but unpolished web page for a small business. Polish it.\\nRules:\\n\\n* Keep the same content, sections and order. Don\'t add or remove information.\\n\\n* Don\'t turn it into a different page. Improve the design, not the structure.\\n\\n* Return one self-contained HTML file.\\n\\n```\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nMonsoon Pottery Studio\\n\\n........\\n```\\nOutput: check out the full page (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sagVJqj4s7r8I-q8v0rYXpVaEMUtKpLk/view?usp=sharing)\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/68bcb8b6-1f98-4e70-8c6f-38894bef4e83/Frame_2147225148.png?t=1790659509)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\n**Verdict:**\\n\\nMehhhh. Classic Claude slop.\\n\\nCopy is definitely more crisp, the micro-interaction / on-hover are sweet, gg on the details.\\n\\n**Overall I\\u2019d still rate it 4/12**\\n\\nIt still has the slop colour palette. It might have the knack for the craft but AI yet doesn\\u2019t have taste.\\n\\nOh, also, Haiku is still alive and joining 5.5 family soon. Funny that Anthropic is diverging into more models while OpenAI is consolidating, yet they\\u2019re arriving at the same kind of model availability structure, if that makes sense.\\n\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n### 2. **_[cue.im](https://cue.im/)_**\\n\\nStep 1: [Go to the website](https://cue.im/), download on device of your choice (iOS coming soon)\\n\\nStep 2: Go through a standard sign up process, go through the onboarding, give it a name.\\n\\n\\u201cInvite code: Meetcue\\u201c \\u2014 \\n\\nStep 3: It has its own email and browser use enabled! (hello grokbot)\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/43377ab5-8afc-49b5-9ee9-387d06eb9c06/Frame_2147225148__1_.png?t=1790659905)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nStep 4: Ask it anything! I asked it to build me something that\\u2019d impress you lot.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/bb6ca3f7-6b4f-47ee-9069-6cd51afbe701/Frame_2147225148__2_.png?t=1790660139)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nStep 5: Voila! I am not gonna describe it, just gonna put the screenshot, followed by a button with the link to try it. Just do it.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/592be6d8-fa16-4dd2-b831-09e8dcdbb43f/Frame_2147225153.png?t=1790660215)\\nCaption: \\n\\nTry it (https://omi-last-10.proud-flat.workers.dev/)\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n# **My take**\\n\\nThis week, Cue showed up, Manus rebuilt itself from scratch, Sonnet 5.5 launched, and a personal agent raised $1 billion a month after raising at a quarter of the valuation.\\n\\nMost of these launches give an agent more freedom.\\n\\nCue has its own email and browser, Supertake will manage your money once you give it a thesis and Meta is putting Muse inside companies.\\n\\nThe only news about restraint is OpenAI pausing training because agents did things nobody expected, and Nvidia building a hardware watchdog that can quarantine an agent in milliseconds.\\n\\n**The gas pedal ships every day, and the brakes ship as press releases.**\\n\\nI felt this while testing Cue. It hit a security check and asked me to clear it on its behalf, and I did it without a second thought.\\n\\nSonnet 5.5 shows the same gap from the other side.\\n\\nIt polishes a page with craft and still hands you the palette everyone has seen a hundred times. Models are getting better at doing, and deciding what\'s good is still our job.\\n\\nSo the people who win the next year will be the ones who decide what the agent is allowed to touch.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b3b4d75d-bb12-4f79-8d25-2166d4e462d9/Frame_2147225154.png?t=1790663114)\\nFollow image link: (https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2104651136699609518?s=20)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nUntil then,\\nVaibhav \\ud83e\\udd1d\\ud83c\\udffb\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n**If you read till here, you might find this interesting**\\n\\n**#AD 1**\\n\\n### The Ultimate Claude Code Guide to ship like Anthropic engineers \\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/06fc77d3-d3b3-41c8-b70d-9a06bc4b3327/The_Ultimate_Claude_Code_Guide_2026_-_Blue_Version_1200_X_600__3_.jpg?t=1777043289)\\nFollow image link: (https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_d9f013d5-b6a5-4d4c-9694-4954e19219c5_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=f8e99db8-b6ff-4773-8c73-34f60ad922d5_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nAI will write 90% of code by the end of 2026, and only 10% of developers will stay relevant.\\n\\nThe engineers in that 10% aren\'t smarter. They just know how to use AI.\\n\\nWe put together the exact [playbook](https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_d9f013d5-b6a5-4d4c-9694-4954e19219c5_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=f8e99db8-b6ff-4773-8c73-34f60ad922d5_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) Anthropic engineers use to make sure you\'re in the top 10%.\\n\\nSign up for The Code and get access to:\\n\\n* The Ultimate Claude Code Guide 2026 \\u2014 50+ tips and tricks to code 5x faster\\n\\n* The Code newsletter \\u2014 learn the latest AI tools, tips, and skills to code faster with AI in 5 minutes a day\\n\\n[Join 250K+ engineers](https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_d9f013d5-b6a5-4d4c-9694-4954e19219c5_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=f8e99db8-b6ff-4773-8c73-34f60ad922d5_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n**#AD 2**\\n\\n### Stop rewriting prompts. Start engineering loops.\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2f87b4cc-4adc-44b7-88d6-35bef88aa839/Start_engineering_loops_beehiiv_Ad_2_V2__3_.jpg?t=1787938030)\\nFollow image link: (https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_b683cca9-4e1f-4fd4-adaf-5ef651b3c54d_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=60dc73e5-b807-44c2-b649-08e3f582c034_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nMost developers babysit AI one prompt at a time. Top engineers don\'t, they build loops that plan, execute, and self-correct. [The Code built The Ultimate Guide to Loop Engineering](https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_b683cca9-4e1f-4fd4-adaf-5ef651b3c54d_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=60dc73e5-b807-44c2-b649-08e3f582c034_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b), giving you the exact system Silicon Valley engineers use. Sign up and get the guide free, plus a 5-minute daily newsletter.\\n\\n[Claim your Loop Engineering guide](https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/5f7ce6e3-9a71-416b-99a7-606c5f7e2447?email=raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com&redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcodenewsletter.ai%2Fforms%2F14166360-de71-46c4-8722-878d417fab5c&utm_source=beehiiv&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&redirect_delay=3&_bhiiv=opp_b683cca9-4e1f-4fd4-adaf-5ef651b3c54d_94e90c2e&bhcl_id=60dc73e5-b807-44c2-b649-08e3f582c034_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n\\n----------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nYou are reading a plain text version of this post. For the best experience, copy and paste this link in your browser to view the post online:\\nhttps://newsletter.stayingahead.com/p/meet-cue\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-09-29 18:29:56\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:53.847182\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Vaibhav\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:53.847182\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"abiphtm89j\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"abfgauo7ml\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-09-29 18:29:56\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:53.847662\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 2,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Raiaayushhectocorn2029\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:53.847662\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"abi484qqm3\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"abfgauo7ml\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  }\n ],\n \"uid\": 1967,\n \"unread_notification_sent\": 0,\n \"user\": \"Administrator\"\n}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
