">\\n    <td style=\\\"word-wrap: break-word; -moz-hyphens: auto; hyphens: auto; border-collapse: collapse !important; vertical-align: top; text-align: left; color: #0a0a0a; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; line-height: 130%; font-size: 16px; margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"https://aisensy-237867b3b008.intercom-mail.com/i/o/g4xf4bna/1609010970/42e926327251d2be0489162443c3/AiSensy_Logo_Dark_PNG+-+Copy.png?expires=1806635502&amp;signature=1b638ef4e6620a45ed478d954d9d15c87613edcda2dda04307c47ba95b2f3ff4&amp;req=dSYnH8l%2FnYhYWfMW2XS%2FiYKD4TEG1ln2wyGX2D5X5TJfaglKGFk%3D%0A\\\" width=\\\"165\\\" height=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width: 165px; height: px; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; max-width: 100%; clear: both; display: block; text-align: left; padding: 15px 0 30px;\\\" class=\\\"featured\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\n    </td>\\n  </tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table></center>\\n<center style=\\\"width: 100%; min-width: 580px;\\\"><table class=\\\"container intercom-template-content\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" style=\\\"border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse; vertical-align: top; text-align: inherit; background-color: #fefefe; width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#fefefe\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"vertical-align: top; text-align: left; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><td style=\\\"word-wrap: break-word; -moz-hyphens: auto; hyphens: auto; border-collapse: collapse !important; vertical-align: top; text-align: left; color: #0a0a0a; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; line-height: 130%; font-size: 16px; margin: 0; padding: 0px 60px 45px;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"intercom-container\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 17px; margin-top: 17px; line-height: 0;\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://aisensy-237867b3b008.intercom-clicks.com/via/e?ob=1sGMUwGAWU%2BEV21m2xQcl0anfiWkHEvb4R5WaPpGbBDBvCCpXKbR1nFcmKdnqSxDWfv%2F5fs3l99ziG01%2ByLLxWKcfOHf%2F3jThi0HiVnQg%2F%2Bo9CihVJppS0kTGotOimMdIzrWNEgOKiPEct2EJdbnOTWhOG8N%2F7exMgSS8hyiQidIoR%2BwmRnVSJhggrQk78TBvZCTyt%2BpWvUaVt4HTXRK76fgQaArqq2uWoN1LafJjEo%3D&amp;h=75507eea0b8b16bf020d5de37839937ad3f6f02e-g4xf4bna_215476150878715&amp;l=9823cdc20ed6c9b8637525a7ae2f41629f1ad2f4-274649827\\\" style=\\\"color: #165fc6; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 130%; text-decoration: underline; margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://aisensy-237867b3b008.intercom-mail.com/i/o/g4xf4bna/2674033335/91cc000c0e158a866a4001a6ccd0/image+-146-.png?expires=1806635502&amp;signature=f564c1483e2d149ff3bce0f1892b5cb04e67e05181b9eb53b31d2cc1584198d1&amp;req=diYgEsl9noJcXPMW2XS%2FiYxsoAHwNn2e6Du%2F8%2FPL1Al68GUGGuw%3D%0A\\\" width=\\\"580\\\" style=\\\"outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; width: auto; max-width: 100%; clear: both; display: block; border-style: none;\\\"></a></div>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">Hey there\\ud83d\\udc4b</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">Gentle reminder: the WhatsApp messaging pricing changes we shared with you earlier will take effect on 1 October 2026.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">We\\u2019re sharing an important update regarding <b>WhatsApp messaging charges</b>, following the latest changes announced by Meta.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">Starting <b>1 October 2026</b>, the following changes will apply across the AiSensy platform:</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><b>1. Service messages will become chargeable</b></p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">These are regular, free-form replies sent by your team, chatbot or AI Agent within an active 24-hour customer service window.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">Every WhatsApp Business number will receive <b>1,000 free service messages each month</b>. From the <b>1,001st delivered service message</b> that month, messages to Indian numbers will cost <b>\\u20b90.145 each</b>.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">The free allowance resets every month. Unused messages do not carry forward.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><b>2. Utility messages within the 24-hour window will also become chargeable</b></p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">Utility templates, such as order confirmations, payment receipts and delivery updates, will be charged even when delivered within an active customer service window.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">For Indian recipients, the rate is <b>\\u20b90.145 per delivered utility message</b>. The 1,000 free service messages do not cover utility templates.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><b>What will remain free?</b></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"font-size: 15px; color: #525252; margin: 0 0 20px 40px; padding: 0;\\\">\\n<li>Incoming messages from your customers that you haven\'t replied to, yet. </li>\\n</ul>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><b>WhatsApp Conversation Credits will be deducted only when a chargeable message is successfully delivered.</b></p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #525252; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">Pricing varies by the recipient\\u2019s country. You can review the complete rate sheet below:</p>\\n<div class=\\\"intercom-button-container\\\"><table class=\\\"button radius intercom-align-center\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\" style=\\\"border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse; vertical-align: top; text-align: center !important; width: auto; margin: 0 auto 16px; padding: 0;\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"vertical-align: top; text-align: left; padding: 0;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><td style=\\\"word-