ecoration: none; font-weight: 300; text-align: center !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; margin: 18px 0 17px; padding: 0;\\\" class=\\\"powered-by intercom-align-center intercom-interblocks-align-center\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\n  Powered by <a href=\\\"https://aisensy-237867b3b008.intercom-clicks.com/via/e?ob=eU1QGWZ7R%2F9%2BtMX%2FEV7H21T89tC7Tn7%2BRsG6W7lHm8w6%2BiG5chrOH0yQVcEke%2F9766vysbT5i4PpYZwzm1nwRYQU65%2FlM0lCAY3WkbR6J%2FSlG2%2B8GmXyAFHGJLEPK02udzLkAmQeYV%2BjvEtNH22BVIv7r7DkNXsigukDmbMx0ewbbelO42N2haoEoddO2G2UJx8hidbvcvhFP8kmo28Cvw%3D%3D&amp;h=dbcf7a87e03f4d5b26156522854fd70dd7323ed2-g4xf4bna_215476150878715\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"intercom-content-link intercom-footer-link\\\" style=\\\"color: #1251ba !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; line-height: 130%; text-decoration: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Intercom</a>\\n</p>\\n<style>\\n  table.container p.powered-by a {\\n    font-weight: bold;\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n    color: #999;\\n  }\\n</style>\\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\\n                        </td>\\n                    </tr>\\n                </tbody>\\n</table>\\n            </td>\\n        </tr>\\n    </tbody>\\n</table>\\n\\n\\n<img src=\\\"https://aisensy-237867b3b008.intercom-mail.com/via/o?h=05bfb62c1cede924a2682a9e071dc2de6fbc1ce2-g4xf4bna_215476150878715\\\" width=\\\"1\\\" height=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"display: block;\\\" alt=\\\"intercom\\\">\\n\\n<img border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"1\\\" height=\\\"1\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"https://aisensy-237867b3b008.intercom-mail.com/q/FtmB7sjufKGC8OEA2HUA9w~~/AAAAARA~/ZxLl7LkxV0vWkJp6EaoGlwMlH0LU8VanWnFUEk7lOgyBMEJhkRqmFVdfBoWDy_zEtjJWC6Wtmxo0b2OcAUKDrvPTmO2GqrrPS3vIXddX8Qg~\\\">\\n\\n\",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:53.912892\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"7ec3814b-9f5d5283-1790674416-215476150878715-2663693@outbound.intercom.aisensy.org\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:53.994692\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"abjuqaoovn\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00063\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"notifications@aisensy.org\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"AiSensy\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"WhatsApp Messaging pricing update: Changes from 1 October 2026\",\n \"text_content\": \"[Image] \\n Hey there\\ud83d\\udc4b \\n Gentle reminder: the WhatsApp messaging pricing changes we shared with you earlier will take effect on 1 October 2026. \\n We\\u2019re sharing an important update regarding WhatsApp messaging charges, following the latest changes announced by Meta. \\n Starting 1 October 2026, the following changes will apply across the AiSensy platform: \\n 1. Service messages will become chargeable \\n These are regular, free-form replies sent by your team, chatbot or AI Agent within an active 24-hour customer service window. \\n Every WhatsApp Business number will receive 1,000 free service messages each month. From the 1,001st delivered service message that month, messages to Indian numbers will cost \\u20b90.145 each. \\n The free allowance resets every month. Unused messages do not carry forward. \\n 2. Utility messages within the 24-hour window will also become chargeable \\n Utility templates, such as order confirmations, payment receipts and delivery updates, will be charged even when delivered within an active customer service window. \\n For Indian recipients, the rate is \\u20b90.145 per delivered utility message. The 1,000 free service messages do not cover utility templates. \\n What will remain free? \\n - Incoming messages from your customers that you haven\'t replied to, yet. \\n WhatsApp Conversation Credits will be deducted only when a chargeable message is successfully delivered. \\n Pricing varies by the recipient\\u2019s country. You can review the complete rate sheet below: \\n Check Countrywise Pricing Update \\n Learn more \\n \\u200b \\n If you have any questions, reach out to our team through Live Chat on your AiSensy dashboard or write to us on support@aisensy.com \\n Team AiSensy\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-09-29 15:03:37\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:54.036917\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Raiaayushhectocorn2029\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:54.036917\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"abkbvgbfvv\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"abjuqaoovn\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-09-29 15:03:37\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:54.037547\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 2,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Notifications\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:54.037547\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"abkdu9d5sg\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"abjuqaoovn\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  }\n ],\n \"uid\": 1968,\n \"unread_notification_sent\": 0,\n \"user\": \"Administrator\"\n}',NU