t;!-->\\n      <img class=\\\"jl-banner-mobile\\\" src=\\\"https://mail-assets.jobleads.de/braze/default-header-mobile-l.png\\\" alt=\\\"JobLeads \\u2014 the job platform on your side.\\\" style=\\\"display: none; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 14px; border-width: 0;\\\">\\n      <!--&amp;lt;![endif]-->\\n    </td>\\n  </tr>\\n</tbody></table>\\n<div style=\\\"height: 28px; line-height: 28px; font-size: 0;\\\">&nbsp;</div>\\n<p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #272625; margin: 0 0 16px;\'>Hi Aayush,</p>\\n<p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #272625; margin: 0 0 16px;\'>Job searching is heavy. Stepping back for a while is normal, and your search stays set up while you\'re away.</p>\\n<p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #272625; margin: 0;\'>Whenever you come back, your matches are refreshed against the roles that are open right now. And if you\'ve already landed your next role, congratulations. That\'s the outcome that matters, and we\'ll be here for the move after.</p><div style=\\\"height: 28px; line-height: 28px; font-size: 0;\\\">&nbsp;</div>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\\\">\\n  <tbody><tr><td style=\\\"padding: 0;\\\">\\n    <!-- Eyebrow -->\\n    <p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.10em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #A03E3C; margin: 0 0 10px;\'>Matched from your resume</p>\\n    <!-- Title -->\\n    <h2 style=\'font-family: \\\"PP Right Grotesk\\\", \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #100F0E; margin: 0 0 16px;\'>Let your resume do the work. Discover jobs that truly fit your profile.</h2>\\n    <!-- Promotional match-emblem panel (abstract \\u2014 no real jobs) -->\\n    <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; border-radius: 14px; margin: 0 0 20px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#F5F1EB\\\">\\n      <tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding: 26px 18px;\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"https://mail-assets.jobleads.de/braze/rsume-match-illustration.png\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"display: block; width: 200px; height: 160px; margin: 0 auto; border-width: 0;\\\">\\n      </td></tr>\\n    </tbody></table>\\n    <!-- Body -->\\n    <p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #484745; margin: 0;\'>Your resume on file unlocks resume matches, a feed of roles matched to your experience, so the strongest fits come straight to you.</p>\\n    <!-- CTA -->\\n    <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: separate; margin: 24px auto 0;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#F56462\\\" style=\\\"border-radius: 9999px;\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"https://go.jobs.jobleads.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.jobleads.com%2Fsearch%2Fjobs%3Flid=29z3iuj3jios%26view=for-you%26utm_source=braze%26utm_medium=email%26utm_campaign=c3_re_engage%26utm_content=cb_resume_discovery%26lang=en%26utm_term=c3_e3%26kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d/1/010701a0f0a232fa-1384b9c9-656a-4530-b0e3-7ad3480492c8-000000/BR-FF7Wb5shKJOwohZolLFfcDlVeZSG1-dNyGja9Izw=258\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\'display: inline-block; font-family: \\\"PP Right Grotesk\\\", \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 9999px; background-color: #F56462; white-space: nowrap; padding: 17px 32px;\'>See your matches</a>\\n    </td></tr></tbody></table>\\n  </td></tr>\\n</tbody></table>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 30px 0;\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"font-size: 0; line-height: 0; height: 1px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#EFE9E1\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\\n<p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #484745; margin: 0 0 2px;\'>Wishing you career success,</p>\\n<p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #484745; margin: 0;\'>Anna Bauer</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; margin: 22px 0 0;\\\">\\n  <tbody><tr>\\n    <td width=\\\"72\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" style=\\\"padding-right: 18px;\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"https://mail-assets.jobleads.de/braze/anna-bauer-photo.png\\\" width=\\\"64\\\" height=\\\"64\\\" alt=\\\"Anna Bauer\\\" style=\\\"display: block; width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 9999px; border-width: 0;\\\">\\n    </td>\\n    <td valign=\\\"middle\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"https://mail-assets.jobleads.de/braze/signature-anna-bauer.png\\\" alt=\\\"Anna Bauer\'s handwritten signature\\\" style=\\\"display: block; height: 26px; width: auto; max-width: 170px; border-width: 0;\\\">\\n      <p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 500; color: #100F0E; margin: 0;\'>Anna Bauer</p>\\n      <p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #787673; margin: 2px 0 0;\'>JobLeads Career Desk</p>\\n    </td>\\n  </tr>\\