 Aayush\",\n \"text_content\": \"No rush. Your search stays\\r\\nsaved, and we keep it current.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n96      \\u200c \\u200c \\u200c \\u200c \\u200c \\u200c \\u200c\\r\\nJobLeads \\r\\n( https://www.jobleads.com/?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_header&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n          JobLeads \\u2014 the job platform on your side.\\r\\nJobLeads \\u2014 the job platform on your side. Hi\\r\\nAayush,\\r\\n\\r\\nJob searching is heavy. Stepping back for a while is normal, and\\r\\nyour search stays set up while you\'re away.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhenever you come back, your matches are refreshed against the\\r\\nroles that are open right now. And if you\'ve already landed your\\r\\nnext role, congratulations. That\'s the outcome that matters, and\\r\\nwe\'ll be here for the move after.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n    Matched from your resume\\r\\n\\r\\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\nLet your resume do the work. Discover jobs that truly fit your\\r\\nprofile.\\r\\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nYour resume on file unlocks resume matches, a feed of\\r\\nroles matched to your experience, so the strongest fits come\\r\\nstraight to you.\\r\\n\\r\\nSee your matches (\\r\\nhttps://www.jobleads.com/search/jobs?lid=29z3iuj3jios&view=for-you&utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=cb_resume_discovery&lang=en&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d\\r\\n)    \\r\\n Wishing you career success,\\r\\n\\r\\nAnna Bauer\\r\\n\\r\\nAnna Bauer   Anna Bauer\'s handwritten signature Anna Bauer\\r\\n\\r\\nJobLeads Career DeskLinkedIn \\r\\n( https://www.linkedin.com/company/jobleads-gmbh?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n   Instagram \\r\\n( https://www.instagram.com/jobleadscom?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n   YouTube \\r\\n( https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD-tDcD6v8Fr7ag0BOIRTyA?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n   Facebook \\r\\n( https://www.facebook.com/JobLeads?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d ) Having problems logging in?\\r\\nClick here \\r\\n( https://www.jobleads.com/forgot-password?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&lang=en&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nDo you have questions or need help? Please check out our Help\\r\\nCenter \\r\\n( https://support.jobleads.com/?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&lang=en&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou are getting this email because you are registered as a\\r\\nmember of JobLeads. If you do not wish to receive emails anymore,\\r\\nplease unsubscribe \\r\\n( https://www.jobleads.com/manage-email-notifications?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&lang=en&utm_term=c3_e3&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u00a9 JobLeads GmbH | Brandstwiete 4 | 20457 Hamburg, Germany \\u00b7\\r\\nCommercial Register Entry: District Court of Hamburg \\u2013 HRB 101441\\r\\n\\u00b7 Managing Directors: Christian von Ahlen, Jan Hendrik von Ahlen,\\r\\nMartin Schmidt\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-09-30 10:15:56\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:54.775203\",\n   \"docstatus\