 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Big claim. So I put both in the ring. <b>But first, the catch-up.</b></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><tbody><tr><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"12.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:12.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td bgcolor=\\\"transparent\\\" style=\\\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#687667;border-radius:8px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;padding:16.0px 0px 16.0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td><td><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"table-layout:fixed;\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\"><b>NEWS CATCH-UP</b></h1></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\"><b>GPT-6 got cheaper.</b></span> Sol and Luna cost half of what they replace. Catch: for now they <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>