\u200c\\u00a0\\u200c\\u00a0\\u200c\\u00a0\\u200c\\u00a0\\u200c\\u00a0\\u200c\\u00a0</div><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;background:#ffffff;\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"container\\\" style=\\\"width:600px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #d7d7d7;\\\" width=\\\"600\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding:22px 20px 24px 20px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://delivery.info.bigbasket.com/NQFKMIDW?id=33104=ehgCUwYAUwUCHlBSAl0FUVcDDl4BWgRTAFADU1BcU1NaXAMGAwJUDQRSAgBVUgYGBgFKSlULUwdIRkJaDgAFQVYHXRFbAVIHDyJSW1AMXUpSCltEBVULVgADAwVRVVIEAFMDVgJPCkFCEkYMHkpVAV0MQF1GGxwPX1VeHAQMAVdYF1kGQR0BWltNe2d3LnwtdTIJUVAeRFU=&amp;fl=URBGE0YJTRpbDVBpXAsJHR8AW1ldDh9XAR1cXQMLAVReARwAWl5NQwdNUFtQDF0HXQxVUw==&amp;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img alt=\\\"bigbasket - A TATA Enterprise\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248073030GDATYKbigbasket-logo.png\\\" style=\\\"width:205px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"205\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"hero\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248209005YCB44WHeader.gif\\\" style=\\\"width:600px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"600\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:28px 42px 18px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\\\">&lt;data name=\\\"first_name\\\" value=\\\"B7cQhqCFMapZSZJLTDPQm\\\"&gt;Ayush&lt;/data&gt;,1 in 4 bigbasketeers already shop organic fruits, vegetables and staples at bb. Are you one of them?</p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">Many of us know that going organic can be good for us and the planet, but still have questions about what it really means, whether it\'s worth it, and where to start. World Organic Day falls this week, so we thought we\'d tackle those questions head-on.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px 42px 12px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"qtitle\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#2d2d2d;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #a4c734;\\\">#Q1 </span> What exactly is organic food?</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 14px 42px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248266788P0MXRJimg2.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 12px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\\\">The label \\\"organic\\\" can sometimes sound like just another marketing buzzword. So what actually makes your fruits or veggies organic?</p><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\\\"><strong style=\\\"color:#e54b4b;\\\">\\u2715</strong> No synthetic pesticides</p><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\\\"><strong style=\\\"color:#e54b4b;\\\">\\u2715</strong> No synthetic fertilisers</p><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\\\"><strong style=\\\"color:#e54b4b;\\\">\\u2715</strong> No genetically modified seeds</p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">But organic farming isn\'t just about what farmers don\'t use. It\'s also about working with nature by following farming practices that support soil health and biodiversity.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px 42px 10px 42px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://delivery.info.bigbasket.com/NQFKMIDW?id=33104=ehgCUwYAUwUCHgBTAF0CUwFTAAAAVVFUAFEJBwBQAFRcAAoGDQJWVAFVUFIHXVIFBwZKSlULUwdIRkJaDgAFQVYHXRFbAVIHDyJSW1AMXUpSCltEBVULVgADAwVRVVIEAFMDVgJPCkFCEkYMHkpVAV0MQF1GGxwPX1VeHAQMAVdYF1kGQR0BWltNe2d3LnwtdTIJUVAeRFU=&amp;fl=URBGE0YJTRpbDVBpXAsJHR8AW1ldDh9XAR1cXQMLAVReARwAWl5NQwdNUFtQDF0HXQxVUw==&amp;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/202609220712483366588RDVCRimg3.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 24px 42px;\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"store-col\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 6px 0 0;\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"33.33%\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://delivery.info.bigbasket.com/NQFKMIDW?id=33104=ehgCUwYAUwUCHlQACAZSXAgHDlxXUFBUCAUDB18HUwZdBQoADAZUUFADDA5VUAMHAVZKSlULUwdIRkJaDgAFQVYHXRFbAVIHDyJSW1AMXUpSCltEBVULVgADAwVRVVIEAFMDVgJPCkFCEkYMHkpVAV0MQF1GGxwPX1VeHAQMAVdYF1kGQR0BWltNe2d3LnwtdTIJUVAeRFU=&amp;fl=URBGE0YJTRpbDVBpXAsJHR8AW1ldDh9XAR1cXQMLAVReARwAWl5NQwdNUFtQDF0HXQxVUw==&amp;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img alt=\\\"Organic fruits\\\" class=\\\"store-img\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248386830XVBMPSimg4.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:166px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"166\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" class=\\\"cat-label-wrap\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:8px;\\\"><a class=\\\"cat-label\\\" href=\\\"https://delivery.info.bigbasket.com/NQFKMIDW?id=33104=ehgCUwYAUwUCHgBSAwcEVAgGUA8MVQReVVIGUwIDVgYIB1ZRB1BQBQYAAAVXUANWCFVKSlULUwdIRkJaDgAFQVYHXRFbAVIHDyJSW1AMXUpSCltEBVULVgADAwVRVVIEAFMDVgJPCkFCEkYMHkpVAV0MQF1GGxwPX1VeHAQMAVdYF1kGQR0BWltNe2d3LnwtdTIJUVAeRFU=&amp;fl=URBGE0YJTRpbDVBpXAsJHR8AW1ldDh9XAR1cXQMLAVReARwAWl5NQwdNUFtQDF0HXQxVUw==&amp;\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#000;background:#a8cf2d;display:block;padding:12px 6px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">ORGANIC FRUITS</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\\\"store-col\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 3px;\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"33.33%\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\"><a href=\\\"\\thttps://www.bigbasket.com/sh/067bf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img alt=\\\"Organic veggies\\\" class=\\\"store-img\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248433129FDA8EYimg5.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:166px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"166\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" class=\\\"cat-label-wrap\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:8px;\\\"><a class=\\\"cat-label\\\" href=\\\"\\thttps://www.bigbasket.com/sh/067bf\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#000;background:#a8cf2d;display:block;padding:12px 6px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">ORGANIC VEGGIES</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\\\"store-col\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 0 0 6px;\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"33.33%\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://delivery.info.bigbasket.com/NQFKMIDW?id=33104=ehgCUwYAUwUCHlQOCFcGUlAEAwsCUgFfBQBQAAMHUFEPVAsGVANQV1JVUARSVQlSAlZKSlULUwdIRkJaDgAFQVYHXRFbAVIHDyJSW1AMXUpSCltEBVULVgADAwVRVVIEAFMDVgJPCkFCEkYMHkpVAV0MQF1GGxwPX1VeHAQMAVdYF1kGQR0BWltNe2d3LnwtdTIJUVAeRFU=&amp;fl=URBGE0YJTRpbDVBpXAsJHR8AW1ldDh9XAR1cXQMLAVReARwAWl5NQwdNUFtQDF0HXQxVUw==&amp;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img alt=\\\"Organic staples\\\" class=\\\"store-img\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/202609220712484972923835FZimg6.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:166px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"166\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" class=\\\"cat-label-wrap\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:8px;\\\"><a class=\\\"cat-label\\\" href=\\\"\\thttps://www.bigbasket.com/sh/6f412\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#000;background:#a8cf2d;display:block;padding:12px 6px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">ORGANIC STAPLES</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:4px 42px 12px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"qtitle\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#2d2d2d;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #a4c734;\\\">#Q2 </span>How can I trust that what is marketed as organic is truly organic?</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 12px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\\\">With so many brands making the organic claim, it\'s only natural to wonder what\'s real. Here\'s how we make sure at bb.</p><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\\\"><strong>Certified Organic</strong></p><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\\\">All 200+ organic products at bigbasket are certified under recognised government-backed organic standards, including India Organic and Jaivik Bharat. Each product is also tested for 200+ chemical residues.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 16px 42px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248546075ZU5EQ0img7.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 25px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\\\"><strong>Quality assured</strong></p><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\\\">Organic products are handled through dedicated collection centres, so they never mix with conventional produce-and strict checks ensure safety and quality, every single time.</p><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\\\"><strong>Responsibly sourced</strong></p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">We work with certified organic farmers across 50+ Farmer Producer Organizations (FPOs), under recognised government organic certification programmes like the National Programme for Organic Production (NPOP) and the Participatory Guarantee System (PGS).</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 18px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"rule\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;background:#a8cf2d;\\\">\\u00a0</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:16px 42px 10px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"subhead\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;color:#2d2d2d;\\\">How bb supports organic farming</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 12px 42px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248598355OY5D3Uimg8.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 24px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">&lt;data name=\\\"first_name\\\" value=\\\"MZUlaZb_2tfCf-sWngEOS\\\"&gt;Ayush&lt;/data&gt;, there\'s a lot happening behind that organic label. <br><br> Over 1,000 farmers are currently training with us, with our agronomists guiding them towards PGS certification. So far, we\'ve helped over 1,900 farmers across 22 farmer groups get organic-certified. We\'ve also trained local youth as jaivikmitras (organic farming guides), who work at 12 collection centres dedicated to organic produce.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 18px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"rule\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;background:#a8cf2d;\\\">\\u00a0</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:30px 42px 12px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"qtitle\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#2d2d2d;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #a4c734;\\\">#Q3 </span> If I wash my fruits and vegetables properly, do I still need to buy organic?</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 14px 42px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248642721N38FPYimg9.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 24px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\\\">Washing can remove dirt and some pesticide residues from the surface, but it can\'t remove everything. Some pesticides can be absorbed into plant tissues, depending on the pesticide, the crop and how it is applied. Fertilisers are a different deal: plants take up nutrients from the soil, so washing isn\'t a way of removing them.</p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">So while washing is important for hygiene, it\'s not a substitute for choosing organic.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 12px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"qtitle\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#2d2d2d;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #a4c734;\\\">#Q4 </span> If I want to start buying organic, <br> where should I start?</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 14px 42px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248689272T8N8D8img10.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 24px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\">You don\'t have to switch your entire grocery basket to organic overnight. Start with the fruits, veggies and staples you buy most often, and swap them out one by one. Once you get into the habit, you can add more.</td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 12px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"qtitle\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#2d2d2d;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #a4c734;\\\">#Q5 </span>Does going organic matter for rice, dal, atta and other staples too?</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 14px 42px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248763299RHX9JAimg11.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 24px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\">Even though they\'re cooked, rice, dal and other staples can still contain residues from the way they were grown. Cooking may reduce some pesticide residues, but it doesn\'t necessarily remove them all. So if you want to minimise your exposure to synthetic agricultural inputs, it makes sense to choose organic staples too.</td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 12px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"qtitle\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#2d2d2d;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #a4c734;\\\">#Q6 </span> But isn\'t organic very expensive?</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 14px 42px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/20260922071248810650LAUKPDimg12.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 18px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\\\">Not always, and certainly not at bb. Yes, organic food has a reputation for being expensive. But some time ago, we made a conscious decision to bring down the price of organic produce, so that it\'s on par with non-organic produce.</p><p style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">So &lt;data name=\\\"first_name\\\" value=\\\"QNr-U7ce5hzNsEGRRy6jx\\\"&gt;Ayush&lt;/data&gt;, go ahead, make the switch without the stretch!</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 20px 42px;\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\\\"#a8cf2d\\\"><a class=\\\"button\\\" href=\\\"\\thttps://www.bigbasket.com/sh/6b760\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#000;background:#a8cf2d;display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">EXPLORE OUR ORGANIC STORE</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 18px 42px;\\\"><div class=\\\"rule\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;background:#a8cf2d;\\\">\\u00a0</div></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px copy\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 14px 42px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#202020;\\\">&lt;data name=\\\"first_name\\\" value=\\\"XTu4mO8KUdQKGgs-KY-it\\\"&gt;Ayush&lt;/data&gt;, ready to give organic a go?</td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 12px 42px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"The bb Organic Store\\\" class=\\\"fluid\\\" src=\\\"https://em-img-01.moengage.com/bigbasketprodmoengage/2026092207124890498351CDGKimg13.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width:516px;max-width:100%;height:auto;\\\" width=\\\"516\\\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 42px 24px 42px;\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\\"store-col\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 6px 0 0;\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"33.33%\\\"><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tbody><t