 <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; border-radius: 14px; margin: 0 0 20px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#F5F1EB\\\">\\n      <tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding: 26px 18px;\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"https://mail-assets.jobleads.de/braze/rsume-match-illustration.png\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"display: block; width: 200px; height: 160px; margin: 0 auto; border-width: 0;\\\">\\n      </td></tr>\\n    </tbody></table>\\n    <!-- Body -->\\n    <p style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #484745; margin: 0;\'>Your resume on file unlocks resume matches, a feed of roles matched to your experience, so the strongest fits come straight to you.</p>\\n    <!-- CTA -->\\n    <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: separate; margin: 24px auto 0;\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#F56462\\\" style=\\\"border-radius: 9999px;\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"https://go.jobs.jobleads.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.jobleads.com%2Fsearch%2Fjobs%3Flid=29z3iuj3jios%26view=for-you%26utm_source=braze%26utm_medium=email%26utm_campaign=c3_re_engage%26utm_content=cb_resume_discovery%26lang=en%26utm_term=c3_e1%26kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d/1/010701a0cb2caacf-7462b511-9d72-451d-94df-cc70df72a8e5-000000/hv9WfpmhY9LIA8S5pYMwQd5fxWNyQOWjLfrAxKEB9Rw=258\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\'display: inline-block; font-family: \\\"PP Right Grotesk\\\", \\\"Inter\\\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 9999px; background-color: #F56462; white-space: nowrap; padding: 17px 32px;\'>See your matches</a>\\n    </td></tr></tbody></table>\\n  </td></tr