u200c\\r\\nJobLeads \\r\\n( https://www.jobleads.com/?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_header&utm_term=c3_e1&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n          JobLeads \\u2014 the job platform on your side.\\r\\nJobLeads \\u2014 the job platform on your side. Hi\\r\\nAayush,\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n Picking a search back up is\\r\\neasier than starting one.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe kept things current while you were away. Here\'s a good place\\r\\nto step back in:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n    Matched from your resume\\r\\n\\r\\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\nLet your resume do the work. Discover jobs that truly fit your\\r\\nprofile.\\r\\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nYour resume on file unlocks resume matches, a feed of\\r\\nroles matched to your experience, so the strongest fits come\\r\\nstraight to you.\\r\\n\\r\\nSee your matches (\\r\\nhttps://www.jobleads.com/search/jobs?lid=29z3iuj3jios&view=for-you&utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=cb_resume_discovery&lang=en&utm_term=c3_e1&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d\\r\\n)    \\r\\n Wishing you career success,\\r\\n\\r\\nAnna Bauer\\r\\n\\r\\nAnna Bauer   Anna Bauer\'s handwritten signature Anna Bauer\\r\\n\\r\\nJobLeads Career DeskLinkedIn \\r\\n( https://www.linkedin.com/company/jobleads-gmbh?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&utm_term=c3_e1&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n   Instagram \\r\\n( https://www.instagram.com/jobleadscom?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=base_template_footer&utm_term=c3_e1&kuuid=18456143de3f7aed43197331d72e089d )\\r\\n   YouTube \\r\\n( https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD-tDcD6v8Fr7ag0BOIRTyA?utm_source=braze&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=c3_re_engage&utm_content=bas