02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoalnU9%2BTQzrnj1yTdoDsUsttKvV0dq3sO6iRh6N6kmoDHG0nXtK1jVjm20O6SUBf3XrZJpzj%2Fwh9BiLrmdNj%2Bjq9lEQZiexMu4Lro%2BnLInXVKV0lEgyaKhd2k23ICPzS%2F0O17d3D1UvOTTZ1oUBKP91GfAahoEYS%2Bi071a0QwmcfHMepW%2Bm56EhRf9n2YMTQOE%3D\\\" style=\\\"border:0;outline:0;text-decoration:none;color:#424245;\\\" class=\\\"m23 m20\\\">Get\\u00a0the\\u00a0Apple\\u00a0Store\\u00a0App</a><span class=\\\"m21\\\" style=\\\"color:#6e6e73;\\\"></span> </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\\\"padding:16px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-align:left;height:1px;\\\"> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> *Listed pricing is Maximum Retail Price (inclusive of all taxes). </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> \\u25caNo Cost EMI is available with the purchase of an <a href=\\\"https://www.apple.com/in/shop/ways-to-buy\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">eligible product</a> made using qualifying cards on 3- or 6-month tenures from most leading card issuers. Monthly pricing is rounded to the nearest rupee. Exact pricing will be provided by your card issuer, subject to your card issuer\\u2019s terms and conditions. Minimum order spend applies as per your card issuer\\u2019s threshold. No Cost EMI is not available to business customers and cannot be combined with Apple Store for Education or Corporate Employee Purchase Plan pricing. Card eligibility is subject to terms and conditions between you and your card issuer. Offer may be revised or withdrawn at any time without any prior notice. <a href=\\\"https://www.apple.com/in/shop/browse/financing/terms\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">Terms apply</a>. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 1. Up to 1.5x more Active Noise Cancellation compared with AirPods 4 with Active Noise Cancellation when tested in accordance with IEC 60268-24. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 2. Apple\\u00a0Intelligence is available with Siri and device language set to Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional), Danish, Dutch, English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese, Spanish, Swedish, Turkish or Vietnamese. Some features may not be available in all regions or languages. Some devices may not be available in all regions. Siri\\u00a0AI is available in beta in iOS\\u00a027, macOS\\u00a027 and watchOS\\u00a027, and requires an Apple\\u00a0Intelligence\\u2013enabled device set to a supported language. Available in English to start. Siri\\u00a0AI will not be initially available in the EU on iOS, iPadOS and watchOS. Certain Apple\\u00a0Intelligence features that rely on server-side models are subject to daily usage limits, including but not limited to Siri\\u00a0AI, Intelligent Photo Editing Tools, Image Playground and AFM\\u00a03 Cloud models in Shortcuts. Daily limits may vary by feature, request complexity, system demand, system policies and other factors. Expanded access to such features will be available for a fee in the future. Use of these features is subject to the Apple\\u00a0Intelligence Terms and Conditions. Learn more at <a href=\\\"https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&amp;a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoalnU9%2BTQzrnj1yTdoDsUsttKvV0dq3sO6iRh6N6kmoDHG0nXtK1jVjm20O6SUBf3XrZJpzj%2Fwh9BiLrmdNj%2Bjq9lEQZiexMu4Lro%2BnLInXVKV0lEgyaKhd2k23ICPzS%2F0O17d3D1UvOTTZ1oUBKP91GfAahoEYS%2Bi071a0QwmcfKFpBWlyXkMts5QtSkD2I2I%3D\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">apple.com/in/apple-intelligence</a>. Hands-free access to Siri\\u00a0AI works on all AirPods. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 3. Available on compatible Apple devices with the latest operating system software when paired with compatible AirPods with the latest firmware when Apple Intelligence is turned on. Available in beta. Some features may not be available in all regions or languages; for more information, see <a href=\\\"https://www.apple.com/in/ios/feature-availability/#apple-intelligence-live-translation-with-airpods\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">Feature Availability</a>. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 4. Device performance and noise control features like Active Noise Cancellation, Adaptive Audio and Transparency can be affected by debris or earwax build-up. Clean the device regularly to maintain performance and full feature functionality. Refer to <a href=\\\"https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&amp;a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoalnU9%2BTQzrnj1yTdoDsUsttKvV0dq3sO6iRh6N6kmoDHG0nXtK1jVjm20O6SUBf3XrZJpzj%2Fwh9BiLrmdNj%2Bjq9lEQZiexMu4Lro%2BnLInXVKV0lEgyaKhd2k23ICPzS%2F0O17d3D1UvOTTZ1oUBKP91GfAahoEYS%2Bi071a0QwmcfCHbXuCPIPdNd0koZFU2gPg%3D\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">support.apple.com/en-in/102672</a> for AirPods cleaning instructions. Refer to <a href=\\\"https://c.apple.com/r?v=2&amp;a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoalnU9%2BTQzrnj1yTdoDsUsttKvV0dq3sO6iRh6N6kmoDHG0nXtK1jVjm20O6SUBf3XrZJpzj%2Fwh9BiLrmdNj%2Bjq9lEQZiexMu4Lro%2BnLInXVKV0lEgyaKhd2k23ICPzS%2F0O17d3D1UvOTTZ1oUBKP91GfAahoEYS%2Bi071a0QwmcfDK8EGfYqyOhp8%2FktLMSinQ%3D\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">support.apple.com/en-in/120409</a> for AirPods Pro cleaning instructions. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 5. Requires a compatible Apple device running the latest operating system software. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 6. Testing conducted by Apple in July and August 2026 using pre-production AirPods\\u00a05 with Wireless Charging Case paired with pre-production iPhone\\u00a018\\u00a0Pro units, all with pre-release software. The playlist consisted of 358 unique audio tracks purchased from the iTunes Store (256-Kbps AAC encoding). Volume was set to 50%, Spatial Audio and Conversation Awareness were off, and Noise Control was set to Active Noise Cancellation. With Noise Control turned off, listening time was up to 7 hours. Testing consisted of full AirPods battery discharge while playing audio until the first AirPod stopped playback. Listening time for AirPods\\u00a05 was up to 4 hours with Active Noise Cancellation on and up to 6 hours with Active Noise Cancellation off. Battery life depends on device settings, environment, usage and many other factors. </p> <p style=\\\"line-height:16px;letter-spacing:normal;color:#6e6e73;margin-top:9px;padding:0;margin-bottom:0;\\\"> 7. New subscribers only. \\u20b9139/month after trial. Offer is available for new Apple\\u00a0Music subscribers with a new eligible device for a limited time only. Offer redemption for eligible audio devices requires connecting or pairing to an Apple\\u00a0device running the latest iOS or iPadOS. Offer redemption for Apple\\u00a0Watch requires connecting or pairing to an iPhone running the latest iOS. Offer is valid for 3 months after eligible device activation. Only one offer per Apple\\u00a0ID, regardless of the number of eligible devices you purchase. Plan automatically renews until cancelled. Restrictions and other <a href=\\\"https://www.apple.com/in/promo/\\\" style=\\\"color:#424245;\\\">terms</a> apply. </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\\\"padding:9px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-align:left;height:1px;\\\"> <p style=\\\"margin:0;line-height:16px;color:#6e6e73;\\\"> TM and \\u00a9 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved. <br><br> Apple India Private Limited <br> <span class=\