usage limits, including but not limited to Siri\\u00a0AI, Intelligent Photo Editing Tools, Image Playground and AFM\\u00a03 Cloud models in Shortcuts. Daily limits may vary by feature, request complexity, system demand, system policies and other factors. Expanded access to such features will be available for a fee in the future. Use of these features is subject to the Apple\\u00a0Intelligence Terms and Conditions. Learn more atapple.com/in/apple-intelligence. Hands-free access to Siri\\u00a0AI works on all AirPods.\\r\\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoYYhN7u0Dnce%2F4Q6bIm%2BBfSArhfehUoeQchQSBbkXORpFZj7CXfDuNGbaVCX5iI1bKhPTBiNS36Tw4LuNZDqV6%2FoHqq22dBBXfvLG2zdE2fKAiUWrbbKtkrioYg5Ys6x%2FiYpgKo4asTSZVucIaJ9E%2FOoIIprJZZUO0HTw69iDVJWhu%2BZicDRApOPGuPCwPyia4%3D\\r\\n\\r\\n3. Available on compatible Apple devices with the latest operating system software when paired with compatible AirPods with the latest firmware when Apple Intelligence is turned on. Available in beta. Some features may not be available in all regions or languages; for more information, see Feature Availability.\\r\\nhttps://www.apple.com/in/ios/feature-availability/#apple-intelligence-live-translation-with-airpods\\r\\n\\r\\n4. Device performance and noise control features like Active Noise Cancellation, Adaptive Audio and Transparency can be affected by debris or earwax build-up. Clean the device regularly to maintain performance and full feature functionality. Refer tosupport.apple.com/en-in/102672 for AirPods cleaning instructions. Refer tosupport.apple.com/en-in/120409 for AirPods Pro cleaning instructions.\\r\\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=o2CKfLM8dAL7lynfnyn7UJ45iP47mfTUHVkqqzOWPHd%2FEPXXcLfuV%2BCYRyxE3JB92N0acsy02r8zFnoHl02e5qXxbyZLP8jjTnWKace%2BdoYYhN7u0Dnce%2F4Q6bIm%2BBfSArhfehUoeQchQSBbkXORpFZj7CXfDuNGbaVCX5iI1bKhPTBiNS36Tw4LuNZDqV6%2FoHqq22dBBXfvLG2zdE2fKAiUWrbbKtkrioYg5Ys6x%2FiYpgKo4asT