an style=\\\"font-weight:400;\\\"><b>Score</b></span>\\u00a0 \\u2192 place something on an ordered scale<br><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;\\\"><b>Noul</b></span> \\u00a0 \\u2192 answer a yes/no question as a probability </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> For example: </p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;\\\"><pre style=\\\"background:#282828;border-radius:10px;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.5;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;\\\"><code><span style=\\\"color: #d2a8ff;\\\">Which</span> <span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">team</span> <span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">owns</span> <span style=\\\"color: #ff7b72;\\\">this</span><span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">?</span>\\n<span style=\\\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519;\\\">\\u2192</span> <span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">billing</span><span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">:</span> <span style=\\\"color: #79c0ff;\\\">0.91</span>\\n<span style=\\\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519;\\\">\\u2192</span> <span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">technical</span><span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">:</span> <span style=\\\"color: #79c0ff;\\\">0.06</span>\\n<span style=\\\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519;\\\">\\u2192</span> <span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">other</span><span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">:</span> <span style=\\\"color: #79c0ff;\\\">0.03</span>\\n\\n<span style=\\\"color: #d2a8ff;\\\">Is</span> <span style=\\\"color: #ff7b72;\\\">this</span> <span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">urgent</span><span style=\\\"color: #c9d1d9;\\\">?</span>\\n<span style=\\\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519;\\\">\\u2192</span> <span style=\\\"color: #79c0ff;\\\">0.96</span></code></pre></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Jev makes the 