in history.&quot; The target launch date is July 22. And when it drops, the window to position quietly will already be closing. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Most investors will hear about this after the stock has moved. You don&#39;t have to be one of them. Our analyst named <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>3 stocks</span></a> positioned to ride the launch \\u2014 with entry guidance, price targets, a bonus 4th supply-chain pick, and a 3-phase playbook for when to buy, add, and take profits. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>See the 3 stocks now.</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><b>#AD 2</b></p></td></tr><tr><td id=\\\"tired-of-news-that-feels-like-noise\\\" class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;\\\"><h3 style=\\\"color:#000000;font-weight:400;\\\">Tired of news that feels like noise?</h3></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"> Every day, 4.5 million readers turn to <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>1440</span></a> for their factual news fix. We sift through 100+ sources to bring you a complete summary of politics, global events, business, and culture \\u2014 all in a brief 5-minute email. No spin. No slant. Just clarity. </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"dd\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\"><p style=\\\"\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"><span>Join for free today!</span></a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"16\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:16px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;width:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"24.0px\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:24.0px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td></td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"b\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#030712\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color: #FFFFFF;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#B8EF43\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td><span style=\\\"padding-left:1px;\\\"></span></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"tw\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/x_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"ig\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/instagram_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"yt\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/youtube_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" style=\\\"width:75px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;\\\"><img width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" alt=\\\"in\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:22px;color:Dark;\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/static_assets/linkedin_dark.png\\\"></a></td><td><span style=\\\"padding-left:1px;\\\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"10\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;height:10px;\\\"> &nbsp; </td></tr><tr><td class=\\\"w\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding:15px 15px 15px 15px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><tbody><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\"><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> Update your email preferences or unsubscribe <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#FFFFFF!important;color:#FFFFFF!important;\\\"> here</a></p><p class=\\\"copyright\\\" style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> &copy; 2026 Staying Ahead with AI </p><p style=\'font-family:\\\"Verdana\\\",Geneva,sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF!important;\'> 228 Park Ave S, #29976, New York, New York 10003, United States </p></td></tr><tr style=\\\"display: table-row !important;\\\"><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:20px;\\\"><table role=\\\"none\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"display:table !important;\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"display:table-row !important;\\\"><td class=\\\"u\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"middle\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" style=\\\"height:32px;display:table-cell !important; max-height: 32px !important;margin:0px !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;\\\"><a style=\\\"line-height:32px !important;text-decoration:none;display:block !important;\\\" href=\\\"https://link.mail.beehiiv.\\\"><img width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" alt=\\\"beehiiv logo\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block !important;max-width:16px !important;vertical-align:-3px !important;width:16px !important;height:16px !important;\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" src=\\\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=pad,format=png,onerror=redirect,quality=100,width=16,height=16,gravity=center,background=transparent,dpr=2/output-onlinepngtools.png\\\"><span style=\\\"padding-left:11px !important;display: inline-block !important;\\\">Powered by beehiiv</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://hp.beehiiv.com/1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr><tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" height=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"height:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://email.beehiivstatus.com/be06530fa3aaab9bd13a078ae8f46166ecfedcae/hclick\\\" style=\\\"color: #030712 !important; cursor: default; font-size: 1px; text-decoration: none;\\\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\",\n \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:45.652833\",\n \"delivery_status\": \"\",\n \"docstatus\": 0,\n \"doctype\": \"Communication\",\n \"email_account\": \"sales\",\n \"email_status\": \"Open\",\n \"email_template\": null,\n \"feedback_request\": null,\n \"has_attachment\": 0,\n \"idx\": 0,\n \"imap_folder\": null,\n \"in_reply_to\": null,\n \"message_id\": \"20260921.125449.65e24b41@mta10\",\n \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:45.911379\",\n \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n \"name\": \"a90d2b19lq\",\n \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"phone_no\": null,\n \"rating\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient\": 0,\n \"read_by_recipient_on\": null,\n \"read_receipt\": 0,\n \"recipients\": \"\\\"raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com\\\" <raiaayushhectocorn2029@gmail.com>\",\n \"reference_doctype\": \"CRM Lead\",\n \"reference_name\": \"CRM-LEAD-2026-00035\",\n \"reference_owner\": \"Administrator\",\n \"seen\": 0,\n \"send_after\": null,\n \"sender\": \"vaibhav@outskillwithai.com\",\n \"sender_full_name\": \"Vaibhav Sisinty\",\n \"sent_or_received\": \"Received\",\n \"status\": \"Linked\",\n \"subject\": \"JEV JEV JEV\",\n \"text_content\": \"----------\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/06e9e26b-31e3-41b9-8d33-1e4fc1dccda7/Frame_2147225035.png?t=1785742897)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\n\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\nIf you picked the first one, you\'re in good company. It\'s what most AI apps do, and it looks something like this:\\n\\n```\\nconst response = await llm.generate(`\\n  Read this support ticket.\\n  Figure out which department it belongs to.\\n  Decide if it\'s urgent.\\n  Estimate how frustrated the customer is.\\n  Return JSON.\\n`);\\n```\\nThen you wait for tokens to stream > parse the JSON > validate it > use 3 values out of it.\\n\\nYou just spun up a full generative model to make 3 small decisions, and most of that machinery went to waste. (If you picked a chain of prompts or a trained classifier instead, you\'re already circling the idea here.)\\n\\nTypeSafe AI reckons **that\'s the wrong tool** for the job, and last week they shipped their answer: **Jev**, the first of what they\'re calling \\\"System One\\\" models.\\u00a0\\n\\nInstead of writing text, Jev takes some state and answers typed questions with probabilities.\\n\\n**state + questions \\u2192 probabilities \\u2192 code**\\n\\nYou can think of it as a semantic if-statement. It reads the messy human context, makes the call, and hands your code a clean number to branch on.\\n\\nVisual explanation here (https://x.com/NielsRogge/status/2100239244501430438)\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n## **What does Jev do?**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nYou hand it some state:\\n\\n```\\n{\\n  message: \\\"I was charged twice. Fix this ASAP.\\\",\\n  accountTier: \\\"business\\\"\\n}\\n```\\nThen you define the judgments you need. Jev gives you three primitives to work with:\\n\\n**Choice** \\u2192 pick one option\\n**Score**\\u00a0 \\u2192 place something on an ordered scale\\n**Noul** \\u00a0 \\u2192 answer a yes/no question as a probability\\n\\nFor example:\\n\\n```\\nWhich team owns this?\\n\\u2192 billing: 0.91\\n\\u2192 technical: 0.06\\n\\u2192 other: 0.03\\n\\nIs this urgent?\\n\\u2192 0.96\\n```\\nJev makes the judgment; your code decides what to do with it.\\u00a0\\n\\n**Now, let\'s build something.**\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **A support-ticket router**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nInstall the SDK:\\n\\n```\\nnpm install @typesafe-ai/sdk\\n```\\nSet up your client and some state:\\n\\n```\\nimport { TypeSafeClient, choice, score, noul } from \\\"@typesafe-ai/sdk\\\";\\nconst client = new TypeSafeClient();\\nconst ticket = {\\n  message:\\n    \\\"Stripe has been broken for three days. \\\" +\\n    \\\"Payments are failing and we\'re losing sales.\\\",\\n  customer: { plan: \\\"business\\\", lifetimeValue: 4800 },\\n};\\n```\\nSpell out the decisions you care about:\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/08da461a-4bd9-431d-99a6-7d8a161be743/Frame_2147225141.png?t=1789978137)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n\\nBack comes something like department.choice = \\\"technical\\\" with the full probability spread, and urgency.noul = 0.98.\\u00a0\\n\\nFrom there your application logic looks like it always has:\\n\\n```\\nconst department = result.answers.department;\\nconst urgency = result.answers.urgency.noul;\\n\\nif (department.confidence < 0.6) return sendToHuman(ticket);\\nif (urgency > 0.9) return escalate(ticket);\\nreturn routeToTeam(department.choice, ticket);\\n```\\nNo generated function call, JSON repair loop, or model deciding your business policy. Jev makes the small fuzzy calls and your code handles everything deterministic.\\n\\n\\n----------\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n----------\\n## **Ask everything upfront**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nThis is where it gets fun.\\u00a0\\n\\nSay refundRequested only matters for billing tickets. The instinct with a normal LLM is to stage it: classify the ticket, wait, then ask about the refund only if it turned out to be billing.\\n\\nJev nudges you to ask everything at once and ignore the answers you don\'t need.\\n\\n```\\nquestions: {\\n  department: choice(...),\\n  refundRequested: noul(...),\\n  urgency: noul(...),\\n  churnRisk: noul(...),\\n  frustration: score(...),\\n}\\n```\\nTypeSafe calls this **speculative fan-out**.\\n\\nEvery question runs against the same state in parallel, so you drop the long chains of serial calls, and their docs show batching 13 questions coming out faster and cheaper than firing them one by one.\\u00a0\\n\\nOnce it clicks, you stop thinking in pipelines and start thinking in one wide question.\\n\\n\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/ff97b1ed-776f-4905-82be-2a3e23851eda/Frame_2147225140.png?t=1789975474)\\nCaption: \\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n## **Confidence becomes useful application state**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nMost LLM code throws away uncertainty.\\n\\nYou get department = billing and move on. But billing at 0.97 (technical at 0.02) and billing at 0.38 (technical at 0.35) both give you the same answer, and only one of them is safe to automate.\\n\\nJev keeps that uncertainty around, so you can bake it straight into the product:\\n\\n```\\nif (answer.confidence > 0.9) { automate(); }\\nelse if (answer.confidence > 0.6) { askForConfirmation(); }\\nelse { sendToHuman(); }\\n```\\nYour thresholds depend on the stakes: filing an email into a folder and issuing a refund deserve very different levels of nerve.\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n## **What people are already building**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nJev is barely a week old and the community has completely run with it. The range is wild.\\n\\nOn the serious end, people are using it as a cheap judgment layer inside bigger systems.\\n\\nAgent routing is the obvious one: before you send every request to an expensive reasoning model, ask a few nouls first, and only spin up the heavy stuff that\'s needed.\\n\\n```\\n{\\n  needsReasoning: noul(...),\\n  needsWeb: noul(...),\\n  needsCode: noul(...),\\n  intent: choice(...),\\n}\\n```\\nOthers use it to check their own LLM output (\\\"did this answer the question? does it make claims it can\'t back up?\\\"), letting the generative model stay creative while Jev grades its work.\\n\\nThe Browser Use team wired it into an agent that books flights in seconds for fractions of a cent, and Vercel benchmarked it as the safety reviewer inside its fx coding tool and is moving it to the default, up to 18x faster than the model it replaced.\\n\\nMy favorite of the practical bunch is semantic database fields: run your conversations through Jev to get columns like churn_risk = 0.61 and purchase_intent = 0.91, then query them with plain SQL.\\n\\n```\\nSELECT * FROM conversations\\nWHERE purchase_intent > 0.8 AND pricing_sensitivity > 0.7;\\n```\\nI also saw someone [ship a Chrome extension that](https://github.com/itsaam/slop-detector) scores your X timeline and blurs the AI slop as you scroll, while [someone else built one](https://github.com/valentynkit/jev-skip) that skips YouTube sponsor segments with no crowd-sourced database.\\n\\nTypeSafe themselves have Jev playing Doom at about 10 decisions a second and racing across Wikipedia by choosing between hundreds of links, and people have since had it play Tetris, run NPCs that judge you, and play Smash Bros. against itself.\\n\\n\\n\\nTweet:  (https://twitter.com/CompleteSkeptic/status/2099925687465570372)\\n\\n\\n\\n**Personally I want to try it on coding-agent tool routing, browser-agent guardrails, email prioritization, moderation queues, and semantic observability for agents.**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n## **My take**\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\nWe\'ve spent the last couple of years shoving nearly every AI problem through the same shape: **messages \\u2192 model \\u2192 text**, even when all we wanted was a boolean, a category, a score, or a probability.\\n\\nWe paid for a whole essay to get one number.\\u00a0\\n\\nJev makes those outputs first-class without pretending to replace reasoning models.\\n\\nThere\'s a mountain of production code out there running llm.generate, then JSON.parse, then if, where the model is doing far more work than the app needs.\\n\\nThat last if is where Jev gets interesting, and I think a lot of us are about to swap it in.\\n\\n\\u201cThat\'s it for this one. If you build something weird with Jev, send it my way.\\u201c \\u2014 \\n\\nUntil then, \\n**Vaibhav** \\ud83e\\udd1d\\ud83c\\udffb\\n\\n\\n--------------------\\n**If you read till here, you might find this interesting**\\n\\n**#AD 1**\\n\\n### Elon\'s Building Something in Tesla\'s Secret Labs.\\n\\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f7ece0d2-7eb9-4dcb-a1f3-29eaccdca25f/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_23__2026__01_10_43_PM.png?t=1782247930)\\nFollow image link: (https://goodmorningalerts.com/elons-iphone?utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_source=beehiiv&htrafficsource=beehiiv&_bhiiv=opp_41559b34-c190-4612-bd08-f55b22de4760_8048da61&bhcl_id=8bd1630d-21e4-4225-981c-122225694da6_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\nCaption: \\n\\nSomething is being built inside Tesla\'s facilities that almost no one is talking about \\u2014 yet.\\n\\nAccording to insider sources, Elon Musk has quietly developed a [breakthrough product](https://goodmorningalerts.com/elons-iphone?utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_source=beehiiv&htrafficsource=beehiiv&_bhiiv=opp_41559b34-c190-4612-bd08-f55b22de4760_8048da61&bhcl_id=8bd1630d-21e4-4225-981c-122225694da6_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) he claims will be \\\"10x bigger than the largest product in history.\\\" The target launch date is July 22. And when it drops, the window to position quietly will already be closing.\\n\\nMost investors will hear about this after the stock has moved. You don\'t have to be one of them. Our analyst named [3 stocks](https://goodmorningalerts.com/elons-iphone?utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_source=beehiiv&htrafficsource=beehiiv&_bhiiv=opp_41559b34-c190-4612-bd08-f55b22de4760_8048da61&bhcl_id=8bd1630d-21e4-4225-981c-122225694da6_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) positioned to ride the launch \\u2014 with entry guidance, price targets, a bonus 4th supply-chain pick, and a 3-phase playbook for when to buy, add, and take profits.\\n\\n[See the 3 stocks now.](https://goodmorningalerts.com/elons-iphone?utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_source=beehiiv&htrafficsource=beehiiv&_bhiiv=opp_41559b34-c190-4612-bd08-f55b22de4760_8048da61&bhcl_id=8bd1630d-21e4-4225-981c-122225694da6_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n**#AD 2**\\n\\n### Tired of news that feels like noise?\\n\\nEvery day, 4.5 million readers turn to [1440](https://l.join1440.com/bh?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_content=prospecting_tired&_bhiiv=opp_dcc61798-7c67-450a-b3a3-27ece411e056_1b75ca79&bhcl_id=0c07b0ce-7d23-42eb-8725-e4009cd3d214_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b) for their factual news fix. We sift through 100+ sources to bring you a complete summary of politics, global events, business, and culture \\u2014 all in a brief 5-minute email. No spin. No slant. Just clarity.\\n\\n[Join for free today!](https://l.join1440.com/bh?utm_source=beehiiv&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=8AWZ8QR5IO&utm_content=prospecting_tired&_bhiiv=opp_dcc61798-7c67-450a-b3a3-27ece411e056_1b75ca79&bhcl_id=0c07b0ce-7d23-42eb-8725-e4009cd3d214_1ecd4f85-bc08-4bd0-a10f-628117366dd4_ef7bc386-7a60-4bb7-a72a-41016dc7825b)\\n\\n\\n----------\\n\\u2014\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\nYou are reading a plain text version of this post. For the best experience, copy and paste this link in your browser to view the post online:\\nhttps://newsletter.stayingahead.com/p/jev-jev-jev\",\n \"timeline_links\": [\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-09-21 18:24:49\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:46.099039\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Vaibhav\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:46.099039\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"a943rmr3cp\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"a90d2b19lq\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"communication_date\": \"2026-09-21 18:24:49\",\n   \"creation\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:46.099552\",\n   \"docstatus\": 0,\n   \"doctype\": \"Communication Link\",\n   \"idx\": 2,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Contact\",\n   \"link_name\": \"Raiaayushhectocorn2029\",\n   \"link_title\": \"\",\n   \"modified\": \"2026-10-17 16:11:46.099552\",\n   \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"name\": \"a94mniksfb\",\n   \"owner\": \"Administrator\",\n   \"parent\": \"a90d2b19lq\",\n   \"parentfield\": \"timeline_links\",\n   \"parenttype\": \"Communication\"\n  }\n ],\n \"uid\": 1940,\n \"unread_notification_sent\": 0,\n \"user\": \"Administrator\"\n}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('oa2ql3qr4k','2026-10-17 16:35:42.648747','2026-10-17 16:35:42.648747','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'a96je2qpem','Communication',0,'','{\n \"_user_tags\": null,\n \"bcc\": null,\n \"cc\": null,\n \"comment_type\": \"\",\n \"communication_date\": \"2026-09-22 02:14:05\",\n \"communication_medium\": \"Email\",\n \"communication_type\": \"Communication\",\n \"content\": \"\\n\\n\\n\\n    <!--[if gte mso 15]&amp;gt;\\n    &amp;lt;xml&amp;gt;\\n        &amp;lt;o:OfficeDocumentSettings&amp;gt;\\n            &amp;lt;o:AllowPNG/&amp;gt;\\n            &amp;lt;o:PixelsPerInch&amp;gt;96&amp;lt;/o:PixelsPerInch&amp;gt;\\n        &amp;lt;/o:OfficeDocumentSettings&amp;gt;\\n    &amp;lt;/xml&amp;gt;\\n    &amp;lt;![endif]-->\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n    <meta content=\\\"IE=edge\\\">\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\n    <meta name=\\\"format-detection\\\" content=\\\"telephone=no\\\">\\n    <title>\\n        New jobs for 22 September    </title>\\n\\n    <style type=\\\"text/css\\\">\\n        body,\\n        div,\\n        a,\\n        td,\\n        h1,\\n        h2,\\n        h3,\\n        h4,\\n        h5,\\n        h6,\\n        center,\\n        span,\\n        li {\\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\n            letter-spacing: -0.1px;\\n            margin-bottom: 0;\\n            margin-top: 0;\\n            margin: 0;\\n            margin: 0em;\\n            margin-top: 0em;\\n            margin-bottom: 0em;\\n        }\\n\\n        p img {\\n            display: inline !important;\\n        }\\n\\n        \\n        @media screen {\\n            @font-face {\\n                font-family: \'Inter\';\\n                font-style: normal;\\n                font-weight: 300;\\n                font-display: swap;\\n                src: local(\'Inter Light\'), local(\'Inter-Light\'), url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa1ZL7.woff2) format(\'woff2\');\\n      